<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">Doometsaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Doometsaa Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Doometsaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dom.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Doometsaa Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha mas'aafay «Doometsaa» geetettiide s'eesetteedda gaasuu yewuwaa ubbaa doometsaa bessiyaa diraassa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Doometsaabaa geetettiyaa mas'aafay ha alamii wooti med'etteeddentto: salotuunne sa'ay med'etteedda med'etaabaa, asaa zarii yeedda yuussaabaa, nagaraanne nagaraa maarotaabaa, anjjuunne shek'ay doometteedda doometsaabaa, S'oossaannanne asaa zaratuwaanna de'iyaa gaketetsaabaa odee. Doometsaabay laa"u huup'e gishuwaan shaakettiide s'eelettanaw danddayee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shemppuwaa ittuwaappe biide tammanne ittuwaa gakkanaw de'iyaa sa'ay, saluunne sa'ay med'etteedda med'etaabaanne asaa zariyaa koyro taarikiyaa odee. Addaamenne Hewaani taarikii, K'aayeelanne Aabeela taarikii, Nohenne bashshaa haatsaa taarikii, hewaadankka Baabloone Gimbbiyaa taarikii de'iyaawe ha shaakuwaana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shemppuwaa tammanne laa"uwaappe biide ishatamuwaa gakkanaw de'iyaa sa'ay Israa'eeliyaa asaw beni mayza aawotuwaa taarikiyaa odee. Unttuttu gidduwaan koyro bare ammanuwaaninne S'oossaw azazettiyaa hanotaan eretteeddawe Abrahaama. Hewaappe k'ay Aa na'aa Yisaak'a, Aa na'aa na'aa Yaak'oobanne Yaak'ooba naanaa tammanne laa"atuwaa taarikii kaalleedda. Hawanttu Yaak'ooba naanay tammanne laa"atuu, tammanne laa"u Israa'eeliyaa zaretoo ano gideeddawantta. Hawanttu ha tammanne laa"u Israa'eeliyaa naanatuwaa giddonkka Yooseefa dummayiide, hewaaddankka k'ay Yaak'oobanne Aa naanaa yenkkotuwaa unttuttu golle asaana Gibs'e gadiyaa afeedda hanotatuwaa minissiide s'eellee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha mas'aafay asaa taarikiyaa odiyaawaa gidooppenne, ubbaappe aatsiide I odiyaawe S'oossay ootseedda oosuwaabaa. S'oossay salotuwaanne sa'aa med'd'eedda taarikiyaa oduwaa doommiide S'oossay bare asaw k'oppiyaawaa aggennawaa odiyaa hidootaan polee. Ha mas'aafaa giddon ha gas'aappe ya gas'aa gakkanaw odettiyaa taarikiyaa Goday, balabaa haniyaawantta pirddiyaawenne muriyaawe, bare asaa kaaletsiyaawenne maaddiyaawe, unttuttu taarikiyaa tangguwaakka giigissiyaawe bare huup'iyaan S'oossaa. Hawe beni mas'aafay s'aafetteeddawe asaa ammanuwaa taarikiyaa mazggabiide oyk'k'anaassanne he ammanuukka pas'a de'anaadan ootsanaassa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Med'etaa Doometsaabaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 1:1-2:3">1:1—2:3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Eden Gennetiyaabaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 2:4-25">2:4-25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nagaraanne Nagaraa Maarotaabaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-24">3:1-24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Addaamappe Noha Gakkanaw <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 4:1-5:32">4:1—5:32</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nohanne Bashshaa Haatsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-10:32">6:1—10:32</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baabloona Gimbbiyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 11:1-9">11:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Seemappe Abraama Gakkanaw <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 11:10-32">11:10-32</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Abraama, Yisaak'anne Yaak'ooba Taarikiyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-35:29">12:1—35:29</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Eesaa Yeletaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 36:1-43">36:1-43</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yoosefanne Aa Ishatuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 27:1-45:28">27:1—45:28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Israa'eelatuu Gibs'e Gadiyaan <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-50:26">46:1—50:26</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Med'etaa Doometsaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 1:1-2:3">1:1—2:3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />S'oossay salotuwaanne sa'aa koyro med'd'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />He wode sa'ay giigibeennanne ayaynne baynna mela; c'iimmuwaa bollan d'umay de'ee; S'oossaa Ayyaanay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">S'oossaa Ayyaanay: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'oossaa Wolk'k'aa; S'oossaappe gideedda C'arkkuwaa.</char></note> haatsaappe bollanna mayyi utteedda.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />S'oossay hewaappe guyye hawaadan yaagiide haasayeedda; «Poo'uu Hano» yaageedda; poo'uukka haneedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:6">2 K'or. 4:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Poo'uu lo"a gideeddawaa S'oossay be'eedda; yaatiide poo'uwaa d'umaappe shaakkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />S'oossay poo'uwaa «Gallassaa» giide suntseedda; d'umaa «K'ammaa» giide suntseedda. Sa'ay k'ammeeddanne wontteedda; hewenne koyro gallassaa.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6-7" />S'oossay hewaappe guyye hawaadan yaagiide haasayeedda; «Bollanna de'iyaa haatsaa garssanna de'iyaa haatsaappe shaakkiyaa saluwaa guufantsuu hano» yaageedda; geetettowaadankka haneedda. S'oossay saluwaa guufantsuwaa giigissiide, saluwaa guufantsuwaappe bollanna de'iyaa haatsaa garssanna de'iyaa haatsaappe shaakkeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:5">2 P'es'. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />S'oossay he guufantsuwaa «Saluwaa» giide suntseedda. Sa'ay k'ammeeddanne wontteedda; hewenne laa'entso gallassaa.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />S'oossay hewaappe guyye hawaadan yaagiide haasayeedda; «Saluwaappe garssanna de'iyaa haatsay ittisaan eello; mela sa'ay k'onc'c'o» yaageedda; hewaappe guyyiyaan haneedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />S'oossay he mela sa'aa «Biittaa» giide suntseedda; k'ay itti sa'aan eelleedda haatsaa «Abbaa» giide suntseedda. Yaatiide S'oossay hewe lo"a gideeddawaa be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Hewaappe simmiide S'oossay, «Biittay mitsaa maataa dolisso; zeretsaa ayfii de'iyaa katsaanne zeretsaa ayfiyaana de'iyaa teeriyaa mitsaa dolisso» yaageedda; hewekka haneedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Biittay, mitsaa maataa Aa k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan doleedda. S'oossay hewe lo"a gideeddawaa be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Sa'ay k'ammeeddanne wontteedda; hewenne heezzentso gallassaa.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />S'oossay hewaappe guyye hawaadan yaagiide haasayeedda; «Gallassaa k'ammaappe shaakkanaw poo'otuu saluwaa guufantsuwaan hanino; unttuttu gallassaa, wodiyaanne laytsaa erissanaw mallaa gidino; <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />sa'aa bollan poo'issana mala unttuttu saluwaa guufantsuwaan poo'ino» yaageedda; hewaappe guyyiyaan haneedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />S'oossay laa"u wolk'k'aama poo'otuwaa, dariyaawe gallassaa mooddanaadaninne k'eera"iyaawe k'ammaa mooddanaadan med'd'eedda; s'oolinttetuwaakka I med'd'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17-18" />S'oossay unttuttu ha sa'aa bollan poo'issana mala, gallassaanne k'ammaa mooddana malanne poo'uwaa d'umaappe shaakkana mala, saluwaa guufantsuwaan unttuntta wotseedda. Yaatiide S'oossay hewe lo"a gideeddawaa be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Sa'ay k'ammeeddanne wontteedda; hewenne oyddentso gallassaa.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />S'oossay hewaappe guyye hawaadan yaagiide haasayeedda; «De'uwaan de'iyaa dumma dumma med'etatuu haatsaan darino; kafuukka sa'aappe bollananne saluwaa guufantsuwaappe garssana paallo» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Yaatiide S'oossay abbaan de'iyaa wolk'k'aamaa do'atuwaa, haatsaa giddon wos's'i k'aas's'iyaa med'etaa ubbaanne k'efiyaana de'iyaa kafuwaa ubbaa Aa k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan med'd'eedda. S'oossay hewe lo"a gideeddawaa be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />S'oossay unttuntta, «Yelettite; c'orite; abbaa haatsaa kumite; kafuukka biittaa bollan c'oratto» yaagiide anjjeedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Sa'ay k'ammeeddanne wontteedda; hewenne ichcheshentso gallassaa.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />S'oossay hewaappe guyye hawaadan yaagiide haasayeedda; «De'uwaan de'iyaa med'etatuu barenttu k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan: mehetuu, biittaana gooshettiyaa med'etatuunne do'atuu barenttu k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan biittaa bollan kesino» yaageedda; haneedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />S'oossay do'atuwaa unttunttu k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan, mehetuukka unttunttu k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan, biittaana gooshettiyaa med'etatuwaakka ubbaa unttunttu k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan med'd'eedda. S'oossay hewe lo"a gidiyaawaa be'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Hewaappe simmiide S'oossay, «Asaa nu leemisuwaan nuuna malattisiidde ane med'd'oytte; unttunttu abbaa moliyaa, saluwaa kafuwaa, biittaa bolla wos's'i k'aas's'iyaa med'etaa ubbaa mooddino» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Hawaadan S'oossay asaa bare leemisuwaan med'd'eedda; I asaa S'oossaa leemisuwaan med'd'eedda; I unttuntta attuma asaanne mac'c'a asaa ootsiide med'd'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat. 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mar. 10:6</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:1-2">Dom. 5:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />S'oossay unttuntta hawaadan yaagiide anjjeedda; «Yelettite; c'orite; ha sa'aa kumitenne mooddite; abbaa moliyaa, saluwaa kafuwaanne biittaa bolla wos's'i k'aas's'iyaa, de'uwaan de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaa mooddite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Hewaappe simmiide S'oossay, «Be'ite! Taani ha biittaa ubbaa bollan zeretsaa ayfiiyaana de'iyaa katsaa ubbaanne zeretsaa ayfiiyaana de'iyaa teeriyaa mitsaa ubbaa hinttenttoo immaad; unttunttu hinttenttoo k'uma gidana. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />K'aykka ha sa'aan de'iyaa mehiyawunne do'aa ubbaw, saluwaa kafuwaa ubbaw, biittaana gooshettiyaa med'etaa ubbawunne shemppuwaanna de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaw miyaawaa gidanaadan, irs's'a mitsaanne maataa immaad» yaageedda; haneedda. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />S'oossay bare med'd'eedda ubbabaakka s'eelleedda; daro lo"a gideeddawaa be'eedda. Sa'ay k'ammeeddanne wontteedda; hewenne usuppuntso gallassaa.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Salotuunne sa'ay unttunttun de'iyaawe ubbabay hawaadan med'etti poletteedda. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />S'oossay bare ootseedda oosuwaa usuppuntsa gallassi poliide, bare ootseedda oosuwaa ubbaappe laappuntsa gallassi shemppeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:4">Ibr. 4:4</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 4:10">10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />K'ay S'oossay laappuntsa gallassaa anjjeeddanne geeshsha ootseedda; ayaw gooppe, S'oossay bare ootsiyaa oosuwaa wurssiide shemppeeddawe he gallassaana.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edene Gennetiyaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 2:4-25">2:4-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Saluunne sa'ay med'etteeddawe hawaadaana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Med'inaa Goday S'oossay sa'aanne saluwaanne med'd'eedda wode, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />sa'aa bollan mitsaynne maatay dolibeenna; c'arshshaynne c'aaribeenna; ayaw gooppe, Med'ina Goday S'oossay iraa bukkissibeenna; k'ay biittaa ootsiyaa asaykka baawa. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Gidooppenne sa'aappe haatsay pude kesiide, biittaa ubbaa irs's'issee. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Hewaappe guyye, Med'inaa Goday S'oossay biittaa baanaappe itti asaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asaa: «Asaa» guussay Ibraawatuwaa k'aalaan «Addaama» geetettee; «Addaama» guussay «Biittaa» guussaa; hewoo laa"u k'aalatuu ittuu ittuwaa malatiino.</char></note> med'd'iide Aa siid'iyaan de'uwaa shemppuwaa shemppi gelisseedda; yaatina bitanii de'uwaan de'iyaa asaa gideedda.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Med'inaa Goday S'oossay away doliyaa baggana Edene giyaa sa'aan gennetiyaa tokkeedda; yan bare med'd'eedda bitaniyaa wotseedda. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Med'inaa Goday S'oossay s'eellanaw lo"iyaa, maanawukka mal"iyaa ubbaa k'ommo mitsaa biittaappe doliseedda. Gennetiyaa gidduwaan de'uwaa mitsaanne lo'uwaanne iitaa erissiyaa mitsaa wotseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Sas'. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">22:2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:14">14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Gennetiyaa ushshiyaa shaafaa haatsay Edeneppe goggee. Edeneppe keseeddawaappe guyye, oyddu shaafaa kes shaakettee. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Koyro shaafaa suntsay Pisoona; Pisooni work'k'ay de'iyaa Ewulaas'a giyaa biittaa ubbaa bollan goggee. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />He biittaa work'k'ay geeshsha work'k'aa; k'ay al"o shittuunne loytsi lo"iyaa shuchchay yan de'ee. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Laa"entso shaafaa suntsay Giyoona; Giyooni Top'p'iyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Top'p'iyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawatuwaa Mas'aafaan «Kuushi» geetettee. Hewekka Gibs'e gadiyaa dugehaa, ha"i de'iyaa Top'p'iyaa gadiyaanne Sudaane gadiyaa guussa.</char></note> biittaa ubbaa bollan goggee. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Heezzentso shaafaa suntsay S'egiroosa; S'egiroosi Asooreppe away doliyaa baggana goggee. K'ay oyddentso shaafay Efiraas'iisa.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Bitanii Edene Gennetiyaa ootsana malanne naagana mala, Med'inaa Goday S'oossay Aa afiide wotseedda. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Med'inaa Goday S'oossay bitaniyaa, «Gennetiyaa mitsaa teeraa ubbaappe neeni maana gooppe ma; <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />shin lo"uwaanne iitaa erissiyaa mitsaa teeraappe mooppa; ayaw gooppe, neeni aappe meedda gallassi tumu hayk'k'ana» yaagiide azazeedda.<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Hewaappe guyye Med'inaa Goday S'oossay, «Bitanii barekka de'iyaawe lo"a gidenna; taani aw injjetiyaanonne Aa maaddiyaano med'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Med'inaa Goday S'oossay mehetuwaa ubbaa, do'atuwaa ubbaanne saluwaa kafotuwaa ubbaa biittaappe med'd'eedda; k'ay bitanii unttuntta waagi suntsanenttonne be'anaw aakko aheedda; bitanii de'uwaan de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaa suntseedda suntsay unttunttu suntsaa gidiide atteedda. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Hewaadan bitanii mehetuwaa ubbaa, saluwaa kafotuwaanne bazuwaa do'atuwaa ubbaa suntseedda; shin Addaamaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Addaama: Ibraawattu k'aalaan «Addaama» giyaa suntsay «Asaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> injjetiyaanne Aa maaddiyaawe beettibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Hewaa diraw Med'inaa Goday S'oossay bitaniyaa gem"ishshuwaa kayroyeedda; I gem"ishshuwaa kayrotti de'ishshin, Aa miyyiyaa mek'etsaappe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miyyiyaa mek'etsaappe: Addaama miyye ashuwaappe aketeeddawaa guussaa.</char></note> ittuwaa akkiidde, he sa'aa ashuwaa kuntseedda. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Med'inaa Goday S'oossay bitaniyaappe akkeedda mek'etsaa mac'c'aano ootseedda; yaatiide izo bitaniyaakko aheedda. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Yaatina bitanii, «Hayanaasho! Ha mek'etsatta ta mek'etsaappe, ha ashattakka ta ashuwaappe aketteeddawunno; izakka attuma asaappe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Attuma asaa: guussay Ibraawatuwaa k'aalan «Ishi» geetettee; «Mac'c'a asaa» guussay «Ishah» geetettee; hewoo laa"u k'aalatuu ittuu ittuwaa malatiino.</char></note> aketeedda diraw, mac'c'awunno geetettu» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Hewaa diraw Asay bare aawuwaanne bare aatto aggiide, bare machchattinna ittippe de'ana; unttunttu laa"u itti asho gidanawantta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:7-8">Mar. 10:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:16">1 K'or. 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31">Efe. 5:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Bitaniinne Aa machatanne laa"attukka kallo s'iira de'ino; shin ittuu ittoo yeellattikkino.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nagaraanne Nagaraa maarotaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 3:1-24">3:1-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Shooshshay Med'inaa Goday S'oossay med'd'eedda do'aa ubbaappe aad'd'eedda genanchcha. Itti gallassi shooshshay he mishiratto, «S'oossay tumu hinttentta, ‹Gennetiyaan de'iyaa mitsaa teeraa ubbaappe mooppite› geeddee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:9">Sas'. 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:2">20:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2-3" />Mishirata shooshshaw zaaraade, «Tuytti, S'oossay hawaadan gibeenna; nuuni gennetiyaan de'iyaa mitsatuwaa teeraa maanaw danddayeetto; shin S'oossay nuuna, Gennetiyaa gidduwaan de'iyaa mitsaa teeraa mooppite; bochchoppite; hewe d'ayooppe hinttenttu hayk'k'anita geedda» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 3:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Shooshshay mishiratto, «Tuytti, hinttenttu ayine hayk'k'ikitta; <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />S'oossay hewaa geeddawe, he mitsaa teeraa hinttenttu mooppe, hinttenttu ayfii dooyettina, lo"uwaanne iitaa S'oossaadan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">S'oossaadan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'oossatuwaadan.</char></note> hinttenttu eranawaa I eriyaa diraassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Mishirata he mitsaa teeray maanaw mal"iyaawaa, s'eellanaw lo"iyaawaa, k'ay Asay aad'd'eedda eraa demmanaw amoyiyaawaa gidiyaawaa be'aaddu; he mitsaa teeraappe akkaade maaddu; k'ay barenana de'iyaa bare asinawukka hewaappe immina, ikka meedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Hewaappe unttunttu laa"uwaa ayfiikka dooyetteedda; yaatina unttunttu barenttoo kallo s'iira de'iyaawaa ereeddino; balasiyaa giyaa mitsaa haytsaa sikkiide, barenttoo k'antsaan danc'c'eeddino.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Sa'ay omarsseedda wode, gennetiyaa gidduwaan Med'inaa Goday S'oossay hamettishin, Aa kooshshaa bitaniinne Aa machata siseeddino; unttunttu gennetiyaa mitsaa giddon Med'inaa Godaa S'oossaappe k'osetteeddinno. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Shin Med'inaa Goday S'oossay bitaniyaa s'eesiide, «Addaamaa, hak'an de'ay?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Bitanii, «Gennetiyaa gidduwaan ne kooshshaa sisaadde, taani kallo de'iyaa diraw, yayaade k'osettaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Med'ina Goday S'oossay Aa, « ‹Neeni kallo de'aasa› giide new odeeddawe oonee? Taani neena, ‹Mooppa› gaade azazeedda mitsaa teeraappe maadiyyee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Shin I, «Taananna de'anaadan neeni immeedda mac'c'awunna he mitsaa teeraappe taw immina maad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Med'inaa Goday S'oossay hewaappe guyye machchatto, «Neeni hewaa ayaw ootsaad?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">2 K'or. 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:14">1 S'im. 2:14</ref></char></note> yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Mishirata, «Taana shooshshay c'immina maad» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">S'oossaa Pirddaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Med'inaa Goday S'oossay hewaappe guyye shooshshaa, «Neeni hawaa ootseedda diraw, mehiyaa ubbaanne do'aa ubbaa garssan ne s'alalay shek'k'etteeddawaa! Neeni ne uluwaan biittaana gooshettana; ne de'uwaa laytsaa ubbaan baanaa laac'c'ana. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Taani neenanne mishirato, ne zeretsaanne izi zeretsaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Izi zeretsaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Unttunttu zeretsaa.</char></note> morkke kessana; I ne huup'iyaa k'os's'ana; neenikka Aa ginddiyaa dukkanaassa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Sas'. 12:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Mishirattokka Med'inaa Goday S'oossay, «Ne shahaaro wode daro tuggatana; k'ay neeni wolk'k'aama oytsan naanaa yelana. Gidooppenne neeni ne asinaana de'anaw amottana; I neena mooddana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Bitaniyaakka Med'inaa Goday S'oossay hawaadan yaageedda; «Neeni ne machchatti oduwaa siseedda dirawunne taani neena, ‹He mitsaa teeraa mooppa› gaade azazeedda mitsaa ayfiyaa neeni meedda diraw, biittay ne gaasuwaan shek'etteeddawaa gido! Neeni ne de'uwaa laytsaa ubbaan wolk'k'aama daaburan biittaa goshaadde maana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:8">Ibr. 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Biittay new aguntsaanne kashiyaa dolana; neeni woran doleeddawaa maana. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Neeni biittaw simmana gakkanaw, daaburan ne som"i c'awattina ootseedda ne k'umaa maana; ayaw gooppe, neeni biittaappe aketaadda; neeni baana; neeni baanaw simmana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Addaame bare machchatto Hewaano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hewaano: Ha suntsaa biletsay «De'iyaanno» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseedda; ayaw gooppe, iza de'uwaan de'iyaa asaa ubbaw aatto.<verse eid="GEN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Med'inaa Goday S'oossay Addaamawunne Aa machatiw c'alaa giigissiide unttuntta mayzzeedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Hewaappe guyye Med'inaa Goday S'oossay, «Simmi Asay nuuppe ittuwaadan lo"uwaanne iitaa eriyaawaa gideedda. I bare kushiyaa yeddiide, de'uwaa mitsaappe akkiidde, k'ay meenna malanne med'inaw de'uwaan de'enna mala te'ettanaw koshshee» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Hewaa diraw, I bare aketeedda biittaa ootsana mala, Med'ina Goday S'oossay Edene Gennetiyaappe Aa keseedda. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Aa kesi diggiide, de'uwaa mitsaakko afiyaa ogiyaa naagana mala, kiruubeela giyaa kiitanchchatuwaanne aad'd'i aad'd'i wod'd'iyaa tamaa lac'uwaa mashshaa Edene Gennetiyaappe away doliyaa baggana wotseedda.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="ms">Addaamappe Noha Gakkanaw</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="GEN 4:1-5:32">Dom. 4:1—5:32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">K'aayeelanne Aabeela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Addaami bare machchatti Hewaanina ak'eeda; iza shahaaro wode attuma na'aa yelaaddu; «Med'inaa Goday taana maaddina, attuma na'aa demmaad» gaade Aa K'aayeela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'aayeela: Ibraawetso k'aalaan «K'ayin» geetettee. Biletsay «Demmaad» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />K'ay Aa ishaa Aabeela yelaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:2">Aabeeli dorssaa heemmee; k'ay K'aayeeli biittaa goshee. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Unddenna wodiyaappe guyye, K'aayeeli bare gaden doliyaa katsaappe Med'inaa Godaw yarshshuwaa yarshsheedda; <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />shin Aabeeli bare dorssaa wudiyaa giddon bayira yeletteedda maratuwaappe akki shukkiide, unttunttu ashuwaappe mod'd'iyaawaa yarshsheedda. Med'inaa Goday Aabeelanne Aa yarshshuwaa akkeedda;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Ibr. 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />shin K'aayeelanne Aa yarshshuwaa akibeenna. Hewaa diraw, K'aayeeli loytsi yiloteedda; bare deemuwaakka d'umisseedda.<verse eid="GEN 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Yaatina Med'inaa Goday K'aayeela, «Ayaw yilotay? Ne deemuukka ayaw d'umeedee? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Neeni lo"obaa ootsowaa gidintto, ne som"i pashikkennee?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ne som"i pashikkennee? </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta ne yarshshuwaa akkanashin.</char></note> Shin neeni lo"obaa ootsana d'ayooppe, nagaray do'aadan ne penggiyaan muggee; I neena mooddana koyee; shin neeni Aa s'oonana bessee» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Hewaappe guyye, K'aayeeli bare ishaa Aabeela, «Ane dembbaa boytte» yaageedda. Unttunttu dembban de'ishshin, K'aayeeli bare ishaa Aabeela bolla denddiide wod'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat. 23:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luk'. 11:51</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12">1 Yoh. 3:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Med'inaa Goday K'aayeela, «Ne ishay Aabeeli hak'anee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">K'aayeeli zaariide, «Taani erikke; ta ishaa naagiyaawe taaneeyye?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Med'inaa Goday K'aayeela, «Hawaa ayaw ootsaad? Be'a; ne ishaa suutsay biittaappe taakko waassee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Ibr. 12:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Ne kushiyaappe ne ishaa suutsaa akkiide, mittanaw hanggeedda biittaappe ha"i neeni shek'etteeddawaa. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Neeni goshinakka biittay new ayfena; betiyaadan neeni sa'aa bollan toyilakattanaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />K'aayeeli Med'inaa Godaa, «Poora! Neeni taana muriyaa muray taani ubbakka danddayennawaa. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Hekko neeni taana hachche ha biittaappe yederssaassa; taani ne sintsaappe k'osettana; betiyaadan taani sa'aa bollan toyilakattana; taana demmowe ooninne wod'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Med'inaa Goday Aa, «Neena ooninne wod'ena; wod'ooppe, ne haluwaa aan laappun kushiyaa kesana» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw, demmowe ooninne Aa wod'enaadan Med'inaa Goday Aa bolla malaataa wotseedda. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />K'aayeeli Med'inaa Godaa sintsaappe kesiide, Edene baggaappe away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa Nooda biittaan de'eeddino.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nood: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa birshshetsay «Toyilakattiyaa sa'aa» giyaawaa giyaa gadiyaan de'eedda.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">K'aayeela Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />K'aayeeli bare machchattina ak'eeda; Iza shahaaro wode Heenooka yelaaddu. K'aayeeli katamaa he wode kees's'iide, he katamaa bare na'aa suntsan «Heenooka» giide suntseedda. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Heenooki Iraada yeleedda; Iraadi Mahuyaa'eela yeleedda; Mahuyaa'eeli Matushaa'eela yeleedda; Matushaa'eeli Laameeka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Laameeki Aadonne S'iilo giyaa laa"u machatuwaa dawutsaa akkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Aada Yaabaala yelaaddu; Yaabaali mehiyaa mooddiyaa, dunkkaaniyaan de'iyaa asatuwaa aawuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Aa ishaa suntsay Yuubaala; Yuubaali k'ay diitsaa diis's'iyaanne uldduudiyaa punniyaa asatuwaa ubbaa aawuwaa; <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />S'iila k'ay Tubaalik'ayna giyaa na'aa yelaaddu; Tubaalik'ayni nahaasiyaappenne birataappe dumma dumma miishshatuwaa k'os'iyaawaa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nahaasiyaappenne birataappe dumma dumma miishshatuwaa k'os'iyaawaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itti beni turggumii birataa k'os'iyaawanttu ubbaa mayza aawuwaa yaagee.</char></note> Tubaalik'ayna michchata Naa'imo.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Itti gallassi Laameeki bare machchetuwaa, «Aadee, S'iilee, sisite; ta machattoo, ane taani odiyaawaa hayzitte. Itti bitanii taana dechcheedda diraw, taani Aa wod'aad; ee, taani he taana masuntseedda wodallaa wod'aad. <verse eid="GEN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />K'aayeela haluwaa kessanaw laappun kushii koshooppe, Laameeka haluwaa kessanaw laappun tammanne laappun kushii koshshee» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seetanne Heenoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Addaame bare machchattina gisina hara na'aa yelaade, «K'aayeeli wod'eedda Aabeela diraw S'oossay taw hara na'aa immeedda» gaade, Aa Seeta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seeta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa birshshetsay «Immeedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> gaade suntsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seetikka attuma na'aa yeleedda; Aa «Heenoosa» giide suntseedda. Aasi Med'inaa Godaa suntsaa s'eesiide goyniyaawaa he wode doomeedda.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Addaama Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Od. 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Addaama yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteedda. S'oossay asaa med'd'eedda gallassi barena malatisiidde med'd'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27-28">Dom. 1:27-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />I attuma asaanne mac'c'a asaa ootsi med'd'iide, unttuntta anjjeedda. Unttuntta med'd'iide Asaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetso k'aalan «Asaa» guussay «Addaama» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Addaami 130 laytsaa de'iide, barena malatiyaa attuma na'aa yeleedda; Aa «Seeta» giide suntseedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Addaami Seeta yeleeddawaappe guyye, 800 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Addaami mule 930 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seeti 105 laytsaa de'iide, Heenoosa yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Seeti Heenoosa yeleeddawaappe guyye, 807 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seeti mule 912 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Heenoosi 90 laytsaa de'iide, K'aynaana yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Heenoosi K'aynaana yeleeddawaappe guyye, 815 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Heenoosi mule 905 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />K'aynaani 70 laytsaa de'iide, Malaali'eela yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />K'aynaani Malaali'eela yeleeddawaappe guyye, 840 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />K'aynaani mule 910 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Malaali'eeli 65 laytsaa de'iide, Yaareedda yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Malaali'eeli Yaareedda yeleeddawaappe guyye, 830 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Malaali'eeli mule 895 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaareed 162 laytsaa de'iide, Heenooka yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Yaareed Heenooka yeleeddawaappe guyye, 800 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaareed mule 962 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Heenooki 65 laytsaa de'iide, Maatusaala yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Maatusaala yeleeddawaappe guyye, Heenooki 300 laytsaa S'oossanna hamettiidde de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Heenooki mule 365 laytsaa de'eedda; <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />I S'oossanna hamettiidde d'ayeedda; ayaw gooppe, S'oossay Aa afeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Ibr. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:14">Yih. 14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Maatusaali 187 laytsaa de'iide, Laameeka yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Maatusaali Laameeka yeleeddawaappe guyye, 782 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Maatusaali mule 969 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Laameeki 182 laytsaa de'iide, attuma na'aa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />«Ha na'ay Med'inaa Goday shek'k'eedda biittaa bollan nuuna nu kushiyaa oosuwaa daaburaappe shemppissana» giide Noha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Noha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsay «Shemppisseedda» giyaawaa malatee.</char></note> suntseedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Laameeki Noha yeleeddawaappe guyye, 595 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Laameeki mule 777 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nohe 500 laytsaa de'iide, Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeeta yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="ms">Nohanne Bashshaa Haatsaa</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="GEN 6:1-10:32">6:1—10:32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Asaa Iitatetsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Aasi sa'aa bollan dareedda wode, unttunttoo mac'c'a naanay yeletteeddino;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:6">Yob. 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:1">2:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />«Saluwaa Med'etatuwaa»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Saluwaa Med'etatuwaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'oossaa naanatuwaa; s'oossatuwaa naanatuwaa.</char></note> geetettiyaawanttu ha asaa mac'c'a naanay malaa lo"a gidiyaawaa be'eeddino; yaatiide unttunttuppe barenttoo dooreeddawantta akkeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Med'inaa Goday, «Ta Ayyaanay asan med'inaw de'enna; ayaw gooppe, Asay hayk'k'iyaawaa; Aa laytsatuukka itti s'eetanne laatama gidana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />He wodenne hewaappe guyye Saluwaa med'etatuu asaa mac'c'a naanaa akkina, naanay yeletteedda wode, wogga adussa asatuu sa'aa bollan de'eeddino. Unttunttune beni wode olaw minanne eretteedda asaa.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Med'inaa Goday he wode sa'aa bollan de'iyaa asaa iitatetsay dareeddawaanne unttunttu wozanay k'oppiyaabay ubbay ubbaa wodekka iita s'alala gideeddawaa be'eedda;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:37">Mat. 24:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26">Luk'. 17:26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:20">1 P'es'. 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Med'inaa Goday asaa ha sa'aa bollan med'd'eeddawoo kayyotteedda; bare wozanaan loytsi seeletteedda. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Hewaa diraw Med'inaa Goday, «Taani med'd'eedda asaa ha sa'aa bollappe mule d'ayssana; asaa, mehiyaa, do'aa, biittaana gooshettiyaa med'etatuwaanne saluwaa kafotuwaa d'ayssana; ayaw gooppe, taani unttuntta med'd'eeddawoo kayyottaad» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Shin Nohe Med'inaa Godaa sintsan nashetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Nohe haneeddabay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteedda. Nohe s'illo asaa; I bare wodiyaan de'eedda asaa giddon suure asaa; Nohe S'oossanna hametteedda. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nohe Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeeta giyaa heezzu attuma naanaa yeleedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">2 P'es'. 2:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />He wode biittay sa'ay S'oossaa sintsan tuneedda; sa'ay ubbay makkalan kumeedda. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />S'oossay ha sa'aa s'eelleedda; sa'ay tuneeddawaa be'eedda; ayaw gooppe, sa'aan de'iyaa Asay ubbay bare ogiyaa tunissi wotseedda.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Hewaa diraw, S'oossay Noha hawaadan yaagiide azazeedda; «Taani asaa ubbaa d'ayssana hanay; unttunttu gaasuwaan sa'ay makkalan kumeedda diraw, taani tumuppe asaakka sa'aakka d'ayssana. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Hewaa diraw, mino mitsaappe new markkabiyaa kees's'a; he markkabiyaa giddon c'ora k'ol"otuwaa kessa; yaataade soonnanne karenna shidiyaan bara. <figure style="fig" alt="The Ark of Noha" file="CO00628B.TIF" size="span" ref="6:14">Noha Markkabiyaa </figure> <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Markkabiyaa hawaadan yaataade kees's'a; adussatetsaa heezzu s'eetu wad'aa, gomppaa ishatamu wad'aa, geesaa hattamu wad'aa ootsa; <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />markkabiyaw kaaraa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kaaraa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maskkootiyaa.</char></note> med'd'a; kaaraappenne godaappe gidduwaan itti wad'aa gidiyaa sa'aa kallo agga basha; penggiyaa markkabiyaw miyiyaanna kessa; markkabiyaa heezzu pook'iyaa kessaade kees's'a.<verse eid="GEN 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />«Taani saluwaappe garssan de'uwaa shemppuwaanna de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaa d'ayssanaw, ha sa'aa bollan bashshaa haatsaa yeddana; ha sa'aan de'iyaabay ubbay d'ayana. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Shin taani ta k'aalaa c'aak'k'uwaa neenana c'aak'k'ettana. Neeni ne machchatto, ne attuma naanaanne ne attuma naanaa machatuwaa neenanna akkaade markkabiyaa giddo gela. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Unttunttu neenana shemppuwaanna attana mala, shemppuu de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaappe k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan attumawaanne mac'c'awaa laa"uwaa laa"uwaa akkaade, markkabiyaa giddo gelissa. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Dumma dumma k'ommo kafuwaappe, dumma dumma k'ommo mehiyaappenne biittaana gooshettiyaa dumma dumma k'ommo med'etatuwaa ubbaappe laa"uwaa laa"uwaa gidiide, shemppuwaanna attana mala neekko yaana. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />K'ay neeninne neenanna de'iyaawanttu maanaw, dumma dumma k'ommu miyaa katsaa Eefeera, markkabiyaa giddon k'ola» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nohe ubbabaakka S'oossay azazeeddawaadan ootseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:7">Ibr. 11:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Med'inaa Goday hewaappe guyye Noha hawaadan yaageedda; «Neeni ne soo asaa ubbaanna markkabiyaa giddo gela; ayaw gooppe, taani ha wodiyaa yeletaa giddon neeni s'illo gideeddawaa be'aaddi. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2-3" />Neeni geeshsha gideedda mehiyaanne do'aa ubbaappe Aa k'ommuwaappe k'ommuwaappe attumawaanne mac'c'awaa laappunuwaa laappunuwaa, geeshsha gidenna mehiyaanne do'aa ubbaappe Aa k'ommuwaappe k'ommuwaappe itti attumawaanne itti mac'c'awaa, k'ay saluwaa kafuwaappe Aa k'ommuwaappe k'ommuwaappe attumawaanne mac'c'awaa laappunuwaa laappunuwaa ootsaade, sa'aa ubbaa bollan dumma dumma zeretsay shemppuwaanna attana mala neenana akkaade gela. <verse eid="GEN 7:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Ayaw gooppe, laappun gallassaappe guyye, taani oytamu gallassaanne oytamu k'ammaa ha sa'aa bollan iraa bukissana; yaataade taani med'd'eedda med'etaa ubbaa sa'aa bollaappe d'ayssana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nohe Med'inaa Goday Aa azazeedda ubbabaa ootseedda.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Bashshaa haatsay ha sa'aa bolla yeedda wode, Nohe laytsay usuppun s'eeta. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nohe, Aa attuma naanay, Aa machatanne Aa naanaa machchetuu bashshaa haatsaappe attanaw markkabiyaa giddo geleeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:38-39">Mat. 24:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:27">Luk'. 17:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Geeshsha mehiyaappenne do'aappe, geeshsha gidenna mehiyaappenne do'aappe, kafuwaappenne biittaana gooshettiyaawanttu ubbaappe <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />S'oossay Noha azazeeddawaadankka attumawenne mac'c'awe laa"uwaa laa"uwaa gidi, Nohekko yiide markkabiyaa giddo geleeddino. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Laappun gallassaappe guyye, bashshaa haatsay ha sa'aa bollan yeedda.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Nohe usuppun s'eetu laytsaa de'ina, laa"entsa aginaan, tammanne laappuntsa gallassan, he gallassan biittaa giddon de'iyaa wolk'k'aama c'iimmaa pulttuwaa ubbay d'uuk'k'i aggeeda; saluwaan de'iyaa haatsaa penggetuukka dooyetti wod'd'eeddino;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:6">2 P'es'. 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Iray ha sa'aa bollan oytamu gallassaanne oytamu k'ammaa bukkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />He gallassan Nohenne Aa attuma naanay, Seeme, Kaamenne Yaafeeti, Nohe machatanne Aa naanaa heezzatuwaa machatuu ittippe markkabiyaa giddo geleeddino. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Unttunttune do'aa ubbaappe bare k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan, mehiyaa ubbaappe bare k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan, sa'aanna gooshettiyaawanttu ubbaappe bare k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan, kafuwaa ubbaappe bare k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan, unttunttunna ittippe geleeddino; <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />de'uwaa shemppuwaanna de'iyaawanttu ubbay laa"uwaa laa"uwaa gidi, Nohekko yiide markkabiyaan geleeddino; <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />S'oossay Noha azazeeddawaadan, med'etaa ubbaappe attumawaanne mac'c'awaa gidiide, markkabiyaa giddo geli simmowaan, Med'inaa Goday markkabiyaa penggiyaa gorddeedda.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Bashshaa haatsay oytamu gallassaa sa'aa bollan bukkiidde gam"eedda; haatsay dariide, markkabiyaa biittappe pude dentseedda. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Haatsay biittaa bollan loytsi darina, markkabii haatsaa bollan tooketteedda. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Saluwaappe garssaana de'iyaa d'ok'k'a deretuu ubbay mitettana gakkanaw, haatsay ha sa'aa bollan loytsi wolk'k'aappe dareedda. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Haatsay deretuwaa s'eeraappe aad'd'iide, tammanne ichcheshu wad'aa gakkanaw tookeedda. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Yaatina sa'aa bollan shemppuwaanna k'aas's'iyaa med'etatuu ubbay: kafuu, mehii, do'ay, sa'aa bollan sham"i giyaa med'etaa ubbaynne Asay ubbay hayk'k'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Ee, mela biittaa bollan de'iyaa, bare siid'iyaan de'uwaa shemppuwaa shemppiyaa ubbaykka hayk'k'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Ha sa'aan pas'a de'iyaabay ubbay: asay, mehiinne do'ay, biittaana gooshettiyaa med'etatuunne saluwaa kafotuu ubbaykka sa'aappe d'ayeeddino. Nohe s'alalaynne aanana markkabiyaa giddon de'iyaawanttu atteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />He haatsay s'eetanne ishatamu gallassaa gakkanaw sa'aa bollan gam"eedda.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Bashshaa Haatsay shooreedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Shin S'oossay Noha, aanana markkabiyaa giddon de'iyaa do'aa ubbaanne mehiyaa ubbaa k'oppeedda; sa'aa bollan c'arkkuwaa c'arkkisseedda; he haatsay wod'd'i wod'd'i beedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />K'ay biittaa gidduwaan de'iyaa c'iimmuwaa pulttuunne saluwaan de'iyaa haatsaa penggetuu gorddetteeddino; iraykka saluwaan ek'k'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Yaatina haatsay wod'd'i wod'd'i beedda. He s'eetanne ishatamuntsa gallassaappe guyye, haatsay wod'd'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Haatsay wod'd'ina markkabii laappuntsa aginaan, tammanne laappuntsa gallassan Araaraate giyaa deretuwaa bolla utteedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Haatsay tammantsa aginay gakkanaw wod'd'i wod'd'i beedda; tammantsa aginaw koyro gallassi deretoo s'eeray beetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Oytamu gallassaappe guyye, Nohe bare kees's'eedda markkabiyaa maskkootiyaa dooyyeedda; <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />yaatiide itti k'uuruwaa kare yeddina; k'uuruu haatsay biittaa bollappe melana gakkanaw, yaanne haanne paalliidde gam"eedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />K'ay Nohe haatsay biittaa bollappe wod'd'i wureeddenttonne be'anaw itti harap'p'atto kare yedeedda; <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />shin he harap'p'atta haatsay biittaa ubbaa bollan ha"ikka de'iyaa diraw, shemppiyaa sa'aa demmabeykku. Hewaa diraw simmaade, markkabiyaa giddon de'iyaa Nohekko yaaddu; I bare kushiyaa yeddiide, barekko markkabiyaa giddo akkeedda.<verse eid="GEN 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Hewaappe guyye, hara laappun gallassaa gam"iide, Dogomatto zaariidekka markkabiyaa giddoppe kessiide yeddeedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />He harap'p'atta sa'ay omarssiyaa wode aakko simmaade yaaddu; wogaraa malatiyaa mitsaappe duutseedda irs's'a haytsaa bare doonaan sa"a akkaade yaaddu. Hewaa diraw, haatsay biittaa bollappe wod'd'eeddawaa Nohe ereedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />K'ay Nohe hara laappun gallassaa gam"iide, he harap'p'atto zaaretsiide yedeedda; shin he harap'p'atta aakko simmaade yabeykku.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Nohe usuppun s'eetanne itti laytsaa de'ina, koyro aginaan koyro gallassi, haatsay biittaa bollappe s'i"eedda; Nohe markkabiyaa k'um"iyaa dooyi s'eelliide, biittay s'i"eeddawaa be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Laa"entso aginaan laatamanne laappuntsa gallassan, biittay mule meleedda.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />S'oossay he wode Noha hawaadan yaagiide azazeedda; <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />«Neeni ne machchatto, ne attuma naanaanne ne naanaa machatuwaa akkaade markkabiyaa giddoppe kesa. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Unttunttu yelettiide, dariide c'orana mala, shemppuu de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaappe neenana de'iyaawantta: kafotuwaa, mehetuwaa, do'atuwaanne biittaana gooshettiyaa ubbaa neenana kessa» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Nohe bare attuma naanatuwaan, bare machchattinanne bare naanaa machchetuwaanna markkabiyaa giddoppe kesseedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Mehiyaanne do'aa ubbay, biittaana gooshettiyaa med'etaa ubbay, kafuwaa ubbaynne sa'aa bollan wos's'i k'aas's'iyaabaa ubbay bare k'ommuwaan k'ommuwaan markkabiyaa giddoppe keseeddino.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nohe Med'inaa Godaw yarshshiyaa sa'aa gimbbeedda; geeshsha mehiyaanne do'aa ubbaappenne geeshsha kafuwaa ubbaappe akkiide, yarshshiyaa sa'aan s'uuggiide yarshsheedda. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Yaatina Med'inaa Goday yarshshuwaa peenuwaa sawiyaawaa singgiide, bare wozanaan hawaadan yaageedda; «Na'atetsaappe doommina, Asay wozanaan k'oppiyaabay ubbay iita gidooppenne, taani asaa diraw gaade laa'entso ubbakka ha sa'aa shek'k'ikke. K'ay taani ha"i ootseeddawaadan pas'a de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaa laa'entso ubbakka d'ayssikke. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Ha sa'ay de'eedda keeshshaa ubbaan, zeriyaa wodiinne c'akkiyaa wodii, meeguunne hombbii, boniinne balgguu, gallassaynne k'ammay ubbaadekka de'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">S'oossay Nohena Geleedda <optbreak />K'aalaa C'aak'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />S'oossay Nohanne Aa attuma naanaa hawaadan yaagiide anjjeedda; «Yelettite; c'orite; sa'aa ubbaa kumite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Dom. 1:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Sa'aa do'atuu ubbay, saluwaa kafatuu ubbay, gadiyaan wos's'i k'aas's'iyaabaa ubbaynne abban de'iyaa moletuu ubbay hinttenttoo yayyinonne dagammino. Unttunttu hinttenttoo aad'd'iide imetteeddino; <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />taani mokkiyaa dumma dumma katsatuwaa hinttenttoo immeeddawaadankka, shemppuu de'iyaa wos's'i k'aas's'iyaa med'etaa ubbay hinttenttoo k'uma gidana. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Shin suutsaa giddon shemppuu de'iyaa diraw suutsay Aa gidduwaan de'iyaa ashuwaa mooppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Dom. 17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">Wog. 19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Zar. 12:16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Taani hinttenttu shemppuwaanna de'iyaa hinttenttu suutsaa do'aa ubbaappe tumu achchana; k'ay asaa ubbaappe, Aa mala asaa suutsaa achchana. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />S'oossay asaa barena malatisiidde med'd'eedda diraw, asaa suutsaa gussiyaa oonanne gidooppenne, Aa suutsaykka asaa kushiyaan gukkanawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Dom. 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kes. 20:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Hinttenttu yelettite; c'orite; sa'aan darite; an c'orite» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Dom. 1:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Hewaappe guyye, S'oossay Nohanne aanana de'iyaa Aa attuma naanaa, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9-10" />«Simmi ha"i, taani ta c'aak'uwaa hinttenana, hintteppe guyye hinttenttu zeretsaannanne pas'a neenana de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaanna c'aak'k'etay; ee, taani ta c'aak'k'uwaa kafuwaanna, mehiyaanna, sa'aa do'aa ubbaananne, markkabiyaappe hinttenana keseedda, shemppuwaanna de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaanna c'aak'k'ay. <verse eid="GEN 9:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Taani hinttenana ta c'aak'k'uwaa c'aak'k'etay; hawaappe sintsan shemppuu de'iyaabay ubbay bashshaa haatsaan ubbakka bayenna; ha sa'aa bayzziyaa haatsay hawaappe sintsan ubbakka de'enna» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />K'aykka S'oossay, «Taani taappenne hintteppe, hinttenana de'iyaa pas'a med'etatuwaa ubbaappe gidduwaan yaana yeletaa ubbaanna c'aak'k'etiyaa c'aak'uwaa malaatay hawaa; <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />taani ta zuluwaa shaariyaan essaad; I taappenne ha sa'aappe gidduwaan de'iyaa c'aak'k'oo mallaa gidana. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Taani sa'aappe bollan shaariyaa aheedda wodenne shaariyaan zuluu beetteedda wode, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />taappenne hintteppe shemppuu de'iyaa dumma dumma k'ommo med'etaa ubbaappe gidduwaan c'aak'k'eteedda ta c'aak'uwaa hassayana; pas'a de'iyaawaa ubbaa d'ayssanaw hawaappe sintsan ubbakka bashshaa haatsay yeenna. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Zuluu shaariyaan beetteedda wode awudenne, taani Aa be'ana; taappe S'oossaappenne ha sa'aa bollan shemppuwaanna de'iyaa dumma dumma k'ommo med'etaa ubbaappe gidduwaan c'aak'k'eteedda med'ina c'aak'k'uwaa taani hassayana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />S'oossay Noha, «Taani taappenne ha sa'aa bollan shemppuwaanna de'iyaawaa ubbaappe gidduwaan c'aak'k'etteedda c'aak'k'uwaa malay hawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nohanne Aa Naanaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Markkabiyaappe keseedda Nohe attuma naanay Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeeta; Kaame Kanaane aawuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Hawanttu heezzuukka Nohe naanaa; sa'aan ubbaan de'iyaa Asay unttunttuppe yeletteedda.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nohe goshshanchcha; I woyniyaa turaa toketsaa doommeedda. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Itti gallassi I he woyniyaa eessaa ushiidde matsotteedda; bare dunkkaaniyaa giddon kallo s'iira giseedda. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Kanaane aawuwaa Kaame bare aawuwaa kalluwaa be'eedda; kare kesiide, bare laa"u ishatoo odeedda. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Shin Seeminne Yaafeeti afilaa ittuwaa akkiide, laa"attukka barenttu hashiyaana hashiyaana gatsi oyk'k'iide, guyyegutsaan hametti geliide, barenttu aawuwaa kalluwaa kammeeddino; unttunttu barenttu aawuwaa kalluwaa be'enna mala barenttu deemuwaa wora zaareeddino.<verse eid="GEN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nohe matsuu aad'd'ina beegottiide, Aa na'ay ubbaappe teefay Aa ootseeddawaa ereedda. <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />Aa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">«Kanaane shek'etteeddawaa gido!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">I bare ishatoo wurssetsa ayiliyaa gido» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />K'aykka Nohe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">«Med'inaa Goday, Seema S'oossay galatetto!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaane Seema ayiliyaa gido;<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />S'oossay Yaafeeta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yaafeeta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraaweetsuwaan ha suntsaa biletsay, «gujjo» giyaawaa malatee.</char></note> biittaa aasso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Yaafeeta zaratuu Seema zaratuwaa giddon de'ino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaane Yaafeeta ayiliyaa gido» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Bashshaa haatsaappe guyye, Nohe 350 laytsaa de'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Nohe mule 950 laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Nohe Naanatuwaa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Od. 1:5-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Nohe naanaa, Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeeta yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa; bashshaa haatsaappe guyye, unttunttoo attuma naanay yeletteeddino.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaafeeta Naanaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Yaafeeta attuma naanay: Goomera, Maagooga, Maadaaya, Yaawaana, Tubaala, Meshekanne Tiiraasa.<verse eid="GEN 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Goomera attuma naanay: Ashkkanaaza, Riifaatanne Togarmma.<verse eid="GEN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Yaawaana attuma naanay: Eliisha, Tarsseese, Kitiimanne Rooda.<verse eid="GEN 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Hawanttuppe abbaa doonaan de'iyaa Asay ubbay bare gadiyaan gadiyaan, bare k'aalan k'aalan, bare yaran yaraaninne, bare kawutetsan kawutetsan shaaketteeddino.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaama Naanaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Kaama attuma naanay: Kuusha, Mis'irayma, Puus'anne Kanaana.<verse eid="GEN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Kuusha attuma naanay: Saaba, Ewulaas'a, Saabita, Raa'imanne Sabttaka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:7">Raa'ima attuma naanay: Saabanne Dadaana.<verse eid="GEN 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kuushi Naamiruuda yeleedda; Naamiruudi ha sa'aan koyro wolk'k'aama olanchchaa gideedda; <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Med'inaa Godaa sintsankka I wolk'k'aama shankkanchcha gideedda; «Naamiruudadan Med'inaa Godaa sintsan wolk'k'aama shankkanchcha gideedda» guussay hewaa diraassa. <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Aa kawutetsay koyro katamati Sanaa'oore gadiyaan de'iyaa Baabloone, Ereeka, Akkaadanne Kalnna. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11-12" />I he biittaappe Asoore biide, Nenewe, Rohobootanne Kaalaha kees's'eedda; k'ay Nanaweppenne Kaalaahappe gidduwaan de'iyaa Reseena giyaa wolk'k'aama katamaakka kees's'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 10:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13-14" />Mis'irayme Ludetuwaa, Anaamaawatuwaa, Lahaabetuwaa, Nafttuuhetuwaa, Patiroosatuwaa, Kaasiluhetuwaanne Piliss's'eematuwaa zeretsatuwaa yeleedda Kafttooretuwaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 10:13-14" /><verse number="15-18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15-18" />Kanaane bare bayira na'aa Sidoonanne Heeta yeleedda; k'ay Kanaane Yaabuusa asaa, Amoore asaa, Gerggeese asaa, Hiiwe asaa, Ark'k'e asaa, Siina asaa, Ariwaade asaa, S'amaare asaanne Hamaata asaa yeleedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:15-18">Hewaappe guyye, Kanaane zaratuu laalettina, <verse eid="GEN 10:15-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Kanaane biittaa zaway Sidoonappe doommiide, Geeraarananne Gaazaanna aad'd'iidde, Sodoomaanne Gamoora, Adaamanne S'aboyma biide, Lashaa'an zawatee. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Kaame attuma naanay barenttu yaran yaran, barenttu k'aalan k'aalan, barenttu biittan biittaaninne barenttu kawutetsan kawutetsan s'aafetteeddawanttu hawantta.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seema Naanaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Seemaw naanay yeletteeddino; I Yaafeetaw bayira ishaanne Eboora naanaa ubbaw mayza aawuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Seema attuma naanay: Elaama, Asoora, Arifaakisaada, Luudanne Araama.<verse eid="GEN 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Araama attuma naanay: Uus'a, Huula, Geteeranne Mesheka.<verse eid="GEN 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arifaakisaadi Shelaaha yeleedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:24">Shelaahi Eboora yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Ebooraw laa"u attuma naanay yeletteeddino. Ittuwaa suntsay Peeleega; ayaw gooppe, sa'aan de'iyaa Asay Aa wodiyaan shaakketeedda; Aa ishaa suntsay Yok'is'aana.<verse eid="GEN 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yok'is'aani naanaa yeleedda. Unttunttune: Almmodaada, Sheleefa, Has'armmaaweta, Yeraaha, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoraama, Uzaala, Diik'ila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Oobaala, Abimaa'eela, Saaba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofiira, Hawiilanne Yobaaba. Hawanttu ubbaykka Yok'is'aana attuma naanaa.<verse eid="GEN 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Unttunttu de'eedda heeray Meeshappe biide away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa derii dariyaa gadiyaan Safaara gakkee. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Seema attuma naanay barenttu yaran yaran, barenttu k'aalan k'aalan, barenttu gadiyaan gadiyaaninne barenttu kawutetsan kawutetsan s'aafetteeddawanttu hawantta.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Hawanttu barenttu yaran yaraaninne barenttu kawutetsan kawutetsan s'aafetteedda Nohe attuma naanaa zaratuwaa. Bashshaa haatsaappe simmiide, kawutetsatuwaa hawanttuppe sa'aa ubbaw yeletti aakkeeddinno.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Baabloona Gimbbiyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 11:1-9">11:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Sa'aa bollan de'iyaa Asay ubbay koyro itti doonaanne itti k'aalaa haasayiino. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Asatuu away kesiyaa bagga simmiide beedda wode, Sanaa'oore giyaa gadiyaan dembbaa ittuwaa demmiide yan, utteeddino.<verse eid="GEN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Unttunttu ittuu ittuwaa, «Haa yiite; s'uubiyaa med'd'iide, taman s'uuggoytte» yaageeddino. Unttunttu shuchchaa diraw s'uubiyaa, urk'k'aa diraw shidiyaa akkeeddino; <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />«Haa yiite; nu suntsaa s'eesissanawunne k'ay nuuni ha sa'aa ubbaa bollan laalettennaan attanaw itti wolk'k'aama katamaanne s'eeray saluwaa gakkiyaa itti pook'iyaa nuw kees's'oytte» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Shin Goday asatuu kees's'eedda wolk'k'aama katamaanne pook'iyaa be'anaw duge wod'd'eedda; <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Med'inaa Goday «Hekko unttunttu itti asaa; k'ay unttunttu ubbaykka itti k'aalan haasayiino; unttunttu ha"i hawaa ootsanaw doommowaappe guyye, unttunttu barenttoo ootsanaw k'oppowaa unttunttoo danddayettenawe ayaynne baawa. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Haa yiite; duge wod'd'iide unttunttu ittuu haasayiyaa k'aalaa ittuu erenna mala, unttunttu k'aalaa dummayoyitte» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Med'inaa Goday unttuntta hewaappe sa'aa ubbaa bollan laalina, unttunttu he wolk'k'aama katamaa kees's'iyaawaa aggiisheedino. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Med'inaa Goday sa'aa asaa k'aalaa yan dummayeedda diraw, he katamay Baabeela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baabeela: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraaweetsuwaan ha suntsaa biletsay Walaketeeddawaa giyaawaa malatee.</char></note> geetetteedda. Goday unttuntta hewaappe sa'aa ubbaa bollan laaleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seemappe Abraama Gakkanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 11:10-32">11:10-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Seema yeletay hawaappe kaaliide s'aafetteeddawaa. Bashshaa haatsaappe guyye, laa"u laytsaa gidina, Seema laytsay 100 gideedda wode, Seemi Arifaakisaada yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Seemi Arifaakisaada yeleeddawaappe guyye, 500 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaakka mac'c'a naanaakka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arifaakisaadi 35 laytsaa de'iide, Shelaaha yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Arifaakisaadi Shelaaha yeleeddawaappe guyye, 403 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaakka mac'c'a naanaakka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Shelaahi 30 laytsaa de'iide, Eboora yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Shelaahi Eboora yeleeddawaappe guyye, 403 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaakka mac'c'a naanaakka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eboori 34 laytsaa de'iide, Peeleega yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Eboori Peeleega yeleeddawaappe guyye, 430 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaakka mac'c'a naanaakka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Peeleegi 30 laytsaa de'iide, Raa'a yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Peeleegi Raa'a yeleeddawaappe guyye, 209 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaakka mac'c'a naanaakka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Raa'u 32 laytsaa de'iide, Saruuga yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Raa'u Saruuga yeleeddawaappe guyye, 207 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaakka mac'c'a naanaakka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Saruugi 30 laytsaa de'iide, Naakoora yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Saruugi Naakoora yeleeddawaappe guyye, 200 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaakka mac'c'a naanaakka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Naakoori 29 laytsaa de'iide, Taara yeleedda; <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Naakoori Taara yeleeddawaappe guyye, 119 laytsaa de'eedda; hara attuma naanaakka mac'c'a naanaakka yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Taari 70 laytsaa de'iide, Abraama, Naakooranne Haaraana yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taara Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Taara yeletay hawaappe kaaliide s'aafetteeddawaa. Taari Abraama, Naakooranne Haaraana yeleedda; Haaraani Loos'a yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Haaraani bare aawuu Taari pas'a de'ishshin, bare yeletteedda Kaladaawetuwaa gadiyaan, Uura giyaa wolk'k'aama kataman hayk'k'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abraaminne Naakoorinne laa"attuukka akkeeddino; Abraamo machchatti suntsay Saaro; k'ay Naakoora machchatti suntsay Milkko; Milkka Haaraana naatto; Haaraani Milkkiwunne Yiskkaaniw aawuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Saara mantsato; iziw na'i baawa.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Taari bare na'aa Abraama, bare na'aa Haaraana na'aa Loos'anne, bare na'aa Abraamo machchatto Saaro akkiidde kesina, unttunttu ittippe Kanaane gadiyaa baanaw Uuri giyaa Kaladaawetuwaa katamaappe denddeeddino; shin unttunttu Kaaraane giyaa katamaa gakkanaw biide, yan utteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Taari 205 laytsaa de'iide, Kaaraanen hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="ms">Abraama, Yisaak'anne Yaak'ooba Taarikkiyaa</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="GEN 12:1-35:29">12:1—35:29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Abraamo S'eesaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Med'inaa Goday Abraama yaageedda; «Neeni ne gadiyaappe, ne dabbotuwaappenne ne aawuwaa golle asaappe shaakettaade, taani neena bessiyaa gadiyaa ba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:2-3">Kit. 7:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Ibr. 11:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Taani neena wolk'k'aama kawutetsaa ootsana; k'ay taani neena anjjana; taani ne suntsaa gitayana; yaatina neeni anjjo gidana; <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />taani neena anjjiyaawantta anjjana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal. 3:8</ref></char></note> k'ay neena shek'k'iyaawantta taani shek'k'ana; ha sa'aa bollan de'iyaa Asay ubbay ne baggana anjjettana»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ne baggana anjjettana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Neena anjjowaada anjjana mala ubbay woosana.</char></note> yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Abraame Med'inaa Goday aw odeeddawaadan denddiide beedda; Loos'ekka aanana beedda; Abraame Kaaraaneppe beedda wode, aw laytsay laappun tammanne ichchesha. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abraame bare machchatto Saaro, bare ishaa na'aa Loos'a, yan shiishsheedda barenttu mas'uwaa ubbaanne, Kaaraanen unttunttu demmeedda k'oomatuwaa akkiide, Kanaane gadiyaa baanaw denddeedda; biide unttunttu Kanaane gadiyaa gakkeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abraame he gadiyaan Sekeema giyaa sa'aan de'iyaa Moore giyaa wolk'k'aama wolaa gakkanaw hametiidde beedda. He wode Kanaane asatuu he gadiyaan de'ino. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Shin Med'inaa Goday Abraamaw k'onc'c'iide Aa, «Ha gadiyaa taani ne zeretsaw immana» yaageedda. I barew k'onc'c'eedda Med'inaa Godaw he sa'aan yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'iide goynneedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kit. 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:16">Gal. 3:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Hewaappe denddiide, Beeteeleppe away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa deretiyaa sa'aa biide, hewaan Beeteele away wulliyaa bagga aggiide, k'ay Ayi away doliyaa bagga aggiide, gidduwaan bare dunkkaaniyaa d'ogeedda; hewaan Med'inaa Godaw yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'iide, Med'inaa Godaa suntsaa s'eeseedda. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Hewaappe guyye, Abraame yaappe denddi biide Neegeeba bazzuwaa gakkeedda.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraame Gibis'e Beedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />He wode he gadii koshateedda; koshay s'iis's'i de'iyaa diraw, Abraame amareeda wodiyaa de'anaw duge Gibis'e wod'd'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Gibis'e gelana hanishin, Abraame bare machchatto Saaro hawaadan yaageedda; «Sisa; neeni loytsa malaa lo"o mac'c'a asaa gidiyaawaa taani eray. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Gibis'e asatuu neena be'iyaa wode unttunttu, ‹Hanna Aa machchatto› yaagiide unttunttu taana wod'ana; shin neena pas'a aggana. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Simmi unttunttu taw ne gaasuwaan keekana malanne, k'ay taani hayk'k'ennan ne gaasuwaan attana mala neeni, ‹Taani Aa michchato› yaaga»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:2">Dom. 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref></char></note> yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Abraame Gibis'e biittaa geleedda wode, Gibis'e asatuu he mishirata daro malaa lo"o mac'c'a asaa gidiyaawaa be'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />K'ay Gibis'e kaatiyaw ootsiyaa kaappatuukka izo be'eedda wode, kaatiyaa sintsan izo nashsheeddino; yaatiide izo kaatiyaa golle afeedino. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Yaatina izi gaasuwaan kaatii Abraama lo"o ayfiyaan s'eelleedda; Abraamaw dorssatuwaanne booratuwaa, attuma haretuwaanne mac'c'a haretuwaa, attuma k'oomatuwaanne mac'c'a k'oomatuwaa, gaaluwaa immeedda.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Shin Med'inaa Goday Abraama machchatti Saari gaasuwaan Gibis'e kaatiyaa bollanne Aa soo asaa bolla daro kaa'iyaa harggiyaa yeddeedda. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Yaatina kaatii Abraama s'eesiide, «Neeni hawaa ayaw ta bolla ootsaad? iza ne machchatto gideeddawaa ayaw taw odabeykkii? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Neeni izo, ‹Iza ta michchato› gaade taw ayaw odaaddii? Taani izo taw machche ootsanaw akkeeddawe hewaa diraassa. Simmi ha"i ne machchatto hanno be'a; izo akkaade ba» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Bare asaa azazina, unttunttu Abraama Aa machchattinanne aw de'iyaa ubbabaanna kessiide yeddeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abraaminne Loos'e Shaaketteeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Hewaa diraw Abraame bare machchattinanne, barew de'iyaawaa ubbaanna Gibs'eppe Negeeba bazzuwaa beedda; Loos'ekka aanana beedda. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abraame he wode miizaa, biraaninne work'k'aan darii duretteedda.<verse eid="GEN 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />I Negeebappe denddiide Beeteele gakkanaw beedda; he sa'aynne Beeteeleppenne Ayippe gidduwaan I koyro bare dunkkaaniyaa d'ogeedda sa'aanne <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />yarshshiyaa sa'aa I koyro kees's'eedda sa'aa. Yan Abraame Med'inaa Godaa suntsaa s'eeseedda.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Abraamena yuuyyiyaa Loos'ewukka miizzay, dorssaa wudiinne dunkkaanii de'ee. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Shin unttunttu ittippe de'anaw unttunttoo biittay gidibeenna; unttunttoo daro mehii de'iyaa diraw, unttunttu ittippe de'anaw danddayibeykkino. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Hewaa gaasuwaan Abraamo wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttu giddoninne Loos'e wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttu giddon walassay kesseedda. He wode Kanaanatuunne Parzzetuu he gadiyaan de'ino.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Yaanina Abraame Loos'a, «Nuuni ishatuwaa gidiyaa diraw, ta giddoninne ne giddon, ta wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttu giddoninne ne wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttu giddon walassaa kessoppa. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Biittaa ubbay ne sintsan de'ennee? Ane nuuni shaakettoytte; neeni haddirssa bagga booppe, taani ushechcha bagga baana; neeni ushechcha bagga booppe, taani haddirssa bagga baana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Loos'e yuuyyi aad'd'i s'eelliide, Yorddaanoosa Shaafaa wombbay ubbay biide Zoo'aara gakkanaw, Med'inaa Godaa gennetiyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Med'inaa Godaa Gennetiyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edene Gennetiyaa bessiyaawaa.</char></note> woy Gibis'e biittaa mala daro haatsay de'iyaawaa gidiyaawaa be'eedda. (Hewenne Med'ina Goday Sodoomanne Gamoora geetettiyaa katamato d'ayissanaappe kase).<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:10">Dom. 2:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Hewaa diraw Loos'e barew Yorddaanoosa wombbaa ubbaa dooriide, away doliyaa bagga beedda; yaatina unttunttu ittuu ittiwaappe shaaketteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abraame Kanaane gadiyaan de'eedda; shin Loos'e wombban de'iyaa wolk'k'aama katamatuwaa gidduwaan uttiide, Sodooma katamaa matan bare dunkkaaniyaa d'ogeedda. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />He wode Sodooma asatuu iitanne Med'inaa Godaa bolla pala nagaraa ootsiyaawantta.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Loos'e Abraameppe shaaketteeddawaappe guyye, Med'inaa Goday Abraama hawaadan yaageedda; «D'ok'k'u gaade neeni de'iyaasaappe away doliyaa bagganne away wulliyaa bagga, k'ay huup'issa bagganne gedissa bagga s'eella. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Ha neeni s'eelliyaa biittaa ubbaa taani newunne ne zariyaw med'inaw immana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kit. 7:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />taani ne zariyaa sa'aa shafiyaadan darissana; ooninne sa'aa shafiyaa paydana danddayooppe, ne zariikka paydettana. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Dendda; biittaa gomppan pudenne dugenne hininne haanne hamettaadde be'a; ayaw gooppe, taani ha biittaa new immana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Abraame bare dunkkaaniyaa shoddiide, Kebroone katamaan de'iyaa Mamire wolatuwaa woggatuwaa matan de'anaw beedda. Hewaan Med'inaa Godaw yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Abraame Loos'a Wotsi Akkeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />He wode Sanaa'oore Kaatii Amiraafeeli, Elaasaara Kaatii Ariyooki, Elaama Kaatii Kadorllaa'oomerinne Goyma Kaatii Tidi'aali oydduu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />Sodooma Kaatiyaa Beera'aara, Gamoora Kaatiyaa Birshshaara, Adaama Kaatiyaa Shin"aabaara, S'aboyma Kaatiyaa Shemebeeraaranne (S'oo'aaro geetettiyaa) Belaa'a Kaatiyaanna olaw salppeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Hawanttu ichcheshu kaatetu gaketiide itti wolk'k'aa gidiide, (Mas'ine Abbaa giyaa) Siiddima Wombban shiik'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Unttunttu kase tammanne laa"u laytsaa Kadorllaa'oomeraw moodetteeddino; shin tammanne heezzentsa laytsan aw makkaleeddino.<verse eid="GEN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Tammanne oyddentso laytsan Kadorllaa'oomerinne aanana zuppeteedda kaatetu barenttu olanchchatuwaa akki biide, Asttaarooti s'arnnayman de'iyaa Raafaayeta, Haaman de'iyaa Zuuzetanne Shaawe-K'iriyaatayman de'iyaa Eemeta oliide s'ooneeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />Hoora biittaa asatuwaakka Se'iira Deriyaan oliide, bazzuwaa matan de'iyaa Elpparaana giyaa sa'aa gakkanaw yedersseeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Hewaappe guyye simmiide, Ayin-Mishppaas'a yeeddino. (Ha"i he sa'ay K'aadeesa geetettee.) Unttunttu Amaaleek'atuwaa biittaa ubbaanne k'ay Has'aas'oone Taamaara giyaa sa'aan de'iyaa Amooratuwaa oliide s'ooneeddino.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Hewaappe simmiide, Sodooma kaatii, Gamoora kaatii, Addaama kaatii, S'aboyma kaatiinne (S'oo'aaro geetettiyaa) Belaa'a kaatii denddeeddino; Siiddima Wombban salppeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />Hawanttu ubbay Elaama kaatiyaanna, Goyma kaatiyaanna, Sanaa'oore kaatiyaannanne Elaasaara kaatiyaanna (ha ichcheshu kaatetu oyddu kaatetuwaanna) oletteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Siiddima Wombban he wode, shidiyaadan oyk'k'iyaabay kumeedda ollay besseedda; Sodooma kaatiinne Gamoora kaatii barenttu olanchchatuwaanna olaappe bak'atishin, unttunttuppe amareedawanttu he ollatuwaan kunddeeddino; shin atteedawanttu deriyaa bak'ateeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Oyddu kaatetu Sodoomanne Gamoora katamatuwaa mas'uwaa ubbaanne unttunttu k'umaa ubbaa bonk'k'iide akkeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Abraamo ishaa na'ay Loos'e Sodooman de'iyaa diraw, aakka Aa mas'uwaakka akkeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Hewaappe guyye, itti bitanii bak'ati yiide Ibraawiyaa Abraamaw hawaa odeedda. Abraame he wode, Eshkkolanne Aneera ishaa Amooriyaa Mamire wolaa matan de'ee. Unttunttu ubbaykka olaa zaaranaw Abraamena c'aak'k'uwaa c'aak'k'eti utteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abraame bare dabbuu omoodetteeddawaa siseedda wode, olaa eriyaa bare son yeletteedda 318 asaa dentseedda; he oyddu kaatetuwaa kaalliidde Daani giyaa katamaa gakkanaw beedda. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />K'amman bare asaa c'uguwaan c'uguwaan shaakki, bare morkkatuwaanna olettiide unttuntta s'ooneedda. Demask'k'oppe huup'issa baggana de'iyaa Hooba giyaa sa'aa gakkanaw yedersseedda. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Mas'uwaa ubbaa, k'ay bare dabbuwaa Loos'anne Aa mas'uwaa, mac'c'a asaanne hara asaa wotsi akkeedda.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abraame Kadorllaa'oomeranne aanana zuppeteedda kaatetuwaa s'ooniide simmeeddawaappe guyye, Sodooma kaatii, (Kaatetuwaa Wombbaa giyaa) Shaaweeha Wombban Aa mokkanaw keseedda.<verse eid="GEN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malkka-S'edek'k'i Abraama Anjjeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />He wode, Saleeme Kaatii Malkka-S'edek'k'i ukitsaanne woyniyaa eessaa akkiide yeedda; I Ubbaappe d'ok'k'iyaa S'oossaa k'eesiyaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:1-10">Ibr. 7:1-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />I Abraama hawaadan yaagiide anjjeedda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 14:19">«Ubbaappe D'ok'k'iyaa S'oossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:19">saluwaanne sa'aa med'd'eeddawe Abraama anjjo.<verse eid="GEN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />K'ay Ubbaappe D'ok'k'iyaa S'oossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:20">ne morkkatuwaa ne kushiyaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:20">aatsi immeeddawe galatetto» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Abraame ubbabaappe asiraataa kessiide, Malkka-S'edek'k'aw immeedda.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Sodooma kaatii Abraama, «Asaa taw immaade, mas'uwaa new akka» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Shin Abraame Sodooma kaatiyaa, «Taani Med'inaa Godaw, Ubbaappe D'ok'k'iyaa S'oossaw, saluwaanne sa'aa med'd'eddawoo, ta kushiyaa dentsaade c'aak'k'aad. <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23-24" />Ta Asay meeddawaappenne taananna beedda Aneera, Eshkkolanne Mamire gakkiyaawaappe attina, neeni, ‹Abraama taani dureyaad› ubbakka geena mala, taani newaappe haray atto k'unc'c'uutiyaa woy c'aammaa k'achchiyaawaanne akkikke. Unttunttu barena gakkiyaawaa akkino» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 14:23-24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Med'inaa Goday Abraamena C'aak'k'eteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Hewaappe guyye, Med'inaa Godaa k'aalay sas'aani Abraamekko yiide, «Abraamaa, yayyoppa! Taani new gonddalle; ne gatii loytsi dara» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Abraame, «Abeet Ubbaa Mooddiyaa Med'inaa Godaw, taw ubbakka na'i baynna diraw, neeni immiyaa gatii taw ayissee? Demask'k'o El"eezeri taana laattana shin»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">El"eezeri taana laattana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraaweetsuwaan k'onc'c'e gidena.</char></note> yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />K'aykka Abraame, «Neeni taw na'aa immabaakka; hewaa diraw ta son de'iyaa k'oomay taana laattiyaawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Med'inaa Godaa k'aalay aakko yiide, «Ha k'oomay neena laattenna; shin ne gulbbataappe kesiyaawe neena laattana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Simmiide kare Aa kessiide, «Saluwaa pude s'eella; neeni s'oolinttetuwaa paydanaw danddayooppe payda; ne zeretsaykka hawaa keeshshaa gidana» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:18">Rom. 4:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:12">Ibr. 11:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abraamo Med'inaa Godaa ammaneedda; Med'inaa Goday hewaa aw s'illotetsaadan paydeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rom. 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal. 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak'. 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Med'inaa Goday k'aykka Aa, «Taani neeni ha biittaa laattana mala new immanaw Uuri giyaa Kaladaawetuwaa katamaappe neena kessa aheedda Med'inaa Godaattee» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Shin Abraamo Aa, «Abeet Ubbaa Mooddiyaa Med'inaa Godaw, taani ha biittaa laattanawaa ayaan eroo?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Med'inaa Goday Aa, «Heezzu laytsaa ussaa, heezzu laytsaa deeshshaa, heezzu laytsaa dorssaanne laa"u k'ommo harap'p'etuwaa taw akkaade ya» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />I hawantta ubbaa aw afeedda; unttuntta p'alk'k'iide laa"u keseedda; laa"uwaa keseeddawaa ittuwaa ittuwaa baggan wotseedda; shin kafotuwaa laa"u kessi p'alk'k'ibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />He wode ankkotu he ashuwaa bolla wod'd'eeddino; shin Abraame unttuntta yedersseedda.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Away wulliyaa wode Abraama wolk'k'aama gem"ishuu oyk'k'eedda; d'ip'p'i geedda d'umay Aa bolla wod'd'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:13">Yob. 4:13</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 4:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Yaatina Med'inaa Goday Aa, «Ne zeretsay hara gadiyaan bete gidiide de'anawaa neeni tumuppe era; unttunttu ayiletiide oyddu s'eetu laytsaa naak'ettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-14">Kes. 1:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:6">Kit. 7:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Shin ayileyiide unttuntta mooddiyaa kawutetsaa taani murana; hewaappe guyye, unttunttu daro ak'uwaana he biittaappe kessana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40-41">Kes. 12:40-41</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:7">Kit. 7:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Neena gidooppe, neeni ne mayza aawotuwaakko sarotetsaan baana; neeni loytsa c'imaade hayk'k'ananne moogettana. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Shin oyddentso yeletaan ne zeretsay ha gadiyaa simmana; ayaw gooppe, Amooretuu nagaray biro likkiyaa gakkibeenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Away wullina sa'ay d'umeedda; c'ooc'iyaa c'uwaynne tamaa lac'uu akeekenan beettiide, he laa"u kessi p'alk'k'eteeddawanttuppe gidduwaana aad'd'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />He gallassi Med'inaa Goday Abraamena hawaadan yaagiide c'aak'k'uwaa c'aak'k'eteedda; «Gibis'e Shaafaappe doommiide Efiraas'iisa giyaa wolk'k'aama shaafaa gakkanaw, ha biittaa taani ne zeretsaw immaad;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kit. 7:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19-21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19-21" />ha biittay K'eenatuwaa, K'eniizetuwaa, K'adimoonetuwaa, Hiitetuwaa, Parzzetuwaa, Raafaayetuwaa, Amooretuwaa, Kanaanetuwaa, Gerggeesetuwaanne Yaabuusatuwaa biittaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 15:19-21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Aggaaronne Isimaa'eela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Abraamo machata Saara aw na'aa yelabeykku; shin iziw Gibis'eppe yeedda Aggaaro giyaa itti ayilata de'aw. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Hewaa diraw Saara Abraama s'eesaade, «Be'a, Med'inaa Goday taw yeluwaa diggeedda. Neeni baade, ta ayilatina gisa; ooni erii, taani izi baggana na'aa daayo gidanenttonne» yaagaaddu. Abraame Saari k'aalaa sisiide mayyeedda. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Abraame Kanaane gadiyaan tammu laytsaa utteeddawaappe guyye, Abraamo machata Saara Gibis'eppe aheedda bare ayilatto Aggaaro, bare asinaa Abraamaw machchetetsaw immaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Aggaaro akkeedda; iza shahaaraaddu. Iza barew shahaaray atteedawaa ereedda wode, bare godatto kad'iyaa doommaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />He wode Saara Abraama, «Taana ha naak'uwaa naak'k'issiyaawe neena;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Taana ha naak'uwaa naak'k'issiyaawe neena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Neeni ta bolla ootsowe ne bolla peesho guussaa.</char></note> taani ta ayilatto new immina, iza ha"i barew shahaaray atteeddawaa eraade, taana kad'aw. Nebaanne tabaa Med'inaa Goday pirddo» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abraame Saaro, «Hanno be'a; ne ayilata ne kushiyaanna; neeni izo new lo"owaa ootsa» yaageedda. Hewaappe guyye, Saara Aggaaro naak'k'ina, iza kesaade iippe bak'attaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Med'inaa Godaa kiitanchchay pulttuwaa matan woran Aggaaro demmeedda; he pulttuu Shura giyaa gadiyaa afiyaa ogiyaa mataana. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />I Aggaaro, «Hanne Saari ayilattee Aggaaree, hak'appe yaad? K'ay hak'a bay?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Iza, «Taani ta godatti Saarippe bak'atay» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Med'inaa Godaa kiitanchchay iziw, «Neeni ne godattikko guyye simmaade ba; iziw moodeta» yaagiide odeedda. <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />K'aykka Med'inaa Godaa kiitanchchay izo, «Ne zarii paydanaw danddayettennawaa keenaa taani c'orissana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />K'aykka Med'inaa Godaa kiitanchchay izo, «Ha"i neeni shahaara; neeni attuma na'aa yelana; Aa Isimaa'eela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isimaa'eela: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa Biletsay S'oossay siseedda guussaa.</char></note> gaade suntsana; ayaw gooppe, Med'inaa Goday ne waasuwaa siseedda. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />I woran yeda de'iyaa hariyaa mala asaa gidana; asaa ubbaanna I ek'ettana; k'ay Asay ubbaykka aanana ek'ettana; I bare ishatuwaa ubbaanna is'o gidiide de'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Aggaara, «Taani taana be'iyaawaa be'aade pas'a attanee?» yaagaaddu; iza barew haasayeedda Med'inaa Godaa, «Neeni taana be'iyaa S'oossaa» yaagaade suntsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Hewaa diraw he pulttuwaa ollay, «Taana Be'iyaa De'uwaa S'oossaa Pulttuwaa» geetetteedda; he ollay hanno gakkanaw K'aadeeseppenne Baareedappe gidduwaan de'ee.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Aggaara Abraamaw attuma na'aa yelaaddu; Abraame Aggaara yeleedda na'aa Isimaa'eela giide suntseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:22">Gal. 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Aggaara Isimaa'eela Abraamew yeleedda wode, Abraamo laytsay hosppun tammanne usuppuna.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">K'as's'araa, C'aak'k'uwaa Mallaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Abraamo laytsay udduppun tammanne udduppuna gidiyaa wode, Med'inaa Goday aw k'onc'c'iide Aa, «Taani Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa; neeni ta sintsan hametta; suure gidaa. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Taani taappenne neeppe gidduwaan ta c'aak'k'uwaa wotsay; taani neena loytsa c'orissana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Abraame bare deemuwaan duge guufanneedda; S'oossay aw hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />«Simmi, taani neenana c'aak'k'etiyaa c'aak'uu hawaa; neeni daro kawutetsaa aawuwaa gidana. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Hawaappe doommiide ne suntsay Abraama geetettenna; shin ne suntsay Abrahaama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abrahaama: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay daro kawutetsaw aawuwaa giyaawaa malatee.</char></note> gidana. Ayaw gooppe, taani neena daro kawutetsaa aawuwaa ootsaad.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Rom. 4:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Taani neena loytsa c'orissana; taani neeppe kawutetsatuwaa med'd'ana; kaatetuukka neeppe kesana. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Taani taappenne neeppe, neeppe guyye ne zeretsaappenne gidduwaan, yeletaappe yeletaa gakkanaw ta c'aak'k'uwaa c'aak'k'etay; ha c'aak'k'uu taani newunne neeppe guyye ne zeretsaw S'oossaa gidana mala med'inaa c'aak'uwaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:55">Luk'. 1:55</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Ha"i neeni bete gidaade de'iyaa Kanaane biittay ubbay newunne neeppe guyye ne zeretsaw med'inaw laata gidana mala taani immana; k'ay taani unttunttu S'oossaa gidana» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Kit. 7:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />K'aykka S'oossay Abrahaama, «Neena gidooppe, neeni ta c'aak'uwaa naaga; neenikka neeppe guyye ne zeretsaykka, yeletaappe yeletaa gakkanaw naagite. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Taappenne neeppenne, neeppe guyye ne zeretsaappe gidduwaan hinttenttu naagana ta c'aak'uu hawaa; hinttenttu gidduwaan de'iyaa attumawe ubbay k'as's'aretto.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Kit. 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:11">Rom. 4:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Hinttenttu attumatetsaa shookuwaa k'as's'arettiita; hewe taappenne hintteppe gidduwaan de'iyaa c'aak'k'oo mallaa gidanawaa. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Hinttenttu giddon sintsappe yelettana attuma naanay ubbay yeletteedda hosppuntsa gallassan k'as's'arettanaw koshshee. Ne soon yeletteeddawantta gidina, woy allagaappe shaluwaan shametteedda ayiletuwaa gidina, ne zeretsaa gidenawanttakka attumawantta k'as's'aranaw koshshee. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Ne son yeletteeddawanttu ne shaluwaan shamettowanttu k'as's'arettino. Hawe hinttenttu ashuwaan de'iyaa ta c'aak'k'uu med'inaa c'aak'uwaa gidana. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />K'as's'arettibeenna, bare shookuwaanna de'iyaa attuma Asay ubbay bare asaappe duus's'ana; ayaw gooppe, I ta c'aak'uwaa mentseedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />K'aykka S'oossay Abrahaame, «Simmi, ne machchatti Saari suntsaa Saaray gooppa; hawaappe sintsaw izi suntsay Saaro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Saaro: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay kawutetsaa aato guussaa.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Taani izo anjjana; taani iippe new attuma na'aa tumu immana. Izo taani anjjana; iza kawutetsatuwaa aatto gidana; asaa kaatetu iippe yaana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Abrahaame bare deemuwaan guufanneedda; I miic'c'iide bare wozanaan, «S'eetu laytsaa Asay tumu na'aa yelanee? K'ay udduppun tammu laytsaa gideedda Saara na'aa yelanee?» yaagiide k'oppeedda. <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Abrahaame S'oossaa, «Isimaa'eeli taana laattiyaawaa gidanaw danddayennee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Shin S'oossay, «Tuytti, ne machata Saara new attuma na'aa tumuppe yelana; neeni Yisaak'a<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yisaak'a: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay I Miic'eedda giyaawaa.</char></note> gaade Aa suntsana. Aappe guyye, Aa zeretsaw med'inaa c'aak'uwaa gidana mala, taani aanana ta c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'etana. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />K'ay Isimaa'eelabaa gidooppenne, neeni oochcheeddawaa taani sisaad; taani aakka anjjana; taani Aa anjjananne Aa zeretsaa loytsa c'orissana; I tammanne laa"u yeletatuwaa yelana; taani Aa zeretsaa wolk'k'aama kawutetsaa ootsana. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Shin taani ta c'aak'uwaa laytsi hannoode Saara new yeliyaa Yisaak'ana c'aak'k'etana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />S'oossay Abrahaamaana haasayiide wursseeddawaappe guyye, Abrahaameppe shaakettiide pude beedda.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />He gallassan Abrahaame bare na'aa Isimaa'eela, bare son yeletteedda ubbaa, bare shaluwaan shammeeddawantta ubbaa, bare son de'iyaa attuma asaa ubbaa, S'oossay aw odeeddawaadan unttunttu attumatetsaa k'as's'areedda. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abrahaame bare attumatetsaa k'as's'arettiyaa wode, udduppun tammanne udduppun laytsaa asaa; <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Aa na'ay Isimaa'eeli bare attumatetsaa k'as's'arettiyaa wode, tammanne heezzu laytsaa na'aa. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Abrahaamenne Aa na'ay Isimaa'eeli laa"attuukka he gallassi k'as's'aretteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Abrahaame son de'iyaa attuma Asay ubbay, Aa son yeletteeddawanttunne shaluwaan shammeeddawanttu ubbay aanana k'as's'aretteeddino.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Heezzu Imatsatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Abrahaame Mamire wolatuwaa wogatuwaa garssan bare dunkkaaniyaa penggiyaan seeta gallassi utti de'ishshin, Med'inaa Goday aw k'onc'c'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Abrahaame d'ok'k'u giide s'eelliide heezzu asatuu Aa matan ek'k'eeddawantta be'eedda; unttunttunna gaketanaw bare dunkkaaniyaa penggiyaappe denddi wos's'eedda; gakkiide, gediyaan hokkiide, unttunttu sintsan goyneedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Ibr. 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Simmiide I, «Abeet ta Godaw, taani ne sintsan nashshetteedawaa gidooppe, taana ne k'oomaa aggaade aad'd'oppa. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Hayanaa guutsa haatsay yo; hinttenttu gedii meec'ettina, ha mitsaa kuwaan shemppi akkite. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Hinttenttu ha"i taakko hinttenttu k'oomaakko yeedda diraw, kam"i giide hinttenttu biyaasa'aa baana mala, taani hinttenttoo miyaawaa ahay» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Unttunttu, «Daro lo"a; neeni giyaawaadan ootsa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Abrahaame dunkkaaniyaa giddo Saarikko elleelli biide, «Elleellaade liik'o d'iiliyaappe heezzu kere gidiyaawaa akka munak'aade ukitsaa uukka» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />K'ay, Abrahaame bare mehiyaakko wos's'i biide, lo"o bolttiboltta bolttiboltta maraa dooriide, itti k'oomaw immina, I elleelli shukkiide giigisseedda. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Yaatina Abrahaame me"eedda maatsaanne giigisseedda maraa ashuwaa imatsatuwaa sintsa aatseedda; unttunttu miishshin, I he mitsaa garssan unttunttu matan ek'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Unttunttu Aa, «Ne machata Saara hak'anee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Iza, «Hini dunkkaaniyaa gidduwaan de'aw» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Med'inaa Goday Aa, «Taani laytsi hannoode tumu neekko simmana; he wode ne machata Saara attuma na'aa yelana» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Saara he wode aappe guyye baggana de'iyaa dunkkaaniyaa penggiyaan de'iyaana hewaa sisaaddu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:9">Rom. 9:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Abrahaamenne Saara barenttu laytsaa loytsi sugiide c'imeeddino. Saariw piilay yiyaawaa aggeedda. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Hewaa diraw Saara bare wozanaan, «Taani ha"i c'ima wura kichchowaappe guyyiyaaninne ta goday c'imowaappe guyye, ha"i taw attuma asaana gaketiyaawe waan hananee?» yaagaade miic'c'aaddu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:6">1 P'es'. 3:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Med'inaa Goday Abrahaame he wode, « ‹Taani c'ima kichchowaappe guyye, tumu na'aa yelanitaayye?› gaade, Saara ayaw miic'c'aade? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Med'inaa Godaw danddayettennabay tumu de'ii? Laytsi hannoode taani neekko simmana; he wode Saara attuma na'aa yelana» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:37">Luk'. 1:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Saara loytsa yayyeedda diraw, «Taani miic'c'abeykke» yaagaade lakaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Shin I, «Ee, neeni tumu miic'c'aadda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahaame Sodooma Diraw Gaannateedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Hewaappe guyye asatuu denddiide bi, Sodooma katamaa duge zaari s'eelleeddino; Abrahaamenne unttuntta moyzziide unttunttunna beedda. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Med'inaa Goday he wode, «Taani ta ootsanaw haniyaabaa Abrahaameppe k'osikke. <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Abrahaame tumuppe gitanne wolk'k'aama kawutetsaa gidana; ha sa'aa kawutetsatuu ubbay Aa baggana anjjettana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kawutetsatuu ubbay Aa baggana anjjettana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawutetsay ubbay neena anjjowaadan barenakka anjjanaadan taana woossanawantta giyaawaa.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Ayaw gooppe, s'illotetsaanne pirddaa ootsiide, Med'inaa Godaa ogiyaa naaganaadan bare naanaanne bareppe guyye, bare soo asaa I zorana mala, taani Aa dooraad; hewenne Med'inaa Goday Abrahaamew immana geeddawaa ubbaa polanaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20-21" />Med'inaa Goday Abrahaame, «Sodoomappenne Gamoorappe waassiyaa waasuu loytsi dareedda dirawunne unttunttu nagaray loytsi dees'eedda diraw, unttunttu ootseeddabay taakko gakkeedda waasuwaa keeshshaa iitenttonne be'anaw ane taani duge wod'd'ay; hewaa mala iita gidana d'ayinttonne erana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Hewaappe guyye, laa"u asatuu Sodoomakko simmiide beeddino; shin Abrahaame Med'inaa Godaa sintsan woosi de'ee. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />He wode Abrahaame Med'inaa Godaakko shiik'iide yaageedda; «Tumu neeni s'illotuwaa iitatuwaana d'ayssay? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />He wolk'k'aama katamaan ishatamu s'illotuu de'inttokka, neeni d'ayssay? Neeni aan de'iyaa ishatamu s'illotuwaa diraw he katamaa ashshikkii? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Hewe neeppe haakko; s'illotuwaa iitatuwaana wod'iyaawenne s'illotuwaanne iitatuwaa itti ayfiyaan s'eelliyaawe neeppe haakko. Ha sa'aa ubbaa pirddiyaawe s'illuwaa pirddenneeyye?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Med'inaa Goday, «He Sodooma kataman ishatamu s'illotuu de'ooppe, he sa'aa ubbaa unttunttu diraw taani ashshana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Hewaappe guyye Abrahaame, «Taani biittanne bidintsaa gidaadde ta Godaana s'alaade haasayanaw simmi doomma kichchaad; <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />ishatamu s'illotuwaappe ichcheshu pac'c'intto, neeni he ichcheshatuwaa diraw he katamaa ubbaa d'ayssay?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Med'inaa Goday, «Taani yan oytamanne ichcheshu s'illotuwaa demmintto, he katamaa d'ayisikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abrahaame zaaretsiidekka, «Yan oytamu s'alalay beettintto shin?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">I, «Taani he oytamatuwaa diraw, he katamaa d'ayisikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Hewaappe guyye I, «Hay Goday taw hank'k'ettoppo; taani gujjaadekka haasayay. Yan hattamu s'alalay beettintto shin?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Med'inaa Goday, «Taani yan hattamuwaa demmintto, he katamaa d'ayssikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abrahaame k'aykka, «Taani Godaana s'alaade haasayanaw doomma kichchaad; yan laatamuwaa s'alalay beettintto shin?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Med'inaa Goday, «He laatamatuwaa diraw taani Aa d'ayssikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Hewaappe guyye Abrahaame, «Hay Goday taw hank'k'ettoppo; taani mes's'i itti gede haasayay; yan tammu s'alalay beettintto shin?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Med'inaa Goday, «He tammatuwaa diraw taani he katamaa d'ayssikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Med'inaa Goday Abrahaamena haasayaa wursseeddawaappe guyye beedda; Abrahaamekka bare soo simmeedda.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Sodooma Nagaraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />He laa"u kiitanchchatuu omarssi Sodooma katamaa gakkeeddino; he wode Loos'e he katamaa penggiyaan utteedda. Loos'e unttuntta be'inne unttunttunna gaketanaw ek'k'iide beedda; bare deemuwaa sa'aa gatsiide goyneedda; <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />«Ta godatoo, hinttenttu k'oomaa soo simmeerikkitee; hinttenttu gediyaa meec'ettiide k'ammaa ak'ite; guuran denddiide hinttenttu biyaasa'aa baanita» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Unttunttu, «Tuytti; nuuni ha katamaa dabaabaan ak'ana» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Shin I unttuntta loytsi shoobbeedda diraw, aanana biide Aa soo geleeddino; I unttunttoo k'umaa katsiide, c'aalenna ukitsaa uukkiide aatsina, unttunttu meeddino.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Unttunttu gisennan de'ishshin, Sodooma katamaa attuma Asay ubbay, naanatuwaappe c'imaa gakkanaw, ittuunne attenaan yiide, golliyaa yuuyyi aad'd'i dooddeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Loos'a s'eesiide yaageeddino; «Hachche k'amma ne soo yeedda attuma asatuu hak'an de'iinoo? Nuuni unttunttunna sharmus'ana mala unttuntta nuukko kare kessa» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:22-24">Dat. 19:22-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Loos'e unttunttunna gaketanaw kare kesiide, kariyaa guyye gorddeedda; <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />unttuntta hawaadan yaageedda; «Ta ishatoo, ha iita oosuwaa ootsoppite. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Simmi taw laa"u mac'c'a naanay, attuma asaa eribeenna wodoratuu de'iino; taani unttuntta hinttenttoo kare kessay; hinttenttu unttuntta hinttew lo"owaadan ootsana danddayiita. Shin ha asatuwaa bolla ayinne ootsoppite; ayaw gooppe, unttunttu ta golle geliide ta kaaraa garssan de'iino» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Asatuu Aa, «Nu sintsaappe kichcha!» yaageeddino; k'aykka unttunttu, «Ha bitanii ha gadiyaan bete gidi yiide, ha"i nu bolla pirddanaw kajjeeleedda! Ha"i nuuni neena unttunttu bolla ootsanaw k'oppeeddawaappe iitaa ootsana!» yaageeddino. Unttunttu Loos'a guyye sugi yeggiide penggiyaa mentsanaw shiik'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Shin he laa"u asatuu barenttu kushiyaa kare yeddiide, Loos'a soo goochchi gelissiide penggiyaa gorddeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Hewaappe guyye, unttunttu golle penggiyaan de'iyaa asaa, guutsaappe gitaa gakkanaw k'ook'isseeddino. Yaatina unttunttu penggiyaa demmanaw koyiide daabureeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:18">2 Kat. 6:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Loos'e Sodoomappe Kesiide Beedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />He laa"u asatuu Loos'a, «New hawaan ne mac'c'a naanaa giigisseeddawanttu, ne attuma naanay woy ne mac'c'a naanay woy nebaa gideedda Asay oona gidooppene ha katamaan de'ii? Unttuntta hawaappe kessa digga. <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />Ayaw gooppe, nuuni ha sa'aa d'ayssana haneetto. Unttunttu waassiyaa waasuu Godaa sintsan loytsi dareedda diraw, Med'inaa Goday nuuna ha katamaa d'ayssanaw kiitteedda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Hewaa diraw Loos'e kesiide, bare mac'c'a naanaa giigisseeddawanttukko biide unttuntta, «Elleelli denddiide hawaappe kesite; ayaw gooppe, Med'inaa Goday ha katamaa d'ayssana hanee» yaageedda. Shin Aa mac'c'a naanaa giigisseeddawanttu I k'id'd'eedda giide k'oppeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Sa'ay wonttanaw holjjojji zo"iyaa wode, he kiitanchchatuu Loos'a, «Dendda! Ne machchattonne hawaan de'iyaa ne laa"u mac'c'a naanaa akkaade elleella kesa! Hewe d'ayooppe, ha katamay pirddettiyaa wode neenikka d'ayaassa» yaagiide dirbbiseeddino. <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Shin Loos'e yatti giina, he asatuu Aa kushiyaa, Aa machchatti kushiyaanne Aa mac'c'a naanaa laa"uwaa kushiyaa oyk'k'iide, he katamaappe unttuntta kesseeddino; ayaw gooppe, Med'inaa Goday unttunttoo k'aretteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">2 P'es'. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Kiitanchchatuu unttuntta katamaappe kesseedda saannakka, he kiitanchchatuwaappe ittuu yaageedda; «Hinttenttu shemppuwaa akkiide bak'atite! Guye s'eelloppite! K'ay ha wombban hak'ankka ek'k'oppite! Deriyaakko bak'atite! Hinkkoode hinttenttu d'ayana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Shin Loos'e unttunttoo yaageedda; «Tuytti! Hay ta godatoo, yaagoppite. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Taani hinttenttu k'oomay hinttenttu sintsan nashshetteeddawaa diraw, taana ashshanaw taw daroppe loytsi maadeeddita. Shin taani deriyaakko bak'atanaw danddaykke; hawe bashshay gakkiide taana muukkananne taanikka hayk'k'ana. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />S'eellite; hawaan itti katamay de'ee; I wos's'anaw matanne guutsa katamaa. Taani yaa bak'atoo? I k'eeri guutsa katamaa gidennee? Ta shemppuu yan attanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Kiitanchchay, «Ee, taani ne ooshaa sisana; taani neeni giyaa katamaa d'ayssikke. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Shin yaa elleella bak'ata; ayaw gooppe, neeni yaa gakkanaw, taani ayinne ootsanaw danddaykke» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw he katamaa suntsay zoo'aaro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zoo'aaro: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaa k'aalan «Guutsaa» giyaawaa malatee.</char></note> geetetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sodoomanne Gamoora Katamatuu D'ayeeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Loos'e S'oo'aaro gakkeedda wode, biro s'alk'k'ii doleedda. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Med'inaa Goday he wode tamaanne ees's'iyaa diiniyaa Sodoomanne Gamoora bollan Med'inaa Godaa mataappe saluwaappe bukiide bayzzeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:23-24">11:23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk'. 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:29">17:29</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:6">2 P'es'. 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Yih. 7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Hewaadan ootsiide Med'ina Goday he katamata, he wombbaa ubbaa, he katamatuwaa giddon de'iyaa ubbaanne he gadiyaan de'iyaa mitsaa maataa d'aysseedda. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Shin Loos'e machata guyye s'eellaade mas'ine tuussaa gidaaddu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:32">Luk'. 17:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Wonttetsa gallassi wontta guuran Abrahaame denddiide, Med'inaa Godaa sintsan kase I ek'k'eedda sa'aa simmiide beedda. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />I Sodoomanne Gamoora he zanggaaraan de'iyaa biittaa ubbaa duge s'eelleedda; he wode c'uway c'ooc'iyaa tamaa c'uwaadan he biittaappe denddiyaawaa be'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />S'oossay he zanggaaraa katamatuwaa d'aysseedda wode, Abrahaama hassayeedda; Loos'e de'eedda katamatuwaa d'ayssiide Loos'a bashshaappe keseedda.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Loos'e Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Loos'e zoo'aaran uttanaw yayyeedda diraw, bare mac'c'a naanaa laa"uwaanna deriyaa keseedda; gonggolo giddon bare laa"u mac'c'a naanatuwaanna utteedda. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Itti gallassi bayira naatta teefatto, «Nu aawuu c'imeedda; sa'aa ubbaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sa'aa ubbaan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha biittaan giyaawaa.</char></note> de'iyaa wogaadan nuunana gisanaw ha gadiyaan ubbakka attuma Asay baawa. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Haaya; woyniyaa eessaa nu aawuwaa ushshiide, aanana gisiide, nu aawuwaappe nu zariyaa turaa ashshooytte» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />He gallassaa k'amma barenttu aawuwaa woyniyaa eessaa ushsheeddino; bayirata gelaade aanana gisaaddu; iza aanana gisiyaa wodekka denddiyaa wodekka I eribeenna.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Wonttetsa gallassi bayirata teefatto, «Sisa; zino taani ta aabunna gisaad; hachche k'amma k'ay woyniyaa eessaa ushshina, neenikka gelaade aanana gisa; yaatiide nuuni nu aawuwaappe nu zariyaa turaa ashshoytte» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />He gallassi k'amma k'aykka woyniyaa eessaa ushsheeddino; teefatakka gelaade aanana gisaaddu; iza aanana gisiyaa wodekka denddiyaa wodekka I eribeenna. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Yaatide Loos'e mac'c'a naanay laa"attuukka barenttu aawuwaappe shahaareeddino. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Bayirata attuma na'aa yelaaddu; Aa suntsaa Moo'aaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Moo'aaba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan «Ta aawuwaappe giyaawaa malatee»</char></note> gaade suntsaaddu; inne hachche gakkanaw Moo'aabatuwaa aawuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />K'ay teefattakka attuma na'aa yelaaddu; Aa suntsaa Ben"aama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ben"aama: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan «Ta asatuwaa na'aa giyaawaa».</char></note> gaade suntsaaddu; inne hachche gakkanaw Amoonatuwaa aawuwaa.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Abrahaamenne Abimeleeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Abrahaame Mamireppe denddiide, Negeeba giyaa gadiyaa beedda; K'aadeesanne Shura giyaa katamatuwaappe gidduwaan de'eedda; Garaarankka amareeda wodiyaa takkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Yan Abrahaame bare machchatto Saaro, «Aa ta michchato» yaageedda. Garaara Kaatii Abimeleeki kiittiide Saaro afeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Dom. 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Shin S'oossay itti k'amman akumuwaan Abimeleekekko yiide, Aa hawaadan yaageedda; «Neeni aheedda machati gaasuwaan hayk'k'aasa; ayaw gooppe, iza asaa machchatto» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Shin Abimeleeki iikko shiik'ibeenna. Yaateeddawe, «Godaw, neeni s'illo kawutetsaa d'ayssaniiyye? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />I, ‹Iza ta michchato› gibeenneyye? K'ay iza, ‹I ta ishaa› gabeykkee? Taani ta wozanaa suuretetsaaninne ta kushiyaa geeshshatetsaan hawaa ootsaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Hewaappe guyye, S'oossay akumuwaan Aa yaageedda; «Ee, neeni ne wozanaa geeshshatetsaan ootseeddawaa taani eraad; hewaa diraw, neeni izo bochchenna malanne ta sintsan nagaraa ootsenna mala neena taani te'aad. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ha"i ha bitaniyaa machchatto zaara; ayaw gooppe, I Timbbitiyaa odiyaawaa; I new S'oossaa woosana; neeni pas'a de'ana. Shin izo zaarana d'ayooppe, neeninne new de'iyaabay ubbay hayk'k'iyaawaa tumuppe era» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Abimeleeki wonttetsa gallassi wontta bare kawutetsaa kaappatuwaa ubbaa s'eeseedda; ha yewuwaa ubbaa unttunttoo odina, unttunttu loytsi daro yayyeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Yaatina Abimeleeki Abrahaama s'eesiide, «Neeni ayaa nu bolla ootsaaddii? Neeni ta bollanne ta kawutetsaa bolla wolk'k'aama nagaraa ahanaw taani new ay iitabaa ootsaadditaa? Neeni ta bolla oosetanaw bessenabaa ootsaadda» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />K'aykka Abimeleeki Abrahaama, «Neena hawaa oosisseeddawe ayee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abrahaame yaageedda; « ‹S'oossaw yayyiyaa itti asaynne ha sa'aan baawa› gaade k'oppeedda diraassanne, ‹Ta machchatti gaasuwaan unttunttu taana wod'ana› gaade k'oppeedda diraassa. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Hewaa bolla iza tumukka ta michchato; ta aati naatto gidukkuppe attin, ta aabbu naatto; k'ay iza ta machchatto gidaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />S'oossay taana ta aawuwaa golliyaappe kesseedda wode taani iziw, ‹Nuuni beedda gadiyaan ubbaan neeni taw ootsana keekatetsay hawaa; «I ta ishaa» gaade tabaa haasaya› yaagaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Hewaappe guyye Abimeleeki dorssaa, mehiyaa, mac'c'a ayiletuwaanne attuma ayiletuwaa ahiide, Abrahaamew immeedda; k'ay Aa machchatto Saaro aw zaareedda. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abimeleeki, «Simmi ta biittay ne sintsaana; neena lo"osan de'a» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Saarokka, «Taani ne ishaw itti sha"a s'agaraa biraa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Itti sha"a s'agaraa biraa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe tammanne ittanne bakka kiilo giraame dees'ee.</char></note> immay; hawe simmi neenana de'iyaa ubbaa sintsan neeni s'illatto gidiyaawaanne neeni shatimmeeddawaa erissiyaawaa gido» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17-18" />Med'inaa Goday Abrahaame machchatti Saari gaasuwaan Abimeleeka golle asaa ubbaa k'antsaa maynissi wotseedda diraw, Abrahaame S'oossaa woossina, Abimeleeki, Aa machatanne Aa mac'c'a k'oomatuwaa na'aa yelana mala S'oossay unttuntta patseedda.<verse eid="GEN 20:17-18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yisaak'i Yeletteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />S'oossay bare odeeddawaadan Saarikko yeedda; S'oossay Saaro bare geeddawaadan ootseedda. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Saara shahaaraade, c'imeedda Abrahaamew S'oossay geedda wodii gakkina, attuma na'aa yelaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Saara Aw yeleedda bare na'aa suntsaa Abrahaame «Yisaak'a» yaagiide suntseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Ibr. 11:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Abrahaame bare na'aa Yisaak'a S'oossay azazeeddawaadan hosppuntsa gallassan k'as's'areedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Dom. 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:8">Kit. 7:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Aa na'aa Yisaak'i aw yeletteedda wode, Abrahaame laytsay s'eeta. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Saara, «S'oossay taw miichchaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Miichchaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay «I miic'c'ee» giyaawaa (gujji s'eelite </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:17-19">17:17-19</ref></char>).</note> immeedda; k'ay hawaa sisiyaawe ubbay taananna miic'c'ana» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />K'aykka Saara, «Abrahaamew Saara na'aa d'antsana geeddawe oonee? Gidooppenne taani ha"i aw I c'imeedda wodiyaan na'aa yelaad» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aggaaranne Ismaa'eeli Yedersseteeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Guutsa na'ay dic'c'iide; d'antsaa duutseedda; Abrahaame Yisaak'i d'antsaa duutseedda gallassi wolk'k'aama baalaa keseedda. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Shin Gibs'eppe yeedda Aggaara Abrahaamew yeleedda na'ay Yisaak'ana kaa'iyaawaa Saara be'aaddu. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Abrahaama, «Ha ayilatti na'ay ta na'aa Yisaak'ana ubbakka laattenna diraw, ayilatonne izi na'aa kessa yedda» yaagaaddu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29-30">Gal. 4:29-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Ha yewuu bare na'aa bochchiyaa diraw, Abrahaame loytsi metooteedda. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Shin S'oossay Abrahaame, «Na'awunne ne ayilatiw loytsa metoottoppa; Saara new odiyaawaa ubbaa sisa; ayaw gooppe, ne zeretsay Yisaak'a baggana s'eesettanawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Rom. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:18">Ibr. 11:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />K'ay ayilatti na'aa taani kawutetsaa kessana; ayaw gooppe, ikka ne zare» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Wontta guuran Abrahaame denddeedda; k'umaanne ogoruwaan haatsaa akkiide, Aggaaro hashiyaan toossiide, izi na'aakka iziw immiide kessi yeddeedda. Iza baade, Berssaabehe giyaa woraan toyilakattaw. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15-16" />Haatsaykka ogoruwaan wureedda wode iza, «Na'ay hayk'k'ishin, uttaade be'ikke» yaagaade, na'aa itti buuraa garssan wotsaade, laa"u s'eetu wad'aa gidiyaawaa keeshshaa baade uttaaddu. Matan uttaade, bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'issaade yeekkaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 21:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />S'oossay na'aa waasuwaa siseedda; S'oossaa kiitanchchay Aggaaro saluwaappe s'eesiide, «Aggaaree, waanaaddii? S'oossay na'ay giseedda sa'aan waassiyaawaa siseedda diraw yayyoppa; <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />dendda ek'k'a; na'aanne ne kushiyaan dentsa; ayaw gooppe, taani Aa wolk'k'aama kawutetsaa ootsana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />S'oossay izi ayfiyaa dooyina, haatsaa ollaa be'aaddu; baade ogoruwaan haatsaa kuntsaaddu; na'aakka ushshaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Na'ay dic'c'iyaa wode, S'oossay aanana gideedda; I woran de'iide, wonddaafiyaa dukkiyaa asaa gideedda. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />I Paaraana giyaa woran de'ishshin, Aa daaya Gibs'eppe aw machchatto demmaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahaameppenne Abimeleekeppe Gidduwaan Wotseedda C'aak'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />He wode, Abimeleeki bare wotaadaratuwaa kaappuwaa Pikoolaana Abrahaamekko biide, «Neeni ootsiyaa ubbaban S'oossay neenana de'ee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:26">Dom. 26:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Neeni ta bolla woy ta naanaa bolla woy ta zeretsaa bolla genebaa ootsenna mala, ha"i hawaan, S'oossaa sintsan taw c'aak'k'a; taani new keekeeddawaadan, neenikka tawunne neeni imatsatetsan de'iyaa ha biittaw lo"a» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abrahaame, «Taani c'aak'k'ay» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />He wode, Abrahaame Abimeleeka k'oomatuu akkeedda haatsaa ollaabaa Abimeleekaw maganneedda. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Shin Abimeleeki, «Hewaa ooni ootseedentto taani erikke; neenikka k'ay taw odabaakka; taani hachche gakkanaw hewaa sisabeykke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Hewaappe guyye Abrahaame dorssaanne miizzatuwaa ahiide, Abimeleekaw immina, unttunttu laa"u c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'eteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Abrahaame laappun mac'c'a dorssaa maratuwaa wudiyaappe shaakkeedda; <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleeki Abrahaama, «Ha neeni dumma shaakka wotseedda laappun mac'c'a dorssaa maratuwaa ayaw shaakkaadii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abrahaame, «Taani ha haatsaa ollaa bookkeeddawoo markka gidana mala, ha laappun mac'c'a dorssaa maratuwaa ta kushiyaappe akka» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Hewaan he laa"u asatuu c'aak'k'eteedda diraw, he sa'ay Berssaabehe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Berssaabehe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay, «C'aak'uwaa haatsaa ollaa» woy «Laappun haatsaa ollaa» giyaawaa (gujji s'eelite </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 26:33">26:33</ref></char>).</note> geetetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Berssaabehen c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'eteeddawaappe guyye, Abimeleekenne Aa wotaadaratuu kaappuwaa Pikooli denddiide, Pilss's'eema biittaa simmeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Abrahaame Berssaabehen Tamaariskke geetettiyaa mitsaa tokkeedda. Hewaan Godaa, Med'ina S'oossaa, suntsaa s'eeseedda. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Abrahaame Pilss's'eema gadiyaan daro wodiyaa de'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Yisaak'a Barew Yarshshanaadan <optbreak />S'oossay Abrahaama Azazeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Hewaappe simmiide, S'oossay Abrahaama paac'c'eedda; I Aa, «Abrahaamee» yaagiide s'eeseedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">I, «Abee» yaagiide koyeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1-23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Ibr. 11:17-19</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />S'oossay, «Neeni siik'iyaa ne mes's'i itti na'aa Yisaak'a akkaade, Mooriyaa giyaa gadiyaa ba; yan taani new odiyaa itti deriyaa bollan Aa s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa ootsaade taw yarshsha» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:1">2 Od. 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Wonttetsa gallassi Abrahaame guuran denddiide, bare hariyaa c'aaneedda; bare k'oomatuwaappe laa"uwaanne bare na'aa Yisaak'a barenana akkiide, s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa mitsaa p'alk'k'i akkiide, S'oossay aw odeedda sa'aa baanaw denddeedda. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Biide heezzentsa gallassi Abrahaame d'ok'k'u giide, he sa'aa haakuwaan be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Abrahaame bare k'oomatuwaa, «Ha hariyaana hawaan de'ishshite; taaninne ta na'ay yaa biide S'oossaw goyinniide, hinttenttukko simmana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Abrahaame yarshshuwaa mitsaa dentsiide, bare na'aa Yisaak'a tooseedda; tamaanne mashshaa I barew oyk'k'eedda. Unttunttu laa"u ittippe biishshin, <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Yisaak'i bare aawuwaa Abrahaama, «Ta aawoo» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Abrahaame, «Abee, ta na'aw» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">I, «Tamaynne mitsay hawesh; shin s'uuggiide yarshshiyaa dorssaa maray hak'anee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abrahaame, «Ta na'aw, s'uuggiide yarshshiyaa dorssaa maraa S'oossay giigisana» yaageedda. Unttunttu laa"u ittippe beeddino.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Unttunttu S'oossay aw odeedda sa'aa gakkeedda wode, Abrahaame yarshshuwaa yarshshiyaa sa'aa yan gimbbiide, mitsaa maari yeggeedda; bare na'aa Yisaak'a k'achchiide, he mitsaa bollan gisiseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:21">Yak'. 2:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Abrahaame bare na'aa shukkanaw bare kushiyaa yeddiide mashshaa akkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Shin Med'inaa Godaa kiitanchchay saluwaappe Aa, «Abrahaamee, Abrahaamee» yaagiide s'eeseedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">I, «Abee» giide koyeedda.<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Aa, «Na'aa bollan ne kushiyaa wotsoppa; Aa ayinne ootsoppa; neeni ne mes's'i itti na'aakka taana diggabeenna diraw, neeni S'oossaw yayyiyaawaa gidiyaawaa taani ha"i eray» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Abrahaame d'ok'k'u gi s'eelliide, hewaan dorssaa ittuu kac'ii buuran geli k'as'etti utteeddawaa be'eedda. Abrahaame biide he dorssaa akkiide, bare na'aa diraw s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa ootsiide yarshshi basheedda. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Hewaa diraw Abrahaame, «Med'ina Goday immana»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Med'ina Goday immana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Med'inaa Goday s'eelee.</char></note> yaagiide he sa'aa suntseedda; hachche gakkanaasikka, «Med'inaa Godaa deriyaan imettana» geetettee.<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Med'inaa Godaa kiitanchchay saluwaappe laa"entsiide Abrahaama s'eesiide yaageedda; <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />«Med'ina Goday, ‹Hawaadan yaagaade new taani ta huup'iyaan c'aak'k'ay; neeni hawaa ootseedda dirawunne ne mes's'i itti na'aakka taana diggabeenna diraw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:13-14">Ibr. 6:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />taani neena tumu anjjana; ne zeretsaakka taani saluwaa s'oolinttiyaa keenanne abbaa doonaa shafiyaa keena ootsaade c'orissana. Ne zeretsatuu barenttu morkkatuwaa katamatuwaa laattana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:12">Ibr. 11:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Neeni taw azazetteedda diraw, ha sa'aa kawutetsatuu ubbay ne zeretsaa baggana anjjettana› yaagee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:25">Kit. 3:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Hewaappe guyye, Abrahaame bare k'oomatuwaakko simmiide, unttunttu ubbay ittippe Berssaabehe denddiide beeddino. Abrahaame Berssaabehen de'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naakoora Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Hewaappe simmiide Abrahaamew, «Milkka ne ishaa Naakooraw naanaa yelaaddu; <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />unttunttune bayiray Uus'a; Uus'a ishatuu Buuza, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Araama aawuwaa K'amu'eela, Keesade, Haazo, Pilddaasha, Yidilaafanne Baatu'eela. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Hawantta ha hosppun naanaakka Milkka Abrahaame ishaa Naakooraw yelaaddu; Baatu'eeli Ribik'o yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Raa'uma giyaa Aa k'oomata k'ay S'ebaaha, Gahaama, Tahaashanne Maa'ika yelaaddu» yaagiide odeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Saari Hayk'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Saara s'eetanne laatamanne laappun laytsaa de'aaddu. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Hewaappe guyye iza Kanaane gadiyaan de'iyaa (Kebroone giyaa) K'iriyaati-Arbba'a kataman hayk'k'aaddu. Abrahaame Saariw yeekkanawunne kayyottanaw beedda.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Yeekki simmiide, Abrahaame bare machchatti anhaa mataappe denddi biide, Hiitetuwaa hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />«Taani hinttenttu giddon betenne imatsaa; ta machchatti anhaa mooganaw taw hinttenttu gadiyaappe duufuwaa zal"eerikkitee!» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:9">Ibr. 11:9</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:16">Kit. 7:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5-6" />Hiitetuu aw, «Godaw, nuuni odiyaawaa sisa; neeni nu giddon wolk'k'aama kaappuwaa; neeni ne machchatti anhaa nu duufuwaappe new lo"eeddawaan mooga; neeni ne machchatti anhaa mooganaw bare duufuwaa ooninne neena diggenna» yaagi zaareeddino.<verse eid="GEN 23:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Yaagina Abrahaame denddi ek'k'iide, Hiitetuwaa sintsan goynneedda. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8-9" />I unttunttoo, «Hinttenttu taana, ‹Ne machchatti anhaa mooga› gooppe sisite; S'ohaara na'aa Efiroonaw Aa gadiyaa gas'an de'iyaa Maakip'eela giyaa gonggoluwaa taw duufuwaa kessanaw zal"ana mala kumentsaa gatiyaan nuuna zal"iseerikkite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 23:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Hiitiyaa Efiroone he wode katamaa penggiyaan shiik'eedda bare asaa giddon utteedda; Hiitetuu ubbay sisishshin, Abrahaamew yaageedda; <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />«Hewaadan gidenna; ta godaw, ta odiyaawaa sisa; taani gadiyaakka Aa giddon de'iyaa gonggoluwaakka new immay; taani new Aa ta asaa sintsan immay; neeni ne machchatti anhaa mooga» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Abrahaame he gade asaa sintsan zaaretsi goynneedda, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />asay sisishshin Efiroona, «Ta odiyaawaa sisaarikkii! Taani he gadiyaa gatiyaa c'iggana; neeni taappe akkaarikkii! Hewaan taani ta machchatti anhaa moogana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14-15" />Efiroone Abrahaamew zaariide, «Ta godaw, taani odiyaawaa sisa; gadii oyddu s'eetu s'agaraa biraa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Oyddu s'eetu s'agaraa biraa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe oyddu kiilo giraamenne bakkaa dees'ee.</char></note> kessiyaawaa; shin hewe ne giddoninne ta giddon ayinne gidenna; ne machchatti anhaa mooga» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 23:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abrahaame Hiitetuu sisishshin, Efiroone geedda gatiyaa mayyeedda; he wode shaluwaan oyddu s'eetu s'agaraa biraa Efiroonaw immeedda.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Mamire katamaa matan Maakip'eelan de'iyaa Efiroona gadii, hewan de'iyaa gonggoluunne he gadiyaan de'iyaa mitsaa ubbay, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />katamaa penggiyaan shiik'eedda Hiitetuwaa ubbaa sintsan higgiyaan Abrahaame gade gideedda.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Hewaappe guyye, Abrahaame bare machchatto Saaro Kanaane gadiyaan (Kebroone giyaa) Mamire katamaa matan de'iyaa Maakip'eela giyaa gade gonggoluwaan moogeedda. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Hewaa diraw he gadiinne hewaan de'iyaa gonggoluu Hiitetuwaa sintsan higgiyaan Abrahaamew duufuwaa gideedda.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Yisaak'aw Machchata Ooshettaaddu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Abrahaame loytsi laytsaa sugiide c'imeedda; Med'ina Goday Aa ubbabankka anjjeedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Abrahaame bare k'oomaa, bare soo asaa ubbaw kaappotiyaa, bare asaa ubbaw godattiyaawaa hawaadan yaageedda; «Ne kushiyaan ta gulbbataa oyk'k'a;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ne kushiyaan ta gulbbataa oyk'k'a: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay c'aak'uu polo laamettenawaa bessee.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />taani unttunttu giddon de'iyaa Kanaanetuwaa mac'c'a naanatuwaappe ta na'aw machchatto oochchenna mala, Med'inaa Godaan, saluwaa S'oossaaninne sa'aa S'oossan taani neena c'aak'k'etsay; <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />shin neeni ta yeletteedda biittaa, ta dabbotuwaakko baade, ta na'aa Yisaak'aw machchatto oochcha» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Aa k'oomay, «Mac'c'aanna taananna yaanaw dosennabaa gidooppe, ne na'aa neeni yeedda gadiyaa guyye afoo?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abrahaame, «Ta na'aa yaa afenaadan neena era! <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Med'ina Goday, saluwaa S'oossay, taana ta aawuwaa sooppenne ta yeletteedda biittaappe keseeddawe taw, ‹Ne zariyaw taani ha biittaa immana› yaagiide c'aak'k'eeddawe, neeni ta na'aw yaappe machchatto demmana mala, I bare kiitanchchaa neeppe sintsaw kiittana. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Mishirata neenana guyye yaanaw dosennabaa gidooppe, ha taani neena c'aak'k'etseedda c'aak'uu new gometenna; shin ta na'aa yaa guyye ubbakka afoppa» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />K'oomay bare godaa Abrahaame gulbbataa oyk'k'eedda; ha yewoo c'aak'k'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Hewaappe guyye, k'oomay bare godaa gaalotuwaappe tammuwaa akkiidde, bare godaa miishshaappekka muruta murutaa akkiidde beedda; Masp'p'es'oomiyaa giyaa gadiyaan Naakoora katamaa gakkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Omarssi, mac'c'a Asay haatsaa tikkanaw yiyaa wodiyaan, katamaappe gas'an haatsaa ollaa matan bare gaalotuwaa gulbbatisseedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Yaatiide I hawaadan yaagiide woosseedda; «Med'inaa Godaw, ta godaa Abrahaame S'oossaw, hachche taani k'oppaade yeeddabaa taw injjeya; k'ay ta godaa Abrahaamew lo"obaa ootsa. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Be'a! Taani ha haatsaa pulttiyaa matan ek'k'ay; ha katamaa asaa mac'c'a naanay haatsaa tikkanaw haa yaana. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Taani, ‹Ane otuwaa hokisaadde taana haatsaa ushsha› giyaa wode, izakka, ‹Hey usha; k'ay ne gaaluwaa taani ushshana› yaagiyaanna, henna ne k'oomaa Yisaak'aw neeni dooreeddaano gidu; neeni ta godaw lo"obaa ootseeddawaa taani hewaan erana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Biro I woosaa wurissenaan de'ishshin, Ribik'a haatsaa otuwaa tookkaade puttu gaaddu. Izo Baatu'eeli yeleedda; Baatu'eeli Milkka na'aa; Milkka Abrahaame ishaa Naakoora machchatto. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Ribik'a loytsa puulanchchanne attuma Asay bochchibeenna wodoratto. Pulttuwaa duge wod'd'aade, bare otuwaa kuntsaade kessaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />He k'oomay iikko wos's'i biide izo, «Ne otuwaappe taana guutsa haatsaa ushshaarikkii!» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Iza, «Eeno ta godaw, ushikkii» yaagaaddu. Elleellaadde otuwaa bare hashiyaappe wotsaade, gede zaara oyk'k'aadde Aa ushshaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Aa ushsheeddawaappe guyye, «Ne gaalatuwaakka alana gakkanaw taani unttunttoo haatsaa duuk'k'ana» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Atteedda haatsaa elleella wonggiriyaan tigaade, hara haatsaa duuk'k'anaw ollaa wos's'aaddu; gaalatuu ubbay alana gakkanaw, haatsaa ollaappe duuk'k'a duuk'k'aade ahaade wonggiriyaan tigaade ushshaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />I k'oppiide yeedda k'ofaa Med'inaa Goday injjeyiidde de'intto eranaw bitanii c'o"u giide izo s'eellee.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Gaalotuu haatsaa ushi simmiina, bitanii ichcheshu giraamenne bakka gideedda work'k'aa migiduwaanne, s'eetanne tammu giraame gideedda laa"u work'k'aa sagaayetuwaa keseedda; <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />izo, «Neeni O naatti? Ane taw oda; ne aawuwaa son nuw ak'iyaa sa'ay de'anee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Iza, «Taani Baatu'eela naatto; Baatu'eeli Milkka Naakooraw yeleedda na'aa. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Nuwaan gidiyaa dalaynne bassuu de'ee; k'ay hinttenttu ak'anawukka sa'ay de'ee» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Bitanii gulbbati Med'inaa Godaw goynniidde, <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />hawaadan yaageedda; «Ta godaw keekiyaawaanne ammanettiyaawaa aggibeenna Med'ina Goday, ta godaa Abrahaama S'oossay galatetto! Taani yiishshin, Med'inaa Goday taana ta godaa dabbatuwaa soy kaaletseedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Naatta wos's'a baade, bare aati son de'iyaa asaw haneeddabaa odaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Ribik'iw Laabaana giyaa ishay de'ee; Laabaani kare kesiide, haatsaa pulttuwaa matan de'iyaa bitaniyaakko wos's'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Migiduwaanne bare michchati kushiyaan de'iyaa sagaayetuwaa be'eeddasaana Ribik'a bitanii barena geeddawaa odina sisosaanna, kesiide bitaniyaakko bi be'eedda; bitaniyaa gaalotuwaanna pulttuwaa matan ek'k'eeddawaa demmeedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Aa, «Med'inaa Goday neena anjjeedawo, haaya! Neeni hawaan karen ayaw ek'k'ay? Taani new golliyaanne gaalotookka sa'aa giigissaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Bitanii soo geleedda; Laabaani gaalotuwaa c'aanaa billeedda; dalaanne bassuwaa gaalotoo yegeedda. Gediyaa meec'c'anaw aasinne aanana de'iyaa asatoo haatsaa aheedda; <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />k'umaykka Aa sintsa aad'd'eedda. Shin I, «Taani taana aheedabaa hinttenttoo odennan de'aadde k'umaa miikke» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Laabaani, «Yaatooppe oda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Hewaa diraw I, «Taani Abrahaame k'oomaa. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Med'inaa Goday ta godaa loytsi anjjina, I duretteedda; dorssaa, miizzaa, biraa, work'k'aa, attuma k'oomatuwaa, mac'c'a k'oomatuwaa, gaalotuwaanne haretuwaa aw immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Ta godaa machata Saara bare c'iimmatetsaa laytsan aw attuma na'aa yelaaddu; I barew de'iyaawaa ubbaa aw immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Ta goday taana hawaadan c'aak'k'iseedda; ‹Taani de'iyaa Kanaane biittaa mac'c'a naanatuwaappe ta na'aw machchatto oochchoppa; <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />shin ta aawuwaa asaakko, ta zaratuwaakko baade, ta na'aw machchatto oochcha› yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Taani ta godaa, ‹Naatta taananna yaanaw dosennan aggooppe shin?› yaagaad. <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />I, ‹Med'inaa Goday, taani Aa sintsan hametteeddawe neenana bare kiitanchchaa kiittana; neeni ta na'aw ta aawuwaa asaappe, ta zaratuwaappe machchatto demmana mala, ne biyaasaakka injjeyana. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Neeni ta zaratuwaakko biina, unttunttu new izo immennan is's'ooppe, he wode new c'aak'uu gometenna› yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />«Taani hachche ha pulttuwaakko yeedda wode yaagaad; ‹Med'inaa Godaw, ta godaa Abrahaame S'oossaw, ne shene gidooppe, taani biyaa yewuwaa injjeya. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Be'a; taani ha pulttuwaa matan ek'k'ay; gellayatta ittina haatsaa tikkanaw yooppe, taani izo, «Taana ne otuwaappe guutsa haatsaa ushshaarikkii!» yaagana. <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Iza taana, «Eeno usha; k'ay ne gaalotookka taani haatsaa duuk'k'ana» yaagiyaanna, Med'inaa Goday ta godaa na'aw dooreeddaano gidu› yaagaad.<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />«Taani ta wozanaan woossiyaawaa wurissenaan de'ishshin, Ribik'a bare otuwaa tookka akkaade, puttu gaaddu; pulttuwaa duge wod'd'aade haatsaa duuk'k'aadu; taani izo, ‹Taana haatsaa ushshaarikkii› yaagaad.<verse eid="GEN 24:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />«Iza elleella bare hashiyaappe otuwaa wotsaade, ‹Hekko usha; k'ay taani ne gaalotuwaa ushshana› yaagaaddu. Taani ushaad; k'ay ta gaalotuwaa iza ushshaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 24:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />«Taani izo, ‹Neeni O naatti?› yaagaad.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">«Iza, ‹Taani Baatu'eela naatto; Baatu'eeli, Milkka Naakooraw yeleedda na'aa› yaagaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">«Taani iziw migiduwaa aatsaad; izi kushiyaankka sagaayetuwaa wotsaad. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Hewaappe guyye taani gulbbataade, Med'inaa Godaw goynnaad; taani Med'inaa Godaa, ta godaa Abrahaame S'oossaa, ta godaa ishaa na'aa naatto Aa na'aw akkanaw taana likke ogiyaa kaaletseeddawaa galatay. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Ha"ikka hinttenttu ta godaw keekanabaanne ammanettanawaa gidooppe, taw odite; gidana d'ayinttonne odite; hewaappe sintsan taani hananawaa erana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Laabaaninne Baatu'eeli zaariide yaageeddino; «Ha yewuu Med'inaa Godaappe yeedda; nuuni new yaa haa gaanaw danddayokko. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Ribik'o hanno be'a; akkaade ba; Med'inaa Goday geeddawaadan ne godaa na'aw machchatto gidu» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Abrahaama k'oomay unttunttu giyaawaa siseedda wode, sa'aan gulbbatiide Med'inaa Godaw goynneedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />K'oomay biraa alleek'k'uwaanne work'k'aa alleek'k'uwaa, mayuwaakka kessiide, Ribik'iw immeedda; k'ay al"o miishshatuwaa izi ishawunne izi aatiw immeedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Hewaappe guyye, inne aanana de'iyaawanttu meeddinonne usheeddino; yaatiide yan ak'eedino; unttunttu guuran denddiide, «Taana ta godaakko yeddite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Izi ishaynne izi aata, «Naatta itti tammu gallassaa keeshshaa nuunana takku; hewaappe guyye iza baana» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Shin I, «Med'inaa Goday taani yeeddawaa injjey diggina, hinttenttu taana gam"etsoppite; taani ta godaakko baana mala taana moyzzite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Unttunttu, «Naatto s'eesiide ane izo oochchoytte» yaageeddino. <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ribik'o s'eesiide, «Ha bitaniyaanna baanii?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Iza, «Ee; taani baana» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Unttunttu barenttu michchato Ribik'o, izo dichchiyaanina, Abrahaama k'oomaananne Aa asatuwaana moyzzeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Unttunttu Ribik'o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">«Nu michchati Ribik'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">sha"aappe sha"aa gakkanaw c'oratta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">Ne zaratuu barenttu morkkatuwaa katamatuwaa laattino» yaagiide anjjeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Hewaappe guyye, Ribik'anne izi danggaas'iretuu denddiide, gaalotuwaa toggiide, bitaniyaanna beeddino. Yaatina k'oomay Ribik'o akkiidde beedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />He wode Yisaak'i, «Taana Be'iyaa De'uwaa S'oossaa Pulttuwaa» giyaa pulttuwaa mata biide, Neegeeba woran de'ee. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Itti gallassi omarssi Yisaak'i bare wozanaan k'oppiide dembbaa kesiide yuuyyee; I d'ok'k'u giide s'eelliyaa wode, gaalatuu yiyaawantta be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Ribik'akka d'ok'k'u gaade s'eelliyaa wode, Yisaak'a be'aaddu; gaaluwaappe wod'd'aaddu. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />K'oomaa, «Ha nuunana gaketanaw dembbaana yiyaa bitanii oonee?» yaagaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">K'oomay, «I ta godaattee» yaageedda. Iza bare shaashiyaa akkaade gullottaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />K'ay k'oomay bare ootseeddawaa ubbaa Yisaak'aw odeedda. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Yisaak'i Ribik'o bare aati Saari dunkkaaniyaa afeedda. Izo akeedda; izakka aw machchatto gidaaddu. Yaatina I izo siik'eeddanne bare aati hayk'k'uwaan kayyottiyaawaappe minetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Abrahaame Hara Naanaa Yeleedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Od. 1:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />K'ay Abrahaame K'as'uro geetettiyaa hara machchatto akkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Iza Ziimiraana, Yok'ishaana, Madaana, Midiyaama, Yishibaak'anne Shuha aw yelaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yok'ishaani Saabanne Dadaana yeleedda. Dadaani Ashooreta, Les'uushetanne Le'aamata yeleedda.<verse eid="GEN 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Midiyaama naanay Eefa, Eefeera, Hanooka, Abiidaa'anne Elddaa'a. Hawanttu ubbaykka K'as'uri naanaa.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abrahaame barewaa ubbaa Yisaak'a laatisseedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Shin I biro pas'a de'iidde, bare hara machatuwaappe yeleedda naanaatoo barew de'iyaawaappe woyteedda. Bare na'aa Yisaak'appe unttuntta shaakki, away doliyaa bagga biittaw yeddeedda.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahaame Hayk'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Abrahaame mule itti s'eetanne laappun tammanne ichcheshu laytsaa de'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Abrahaame daro wodiyaa de'iide, lo"o c'imiide hayk'k'eedda; bare mayzzatuwaanna gaketteedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Aa naanay Yisaak'inne Isimaa'eeli Aa Maakip'eela giyaa gonggolo duufuwaan moogeeddino; he gonggoluu Mamire matan, Hiitiyaa S'ohaara na'aa Efiroona gadiyaan de'ee. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Hewenne Abrahaame Hiitetuwaappe shammeedda gadiyaa. Abrahaame bare machata Saara moogetteedda sa'aan moogetteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Dom. 23:3-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Abrahaame hayk'k'eeddawaappe guyye, S'oossay Aa na'aa Yisaak'a anjjeedda. He wode Yisaak'i, «Taana Be'iyaa De'uwaa S'oossaa Pulttuwaa» giyaa pulttuwaa matan de'ee.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isimaa'eela Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Saari ayilata, Gibs'eppe yeedda Aggaara, Abrahaamew yeleedda na'aa Isimaa'eela yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Isimaa'eela naanay barenttu suntsaaninne barenttu yeletaa maaran hawantta; hewanttunne: Nabaayoota, K'eedaara, Adibi'eela, Mibssaama, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishimaa'a, Duuma, Maasa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadaada, Teema, Yis'ura, Naafiishanne K'eedima. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Isimaa'eela naanay hawantta; unttunttu suntsay unttunttu mootsaaninne de'iyaa sa'aan hawaa. Unttunttu barenttu yaran tammanne laa"u kaappatuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Isimaa'eeli mule s'eetanne hattamanne laappun laytsaa de'iide, hayk'k'eedda; bare mayzzatuwaanna gaketteedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Isimaa'eela zaratuu Gibs'eppe away doliyaa baggan de'iyaa Hawiilappenne Shurappe gidduwaan, Asoora afiyaa ogiyaa matan de'eeddino. Unttunttu barenttu ishatuwaa ubbaanna morkkiyaan de'eeddino.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobinne Eesay Yeletteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Abrahaama na'aa Yisaak'a yeletay hawaappe kaaliide s'aafetteeddawaa. Abrahaame Yisaak'a yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Yisaak'aw laytsay oytamuwaa gideedda wode, Ribik'o akkeedda; iza Masp'p'es'oomiyaan de'iyaa Sooriyaa Baatu'eela naattiwune Sooriyaa Laabaana michchato. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Yisaak'i bare machata mantsato gideedda diraw, iziw Med'inaa Godaa woosseedda; Med'inaa Goday Aa woosaa siseedda. Yaatina Aa machata Ribik'a shahaaraaddu. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Shin izi ulo giddon de'iyaa naanay mantte gidi uttiide, ittuu ittuwaanna sugetteeddino; yaatina iza, «Hawe taw ayaw hanii?» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Med'inaa Godaa oochchanaw baaddu.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Med'inaa Goday iziw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:12">Rom. 9:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">«Ne uluwaan laa"u kawutetsay de'ee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">K'ay ne gidduwaan de'iyaa laa"u gade asatuu ittuu ittuwaappe shaakettana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Itti gade asatuu hinkkotuwaappe minnana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">K'ay bayiray teefaw azazettana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Iza yeliyaa wodii gakkina, izi uluwaan mantte attuma naanay de'iino. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Koyro yeletteeddawe arssa; Aa bollaa ubbaa isikii mayyeedda; hewaa diraw unttunttu Aa Eesaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eesaw: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay, «Isikaama» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseeddino. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Hewaappe guyye, Aa ishay yeletteedda; I bare kushiyaan Eesaw ginddiyaa oyk'k'i utteedda; hewaa diraw Aa Yaak'ooba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yaak'ooba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay, Ginddiyaa oyk'k'iyaawaa giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseeddino. Ribik'a unttuntta yeleedda wode, Yisaak'aw usuppun tammu laytsaa gideedda.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Naanay dic'c'eeddino; Eesay shankkaa hiillaa eriyaa bazuwaa asaa gideedda; shin Yaak'oobi dunkkaaniyaan de'iyaa woppa asaa gideedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Yisaak'i Eesaa siik'eedda; ayaw gooppe, I shankkateeddabaappe maanaw doseedda; shin Ribik'a Yaak'ooba siik'aaddu.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Itti gede Yaak'oobi wos'iyaa katsishin, Eesay koshay wod'eeddawe, woraappe yeedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Eesay Yaak'ooba, «Taana ha zo'o wos'iyaappe miza; taana koshay wod'eedda» yaageedda. (Hewaa diraw k'ay Aa suntsay Eedooma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eedooma: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Zo'uwaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> geetetteedda).<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yaak'oobi Aa, «Koyro taw ne bayiratetsaa zal"a» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Eesay, «Be'a! Taani hayk'k'ana hanay; ha bayiratetsay taw ayaa go"i de'ii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yaak'oobi zaariide, «Ane taw koyro neeni c'aak'k'a»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:16">Ibr. 12:16</ref></char></note> yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:33">I c'aak'k'eedda; bare bayiratetsaa Yaak'oobaw zal"eedda. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Yaak'oobi Eesaw sooluwaanne missiriyaa wos'iyaa immeedda; I meeddanne usheedda; hewaappe guyye denddiide beedda. Eesay bare bayiratetsaa hawaadan kad'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Yisaak'anne Abimeleeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />He gadiyaan kase Abrahaame wodiyaan de'iyaa koshaa bolla hara koshay denddeedda; yaatina Yisaak'i Piliss's'eema kaatiyaa Abimeleekekko Garaara beedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Med'ina Goday Yisaak'aw k'onc'c'iide hawaadan yaageedda; «Gibis'e gadiyaa duge booppa; taani new odeedda gadiyaan de'a. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Ha gadiyaan amareedawaa takkashsha; taani neenana gidana; neena anjjana; ayaw gooppe, ha biittaa ubbaa taani newunne ne zeretsaw immana; taani ne aawuwaa Abrahaamew c'aak'k'eedda c'aak'uwaa minisana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">Dom. 22:16-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Ne zeretsaa saluwaa s'oolinttiyaadan darissana; ha biittaa ubbaa taani unttunttoo immana; sa'aa kawutetsaa ubbay ne zeretsaa baggana anjjettana. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Ayaw gooppe, Abrahaame ta k'aalaa siseedda; ta pirddatuwaanne ta azazuwaa, ta awaayotuwaanne ta higgiyaa naageedda» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Hewaa diraw Yisaak'i Garaaran utteedda.<verse eid="GEN 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />He biittaa Asay Ribik'ibaa dentsiide Yisaak'a, «Hanna new ayee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:7">I, «Hanna taw michchato» yaageedda. Ayaw gooppe, I Ribik'a daro puulanchcha gidiyaa diraw, «Taani, ‹Iza ta machchatto gooppe›, ha gade Asay izi gaasuwaan taana wod'anenttonne» yaagi k'oppiide yayyeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Dom. 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 20:2">20:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Yisaak'i hewaan daro wodiyaa de'owaappe guyye, Pilss's'eema Kaatii Abimeleeki maskkootiyaanna duge s'eeliide, Yisaak'i bare machchatti Ribik'ina gaketishin be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Hewaa diraw Abimeleeki Yisaak'a s'eesiide, «Hekko iza tumu ne machchato! Neeni ayaw, ‹Iza ta michchato› gaaddii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Yisaak'i, « ‹Iza ta machchatto gooppe›, izi gaasuwaan Asay taana wod'ana gaade gaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimeleeki, «Hawe neeni nu bollan ootseeddabay ayee? Ta asaappe itti Asay ne machchattina gisi diggeeddashin; neeni nu bollan gomiyaa ahaadashin» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Hewaa diraw Abimeleeki bare asaa ubbaa, «Ha bitaniyaa woy Aa machchatto bochchiyaa ooninne tumu hayk'k'ana» yaagiide azazeedda.<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Yisaak'i he gadiyaan katsaa zeriide, he laytsan s'eetu kushiyaa c'akkeedda; ayaw gooppe, Med'inaa Goday Aa anjjeedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />I duretteedda; duretaa bolla duretay aw dari dari beedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Yisaak'aw dorssaa wudii, miizzaa wudiinne k'oomatuu loytsi dareedda diraw, Pilss's'eema asatuu Aa k'anaateeddino. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Hewaa diraw, Aa aawuwaa Abrahaame wodiyaan, Aa aawuwaa k'oomatuu bookkeedda haatsaa ollaa ubbaa Pilss's'eema asatuwaa biittaa zaariide bareedino.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />He wode Abimeleeki Yisaak'a, «Nuuppe shaakettaade ba; neeni nuuppe aad'd'a minnaadda» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Yisaak'i hewaappe denddiide, Garaara Wombbaa biide yan utteedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Yisaak'i bare aawuwaa Abrahaame wodiyaan booketteedda haatsaa ollatuwaa, Abrahaame hayk'k'eeddawaappe guyye, Pilss's'eema asatuu bareedawantta zaari bookki kessiide, Aa aawuu suntseedda suntsan unttuntta s'eeseedda.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Yisaak'a k'oomatuu wombban bookkiide, pulttiyaa haatsaa ollaa yan demmeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Shin Garaara hentsanchchatuu Yisaak'a hentsanchchatuwaana, «Haatsay nuwaa» yaagiide walak'etteeddino. Unttunttu aanana palumetteedda diraw, Yisaak'i he haatsaa ollaa, «Palumiyaa» giide suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Hewaappe guyye, unttunttu hara haatsaa ollaakka bookkeeddino; shin unttunttu he haatsaa ollaa geeduwaan walak'etteeddino; hewaa diraw I he haatsaa ollaa «Morkketiitta» giide suntseedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Hewaappe guutsaa zardda''iide, hara haatsaa ollaa bookisseedda; Aa gaasuwaan ooninne walak'ettibeenna; «S'oossay ha"i nuw aasseeda; nuuni ha gadiyaan c'oraana» giide Aa, «Aako sa'aa» giide suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Hewaappe denddiide, pude Berssaabehe beedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />He beedda gallassi k'amma Med'ina Goday Aw k'onc'c'iide Aa, «Taani ne aawuwaa Abrahaame S'oossaa; taani neenana de'iyaa diraw, neeni yayyoppa; taani neena anjjana; ta k'oomaa Abrahaame diraw ne zeretsaa taani c'orissana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Yisaak'i hewaan yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'iide, Med'inaa Godaa suntsaa s'eeseedda. Yan I bare dunkkaaniyaa d'ogeedda; k'ay yan Aa k'oomatuu haatsaa ollaa bookkeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Hewaappe guyye, Abimeleeki barena zoriyaa Ahuuzatanne bare wotaadaratuwaa kaappuwaa Pikoola akkiidde, Garaarappe Yisaak'akko yeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">Dom. 21:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Yisaak'i unttuntta, «Hinttenttu kase taana is's'iide, hinttenttu biittaappe kessi yeddeeddita; ha"i k'ay taakko ayaa akkana yedditee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28-29" />Unttunttu Aa, «Med'inaa Goday neenana de'iyaawaa nuuni k'onc'c'iyaan be'eeddo. Hewaa diraw c'aak'k'o c'aak'uu nu giddoninne ne giddon de'ana koshshee yaagetto. Nuuni neena bochchibeykko; shin nuuni new keekatetsaa s'alalaa ootsiide, neena sarotetsaan moyzzi yeddeeddo. Hewaaddankka neeni nu bolla iitabaa ootsenna mala, ane neenana c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'etoytte. Ha"i neeni Med'inaa Goday anjjeedawaa» yaageeddino. <verse eid="GEN 26:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />He wode Yisaak'i unttunttoo baalaa giigissina, meeddinonne usheeddino. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Wonttetsa gallassi wontta guuran denddiide, unttunttu ittuu ittuwaanna c'aak'k'eteeddino. Yisaak'i unttuntta moyzzina, unttunttu aappe saro shaakettiide beeddino.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />He gallassi Yisaak'a k'oomatuu yiide, barenttu bookkeedda haatsaa ollaabaa aw odeeddino; «Nuuni haatsaa demmeeddo» yaageeddino. <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />I he haatsaa ollaa Saabehi giide suntseedda; hewaa diraw he katamaa suntsay hachche gakkanaw Berssaabehi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Berssaabehi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «C'aak'uwaa haatsaa ollaa» giyaawaa (gujji s'eelite </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:31">21:31</ref></char>).</note> geetettee.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eesay Hiitetuwaa Machatuwaa Akkeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Eesaa laytsay oytamuwaa gidiyaa wode, Hiitiyaa Bi'eedo naatto Yooditonne Hiitiyaa Eloona naatto Baasemaato akkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Unttunttu Yisaak'anne Ribik'o kayyoyiidde de'eeddino.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Yisaak'i Yaak'ooba Anjjeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Yisaak'i c'imina, Aa ayfii s'eelaa is's'eedda wode, bare bayiratiyaa na'aa Eesaa s'eesiide Aa, «Ta na'aw» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">I, «Abee» giide koyeedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />I, «Be'a, ha"i taani c'imaad; taani hayk'ana gallassaa erikke. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Yaatiyaa diraw, ha"i ne shankkatiyaa wonddaafiyaanne zubbiyaa akkaade, bazuwaa ba; do'aa taw shankkataade, ashuwaa akkaade ya. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Mal"o k'umaa, taani dosiyaawaa katsaade aatsa; hewenne taani hayk'k'anaappe kase neena anjjanaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Ribik'a Yisaak'i bare na'aa Eesaw odiyaa wode sisaaddu. Eesay do'aa shankkatiide ahanaw bazuwaa beeddawaappe guyye, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Ribik'a bare na'aa Yaak'ooba, «Ne aawuu ne ishaa Eesaw, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‹Do'aa shankkata ahaade, taw mal"o k'umaa taani maanaw katsaa; hewenne taani hayk'k'anaappe kasetaade, Med'inaa Godaa sintsaan neena anjjanaassa› yaagiyaawaa taani sisaad. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Ta na'aw, ha"i taani neena azaziyaawaa loytsaade sisa. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Wudiyaa garssa baade, laa"u bolttiboltta deeshshaa maratuwaa taw akkaade ya; taani ne aabboo mal"o k'umaa I dosiyaawaadan katsana. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Ne aawuu miide hayk'k'ennan kasetiide neena anjjana mala, aw aatsaasa» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Shin Yaak'oobi bare aatto Ribik'o, «Ta ishaa Eesaa bollan isikii de'ee; shin ta bollay liik'o. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Ta aawuu taana oyk'k'i be'ooppe shin? Taani Aa c'immiyaawaa aw malatina, taani anjjuwaa diraw shek'aa ta bolla ahanenttone» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Aa daaya Aa, «Ta na'aw, he shek'ay taana gakko. Taani new odiyaawaa ootsa; baade deeshsha maratuwaa taw akkaade ya» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Bi ahiide bare daayiw immeedda; Aa daaya mal"o k'umaa Aa aawuu dosiyaawaadan katsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Hewaappe guyye, Ribik'a son bare matan de'iyaa bare bayira na'aa Eesaa mayuwaa lo"uwaa ahaade, bare teefa na'aa Yaak'ooba mayzzaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />K'ay he deeshshatuwaa galbbaa Aa kushiyaanne Aa liik'o k'ood'iyaa mayzzaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Bare katseedda mal"o k'umaanne ukitsaa bare na'aa Yaak'ooba kushiyaan wotsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Yaatina I bare aawuwaakko biide geliide, «Ta aawoo» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">I, «Abee! Ta na'aw, neeni oonee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yaak'oobi bare aawuwaa, «Taani ne bayira na'aa Eesaa; neeni taana azazeeddawaadan taani ootsaad; dendda; dendda uttaade, taani shankkaappe aheedawaa ma; yaataade taana anjja» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Yisaak'i bare na'aa, «Ta na'aw, waata elleella demmad?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">I, «Med'inaa Goday ne S'oossay taana maaddeedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Yisaak'i Yaak'ooba, «Ta na'aw, neeni tumu ta na'aa Eesenttonne taani oyk'k'a be'anaw ane taakko shiik'a» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yaak'oobi bare aawuwaa Yisaak'akko shiik'ina oyk'k'i be'iide, «Ha k'aalay Yaak'ooba k'aalaa; shin kushii Eesaa kushiyaa» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Aa kushii Aa ishaa Eesaa kushiyaadan isikiyaana de'iyaa diraw, eribeenna; I erennan Aa anjjeedda. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Aa, «Tumu neeni ta na'aa Eeseyee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">I, «Ee, taanattee» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />I, «Ta na'aw, taani neeni shankkateeddawaa maanaw haa aatsa; maade taani neena anjjana» yaageedda. Yaak'oobi aatsina, I meedda; k'ay I aw woyniyaa eessaa ahina usheedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Hewaappe guyye Aa aawuwaa Yisaak'i, «Ta na'aw, haaya; shiik'aade taana yera» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Yaak'oobi shiik'iide Aa yereedda; Yisaak'i Aa mayuwaa singgi sisiide, hawaadan yaagiide anjjeedda; «Ta na'aa peenuu Med'inaa Goday anjjeedda goshshaadan sawee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:27-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibr. 11:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />S'oossay saluwaa c'okkuwaanne sa'aa shic'aa, katsaanne ooratsa woyniyaa eessaa darssiide new immo. <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Kawutetsatuu new moodettino; asatuu new gulbbatino. Neeni ne ishatoo goda gida; ne aati zaratuu new gulbbatino. Neena shek'k'iyaawe shek'etteeddawaa gido; neena anjjiyaawe anjjetteeddawaa gido» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Dom. 12:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Yisaak'i Yaak'ooba anjji wursseeddawaappe guyye, Yaak'oobi bare aawuwaa Yisaak'a sintsaappe kesowaan Eesay shankkaappe puttu geedda. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Ikka k'ay mal"o k'umaa katsiide, bare aawoo aatseedda. Aa, «Ta aawoo, dendda; dendda uttaade, taani shankkateeddawaappe ma; yaataade taana anjja» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Aa aawuu Yisaak'i Aa, «Neeni oonee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">I, «Taani ne na'aa, ne bayira na'aa Eesaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Yisaak'i dagammiide kokkoriidde; «Yaatina do'aa shankkateeddawaa akkiidde taw aatseedawe oonee? Taani ha"i neeni yaana sintsan maade, Aa anjja diggaad; tumukka I anjjetteeddawaa gidanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Eesay bare aawuwaa k'aalaa siseedda wode, bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, daro yibbaata yeekuwaa yeekkiide bare aawuwaa, «Taana anjja; ta aawoo, taanakka anjja!» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Shin I, «Ne ishay yiide c'immiidde, ne anjjuwaa aki diggeedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Eesay, «Aa eriide Yaak'ooba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yaak'ooba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «C'immeedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntseedda; I taana c'immoode, hawe laa"entsuwaa; I ta bayiratetsaa akkeedda; k'ay ha"i ta anjjuwaa akkeedda» yaageedda. K'ay I, «Neeni taw anjjuwaappe ayaanne ashshabeykkii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Yisaak'i Eesaa, «Taani Aa new goda ootsaad; Aa ishatuwaa ubbaakka Aa k'oomatuwaa ootsaad; k'ay taani katsaaninne ooratsa woyniyaa eessan Aa minisaad. Yaatina, ta na'aw, new taani ayaa ootsoo?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Eesay bare aawuwaa, «Ta aawoo, new itti anjjo s'alalay de'ii? Ta aawoo, taanakka k'ay anjja» yaageedda. Hewaappe guyye, Eesay bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide yeekkeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:17">Ibr. 12:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Aa aawuwaa Yisaak'i zaariide,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibr. 11:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">«Ne de'iyaa ha sa'aa duretetsaappe haakkaade de'ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">Saluwaa c'okkuukka new wod'd'enna;<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Neeni ne mashshaan ak'ana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">Dom. 36:8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:20">2 Kat. 8:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">Neeni ne ishaw moodetana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Shin neeni aanana ek'ettiyaa wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">Aa morge mitsa ne morggiyaappe olana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Yaak'ooba Aa aawuu anjjeedda diraw, Eesay bare uluwaan Aa morkkeedda; I bare wozanaan, «Ta aawuu hayana mateedda; taani aw kayyotta simmaade, ta ishaa Yaak'ooba wod'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Shin Ribik'a ha bare bayira na'aa Eesaa k'aalaa siseedda diraw, bare teefa na'aa Yaak'ooba s'eesissa ahaade hawaadan yaagaaddu; «Ne ishay Eesay neena wod'iide haluwaa kesanaw halchcheedda. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Hayyanaa ta na'aw, taani new odowaa ootsa. Dendda! Kaaraanen de'iyaa ta ishaa Laabaanakko bak'ata! <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Yaataade ne ishaa hank'k'uu dochchana gakkanaw, amareeda wodiyaa aanana de'ashsha. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Ne ishay new hank'k'ettiyaawaa aggiyaa wodenne, neeni Aa bolla ootseeddawaa I dogiyaa wode, taani kiittaade neena yaappe ahissana. Taani itti gallassi hinttenttu laa"uwaappe mela kessana koyikke» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisaak'i Yaak'ooba Laabaanakko Yeddeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Hewaappe guyye Ribik'a Yisaak'a, «Eesay akkeedda Hiitetuwaa mac'c'a naanaa gaasuwaan taani ta de'uwaa shenetaad; k'ay Yaak'oobikka hawanttu mala Hiitetuwaa mac'c'a naanatuwaappe machchatto akkooppe, taani simmi hayk'k'anaw koyaad» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Hewaa diraw, Yisaak'i Yaak'ooba s'eesiide hawaadan anjjeedanne azazeedda; «Kanaane gadiyaa mac'c'a naanatuwaappe new machchatto akkoppa. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Dendda! Ne daay aawuwaa Baatu'eelakko, Masp'p'es'oomiyaa gadiyaa baade yaappe ne daay ishaa Laabaana mac'c'a naanatuwaappe ittinno new machchatto ootsaade akka. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay neena anjjo; I ne yeletaa aasso; neeni itti dere asaa keena gakkanaw neena c'orisso. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Neeni ha"i betetetsan utteedda ha biittaa newaa ootsana mala newunne ne zeretsaw S'oossay Abrahaame anjjuwaa immo» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Dom. 17:4-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Yisaak'i Yaak'ooba yeddeedda; Yaak'oobi Masp'p'es'oomiyaa gadiyaa Laabaanakko beedda. Laabaani Yaak'oobanne Eesaa yeleedda aati Ribik'a ishaanne Sooriyaa Baatu'eela na'aa.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eesay Hara Machchiyaa Gujjiide Akkeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Yisaak'i Yaak'ooba anjjeedawaanne, yaappe machchatto akkanaw Masp'p'es'oomiyaa gadiyaa Aa yedeeddawaa, k'ay I Yaak'ooba anjjeedda wode, «Kanaane mac'c'a asaa akkoppa» yaagiide azazeeddawaanne, <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Yaak'oobi bare aawuwaanne bare aatonne azazettiide, Masp'p'es'oomiyaa gadiyaa beeddawaa Eesay ereedda. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Eesay hewaan Kanaane biittaa mac'c'awunna bare aawuwaa Yisaak'a ay keeshshaa iitintto akeekeedda. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Hewaa diraw Eesay Abrahaame na'aa Isimaa'eelekko biide, Aa naatto Maahilaato bare machatuwaa bolla gujjiide akkeedda. Iza Nabaayoota michchato.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Beeteelen Be'eedda Akumuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yaak'oobi Berssaabeheppe Kaaraane baanaw denddeedda. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />I itti sa'aa gakkina away wullina, yan k'ammaa ak'eeda. He sa'aan de'iyaa shuchchatuwaappe ittuwaa akkiidde, bare huup'iyaan borkkotiide he sa'aan gem"isheedda. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />I akumuwaa akumeteedda; he akumuwaan gayyiyaa ittuu biittan ek'k'ina, aw s'eeray saluwaa gakkiyaawaan, S'oossaa kiitanchchatuu gi"ishiinanne wod'd'ishin be'eedda;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Yoh. 1:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />gayyiyaw bolla s'eeran Med'inaa Goday ek'k'iide Aa, «Taani Med'inaa Godaa, ne aawuwaa Abrahaama S'oossaa, Yisaak'a S'oossaa. Ha neeni giseedda biittaa newunne ne zeretsaw immana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-15">Dom. 13:14-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Ne zeretsay sa'aa shafiyaadan darana; neeni away wulliyaa baggananne, away doliyaa baggana, huup'issananne hirkki baggana de'iyaa sa'aa gakkanaw aakkana; sa'aa bollan de'iyaa Asay ubbay ne baggananne ne zeretsaa baggana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ne baggananne ne zeretsaa baggana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sa'aa bollan de'iyaa asay ubbay neenanne ne zeretsaa anjjowaadan anjjana mala taana woosana guussaa.</char></note> anjjettana <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Taani neenana de'ay; neeni biyaasa'aa ubbaan taani neena naagana; k'ay taani neena ha gadiyaa guyye zaaraade ahana; taani new ootsana geeddawaa ootsana gakkanaw neena yeggikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Yaak'oobi gem"ishuwaappe beegotteedda wode, «Med'inaa Goday tumu ha sa'aan de'ee; taani erabeykkeppe attin» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />I yayyiide, «Ha sa'ay wooti yashshii! Ha sa'ay S'oossaa golliyaappe attin, ayinne hara sa'aa gidenna; hawe saluwaa penggiyaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Wonttetsa gallassi wontta guuran Yaak'oobi denddiide, bare borkkoteedda shuchchaa akkiidde, tuussaadan essiide, S'oossaw dummayanaw Aa bolla zayitiyaa tigeedda. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Yaak'oobi he sa'aa Beeteele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Beeteele: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «S'oossaa Golliyaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide s'eeseedda. Shin he katamay hewaappe kase Looza geetettee.<verse eid="GEN 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20-21" />Yaak'oobi hawaadan yaagiide shiik'k'eedda; «Ta aawuwaa soo taani saro simmana mala S'oossay taananna gidooppe, taani biyaa ha buussan taana naagooppenne taw miyaa k'umaanne mayiyaa mayuwaa immooppe, Med'inaa Goday ta S'oossaa gidana; <verse eid="GEN 28:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />taani tuussaadan esseedda ha shuchchay S'oossaa golliyaa gidana. Neeni taw immiyaawaa ubbaappe tammuwaappe ittuwaa taani new immana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Laabaana Soo Gakkeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Hewaappe guyye, Yaak'oobi denddi biide, away doliyaa bagga asatuwaa gadiyaa gakkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Itti haatsaa ollay dembban de'iyaawaa be'eedda; heezzu dorssaa wudii k'ay he ollaa matan giseeddino. Ayaw gooppe, wudii ubbay haatsaa ushiyaawe he ollaappe. He haatsaa ollaa doonaan de'iyaa shuchchay wolk'k'aama. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Dorssaa wudii ubbay hewaan dagatteedda wode, he wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttu haatsaa ollaa doonaappe he shuchchaa gonddorssiide dorssaa ushshiino. He shuchchaa ollaa doonaan zaariide wotsino.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yaak'oobi unttuntta, «Ta ishatoo, hinttenttu hak'appe yeddite?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Unttunttu, «Nuuni Kaaraaneppe yeeddo» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />I, «Naakoora na'aa na'aa Laabaana hinttenttu eriiteyye?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Unttunttu, «Ee, Aa ereetto» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Yaak'oobi unttuntta, «I lo"o de'ii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Unttunttu, «Ee, lo"a; Aa naatta Raaheela dorssaa akkaade yewunno hanno be'a» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yaak'oobi unttuntta, «Be'ite; away ha"i wullibeena; wudiyaa mehii soo shiik'iyaa wodii biro gakkibeenna; dorssaa ha"i ushshi afiide, heemmite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Shin unttunttu, «Wudii ubbay shiik'ana gakkanaw, shuchchaa haatsaa ollaa doonaappe gonddorssana gakkanaw, nuuni ushshanaw danddayokko. Hewaappe guyye, nuuni dorssaa ushshana» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />I biro haasayishin, Laabaana naatta Raaheela bare aawuwaa dorssatuwaa laagga akkaade gakkaaddu; ayaw gooppe, iza dorssaa hentsanchchaa. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yaak'oobi bare aati ishaa Laabaana naatto Raaheelo be'eedda wodenne, bare aati ishaa Laabaana dorssaa be'eedda wode, biide ollaa doonaappe shuchchaa gonddorsseedda; bare aati ishaa dorssatuwaa haatsaa ushsheedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Yaak'oobi Raaheelo yeriide, nashechchaw bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'isiide yeekkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yaak'oobi iziw aawuwaa dabbonne Ribik'i na'aa gidiyaawaa Raaheeliw odeedda. Hewaa diraw iza wos's'a baade bare aawoo odaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Laabaani bare michchati na'aa Yaak'ooba woriyaa siseedda saannakka, aanana gaketanaw wos's'eedda. Aa idimmi yeriide, bare soo afeedda. Yan Yaak'oobi haneeddawaa ubbaa Laabaanaw odeedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Laabaani Aa, «Neeni tumu ta ashonne ta suutsaa» yaageedda. Yaak'oobi aanana itti aginaa kumentsaa utteedda.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Raaheeli Dirawunne Liya Diraw Laabaw Ootseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Hewaappe guyye Laabaani Aa, «Neeni taw dabbo gideedda diraw, taw c'oo mela ootsaniyee? Ane new ayaa c'igganaw bessintto taw oda» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Laabaanaw laa"u mac'c'a naanatuu de'iino; bayirati suntsay Liyo, teefattiwe Raaheelo. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Liya ayfiyaana c'uuc'a; shin Raaheela geesanchanne malaa lo"a.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yaak'oobi Raaheelo siik'iide Aa, «Taani ne teefa naatti Raaheeli diraw new laappun laytsaa ootsana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Laabaani, «Izo hara asaw immanaappe new immiyaawe lo"a; neeni taananna hawaan de'a» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Hewaa diraw Yaak'oobi Raaheelo akkanaw laappun laytsaa ootseedda; shin I izo siik'iyaa diraw, aw amareeda gallassaa malateedda.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Hewaappe guyye Yaak'oobi Laabaana, «Ta machchato taw imma; ta wodii poletteedda; taani izo akkanaw koyaad» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Hewaa diraw Laabaani hewaan de'iyaa asaa ubbaa s'eesiide, bullachchaa keseedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Shin sa'ay k'ammina, I bare naatto Liyo afiide Yaak'oobaw immeedda. Yaak'oobi izo akkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />K'ay Laabaani bare k'oomatoo Zilppo bare naatti Liyiw danggaas'ire gidanaadan immeedda.<verse eid="GEN 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Sa'ay wonttina s'eelliyaa wode, hekko Liyo! Yaatina Yaak'oobi Laabaana, «Hawe neeni ta bolla ootseeddawe ayee? Taani new ootseeddawe Raaheeli dirassa gidenneeyye? Taana ayaw c'immaad?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Laabaani Aa, «Nu biittan bayirata de'ishshin, teefatto asinaw immiyaawe woga gidenna. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />He mishiraa saaminttaa wurssa; k'ay teefatiyaanokka nuuni new immana; hewaappe guyye, hara laappun laytsaa taw ootsaasa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yaak'oobi hewaadan haniide he saaminttaa wursseedda; hewaappe guyye, Laabaani bare naatto Raaheelo aw immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />K'ay Laabaani bare k'oomato Baalo bare naatti Raaheeliw danggaas'ire gidanaadan immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yaak'oobi Raaheelo akkeedda. Raaheelo Liyippe aatsiide siik'eedda. Hara laappun laytsaa Laabaanaw ootseedda.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobaw Naanay Yeletteeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Med'inaa Goday Liya siik'ettabeennawaa be'iide, iziw yeliyaa uluwaa dooyeedda; shin Raaheela mantsato. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Liya shahaaraade attuma na'aa yelaaddu. Aa suntsakka Roobeela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Roobeela: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa birshshetsay «Hashshu! Attuma na'aa!» woy «Ta metuwaa be'eedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu; ayaw gooppe iza, «Med'inaa Goday ta metuwaa be'eedda; ha"i tumu taana ta asinay siik'ana» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 29:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Iza haraakka shahaaraade attuma na'aa yelaaddu. Iza, «Med'inaa Goday taani siik'ettabeenawaa siseedda diraw, taw hawaakka gujjeedda» yaagaadde, Aa Simoona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Simoona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa Biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Siseedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 29:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Aa haraakka shahaaraade attuma na'aa yelaaddu. Iza, «Taani aw heezzu attuma naanaa yeleedda diraw, ta asinay ha"i taananna waas'ettana» yaagaadde, Aa Leewii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Leewii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Waas'ettana» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Aa haraakka shahaaraade attuma na'aa yelaaddu. Iza, «Hachchiwaan taani Med'inaa Godaa galatana» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Aa Yihudaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yihudaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Galataa» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu. Hewaappe guyye yeluwaa essaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Raaheela Yaak'oobaw naanaa yelabeennawaa be'eedda wode, bare michchato k'anaataaddu; hewaa diraw Yaak'ooba, «Taw naanaa imma; hewe d'ayooppe, taani hayk'k'ana» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yaak'oobi Raaheelo hank'k'etsiide, «Taana new yeluwaa diggeedda S'oossaa gaaddiyye?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Iza, «Ta danggaas'irato Baalo hinno be'a; iza ta diraw yelana mala neeni izo akka; yaatooppe izi baggana taanikka na'aa daayo gidana» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Bare danggaas'iratto Baalo machchatto ootsiide akkana mala, aw immaaddu; Yaak'oobi izo akkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Baala shahaaraade attuma na'aa Yaak'oobaw yelaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Yaatina Raaheela, «S'oossay taw daannateedda; ta woosaakka sisiide, taw attuma na'aa immeedda» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Aa Daana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Daana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «S'oossay taw daannateedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Raaheeli danggaas'irata Baala haraa shahaaraade, Yaak'oobaw laa"entsuwaa attuma na'aa yelaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Raaheela, «Taani ta michchatina wolk'k'aama baas'iyaa baas'etaade s'oonaad» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Aa Nifttaaleema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nifttaaleema: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Baas'iyaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Liya barew yeluu ek'k'eeddawaa be'aade, bare danggaas'irato Zilppo afaade Yaak'oobi izo akkana mala immaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Liya danggaas'irata Zilppa attuma na'aa Yaak'oobaw yelaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Liya, «Laa hawe ayaa lo"o kaac'ee!» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Gaada<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gaada: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Lo"o kaac'aa» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Liya danggaas'irata Zilppa Yaak'oobaw laa"entsuwaa attuma na'aa yelaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Liya, «Taani ay keeshshaa nashettayttaasha! Mac'c'a Asay taana nashettiyaanno gaana» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Aa Aaseera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aaseera: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Nashechchaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Zarggaa c'akkiyaa aginaan Roobeeli gade biide, inkkoyiyaa giyaa timaatimiyaa malatiyaa teeraa demmiide, bare aati Liyiw aheedda. Raaheela Liyo, «Ne na'aa inkkoyiyaappe taw imma» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Shin Liya, «Ta asina neeni wotsa akkeeddawe gidennaan is's'ina, k'ay ta na'aa inkkoyiyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Inkkoyiyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeluwaanne siik'uwaa immee giide k'ofetiyaa mitsaa.</char></note> akkay?» yaagaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Raaheela, «Yaatooppe, ne na'aa inkkoyiyaa diraw Yaak'oobi hachche k'ammaa neenanna ak'o» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />He gallassaa omarssi Yaak'oobi woraappe yeedda wode, Liya Aa mokkanaw kesaade Aa, «Neeni taananna ak'ana koshshee; ayaw gooppe, taani ta na'aa inkkoyiyaan neena keraw akka diggaad» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw I he gallassaa k'amma izina ak'eeda.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />S'oossay Liya woosaa siseedda; iza shahaaraade, ichcheshantsa attuma na'aa Yaak'oobaw yelaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Liya, «Taani ta danggaas'irato ta asinaw immeedda diraw, S'oossay hewaa keraa taw c'iggeedda» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Aa Yisaakoora<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yisaakoora: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Keraa taw c'iggeedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> gaade suntsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Liya haraakka shahaaraade, usuppuntsa attuma na'aa Yaak'oobaw yelaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Liya, «S'oossay taw al"o imotaa immeedda; taani ta asinaw usuppun naanaa yeleedda diraw, ha"i I taana bonchchanawaa» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Aa Zaabiloona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zaabiloona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Bonchchuwaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Hewaappe guyye itti mac'c'a naatto yelaaddu; izo Diino suntsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />S'oossay Raaheelo hassayeedda; izi woosaa sisiide izi yeliyaa uluwaa dooyeedda. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Iza shahaaraade attuma na'aa yelaaddu; «S'oossay ta yeellaa k'aareedda. <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Med'ina Goday taw hara attuma na'aakka gujjeerenneeshsha» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw Aa Yooseefo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yooseefo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa Biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Gujjo» woy «K'aareedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Laabaana Dirgguwaan Palumetteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Raaheela Yooseefa yeleeddawaappe guyye, Yaak'oobi Laabaana, «Taani ta aawuwaa gadiyaa simmana mala, taana moyzza. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Taani unttunttu diraw new ootseedda ta machatuwaanne ta naanaa hamma; taani baana; ayaw gooppe, taani new ay keeshshaa oosuwaa ootseedentto neeni eraasa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Shin Laabaani Aa, «Taani new ittibaa oday; Med'inaa Goday ne gaasuwaan taana anjjeedawaa taani be'aaddi. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Ne dirgguwaa taw oda; taani new c'iggana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yaak'oobi, «Taani new waata ootseedentto, ne mehiikka waan yeletteeddentto neeni eraasa. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Taani yaanaappe kase new de'iyaa guutsay ha"i loytsi dareedda; Med'inaa Goday neena taani aad'd'eedda sa'aan ubbaan anjjeedda. Shin ha"i, taani ta soo asaw ootsanawe awudee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Laabaani, «Taani new ayaa immoo?» yaagiide Aa oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yaak'oobi, «Taw ayinne immoppa; shin neeni taw ittibaa ootsooppe, taani ne wudiyaa k'aykka heemmananne naagana. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Taani hachche ne wudiyaa ubbaa gidduwaana aad'd'ana; hewaan ne dorssaappe punc'c'ariyaa woy gazzaa ubbaa, karetsa dorssaa mara ubbaanne deeshshaappe gazzaanne punc'c'ariyaa ubbaa taani shaakkana; unttunttu ta dirgguwaa gidana. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Hewaa diraw ta s'illotetsay neeni taw c'iggeedda dirgguwaa paydanaw sintsappe yiyaa wode, taw markkattana; ta deeshshaappe gazza woy punc'c'are gidennawe woy karetsa gidenna ay dorssaa maraynne ta matan beettintto, wuu"etteeddawaadan payddettana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Laabi, «Mayyaad; neeni geeddawaadan gido» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Shin he gallassan Laabi danc'c'aa woy gazza gideedda attuma deeshshaa ubbaa, punc'c'are woy gazza gideedda mac'c'a deeshshaa ubbaa, bootsa gideedda ubbaanne karetsa dorssaa mara ubbaa kessiide, bare attuma naanaa hentseedda. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Yaatiide he wudiyaanna heezzu gallassaa ogiyaa Yaak'oobappe haakkiide beedda. Shin Yaak'oobi atteeda Laabaana wudiyaa heemmeedda.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Yaak'oobi deeshsha loomiyaappe, gumariyaappenne s'ank'k'arssaappe k'ayye gatimaa kessiide, pok'uwaa pok'k'i pok'k'iide, giddo bootsa bagga k'aariide gazzayeedda. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Wudii haatsaa ushanaw yiyaa sa'aa ubbaan, wonggiriyaan, wudiyaa sintsan pok'k'eedda gatimatuwaa wotseedda. Kahowanttu haatsaa ushanaw yiide, <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />he gatimatuwaa sintsan birasseeddino; unttunttu danc'c'aa, punc'c'arenne gazza maratuwaa yeleeddino. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yaak'oobi maratuwaa wudiyaappe shaakki dumma wotseedda; atteeda wudiyaa danc'c'anne karetsa gideedda Laabaana mehiyaa sintsa zaareedda. Yaatiide barew wudiyaa dummayeedda; Laabaana mehetuwaanna unttuntta gatsibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Pas's'anne mino mac'c'awanttu kahiyaa wode awudenne, unttunttu he gatimatuwaa matan birassana mala, Yaak'oobi he gatimatuwaa haatsaa wonggiriyaan, miizatuwaa sintsaan wotsee. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Shin mehetuu laafa gidooppe, unttunttu sintsaan gatimatuwaa wotsenna. Hewaa diraw laafiyaa mehetuu Laabawaa gidina, dariyaawanttu Yaak'oobawaa gideeddino. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Hawaadan haniide, Yaak'oobi loytsi duretiide, daro wudiyaa, mac'c'a k'oomatuwaanne attuma k'oomatuwaa, daro gaalotuwaanne haretuwaa mooddeedda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Laabaappe Bak'atiide Beedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yaak'oobi Laabaana naanay barena, «Yaak'oobi nu aawuwaa ubbaa aki diggeedda; ha duretaa ubbaa nu aawuwaappe demmeedda» giyaawaa siseedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yaak'oobi Laabaana som"i barew kasewaa mala gidennawaa be'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />He wode Med'inaa Goday Yaak'ooba, «Neeni ne aawotuwaa gadiyaa, ne dabbotuwaakko guyye simma; taani neenana gidana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Yaak'oobi Raaheelonne Liyo bare wudii de'iyaa sa'aa dembbaa yaana mala kiittiide s'eesisseedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />I unttuntta, «Hinttenttu aawuwaa som"i taw kasewaa mala gidennawaa taani be'ay; shin ta aawuwaa S'oossay taananna de'ee. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Taani ta wolk'k'aa ubbaan hinttenttu aawuu ootseeddawaa hinttenttu eriita; <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />shin hinttenttu aawuu taana c'immiidde, ta dirgguwaa tammu gede laammeedda. Gidooppenne S'oossay taana I k'ohenaadan diggeedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />I, ‹Punc'c'aretuu ne dirgguwaa gidana› giina, wudii ubbay punc'c'ariyaa yeleedda; k'ay I, ‹shachchatuu ne dirgguwaa gidana› giina, wudii ubbay shachchaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />S'oossay hawaadan hinttenttu aawuwaa mehiyaa wotsi akkiidde taw immeedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />«Mehetuu kahiyaa aginaan, taani itti akumuwaa akumetaad; he akumuwaan taani s'eelliyaa wode, wudiyaa birassiyaa deeshsha koletuu danc'c'aa, punc'c'arenne gazza. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />S'oossaa kiitanchchay akumuwaan taana, ‹Yaak'ooba› yaageedda; taani, abee yaagaadde koyaad. <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Taana I, d'ok'k'u gaade wudiyaa s'aaliyaa deeshshaa koliyaa ubbaa shachchaa, punc'c'ariyaanne gazzaa be'a; ayaw gooppe, Laabi ne bolla ootsiyaawaa ubbaa taani be'aaddi. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Neeni esseedda shuchchaa okkaadde, taw shiik'etteedda Beeteele S'oossay taana ha"i dendda; ha biittaappe kesa; guyye ne yeletaa gadiyaa simma yaageedda» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-22">Dom. 28:18-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Hewaappe guyye, Raaheelanne Liya hawaadan yaagiide zaareeddino; «Nu aawuwaappe nuuna gakkanabay ayee? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />I nuuna allagaadan s'eellee gidennee? I nuuna zal"i akkeedda; zal"iidde akkeeddawaakka mi d'aysseedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />S'oossay nu aawuwaappe wotsi akkeedda mas'uu ubbay tumukka nuwaanne nu naanaawaa. Hewaa diraw s'oossay new odeeddawaa ubbaa ootsa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17-18" />Yaak'oobi Kanaane gadiyaan de'iyaa bare aawuwaa Yisaak'akko baanaw denddeedda; I bare naanaanne bare machatuwaa gaaluwaa togisseedda; wudiyaa ubbaa bareppe sintsanna laaggiide, Masp'p'es'oomiyaan de'iidde I shiishsheedda mas'uwaa ubbaa akkiidde beedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Laabi bare dorssatuwaa isikiyaa k'ans's'anaw bidigeeddoshin, Raaheela bare aawuwaa soo misiletuwaa wuu'aaddu. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />K'ay Yaak'oobi Sooriyaa Laabaanaw bare bak'atiyaawaa odenaan c'immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />I barew de'iyaawaa ubbaa akkiidde bak'ateedda; Efiraas'iisa Shaafaa pinniide, Gala'aade giyaa gezziyaakko simmiide beedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laabi Yaak'ooba Kaalleedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Heezzentsa gallassan, Laabi Yaak'oobi bak'ati bi kichcheeddawaa siseedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Bare dabbotuwaa barenana akkiidde, laappun gallassaa ogiyaa Yaak'ooba geeduwaa kaalliidde, Gala'aade gezziyaan Aa gakkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />He wode S'oossay k'amma Sooriyaa Laabaanakko akumuwaan yiide Aa, «Neeni Yaak'ooba bolla iita gidina, lo"a gidina, ayinne haasayennaadan neena era!» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Laabi gakkiyaa wode, Yaak'oobi Gala'aade gezziyaan dunkkaaniide utteedda; k'ay Laabinne Aa dabbotuu yan dunkkaaneeddino.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Hewaappe guyye Laabi Yaak'ooba, «Neeni hawaadan ayaw ootsaaddii? Neeni taana c'immaade, ta mac'c'a naanaa olan omoodetteeddawaadan laaggaade kessaadda. <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Neeni ayaw k'osuwaan taappe kessa akkaade, taana c'immaadii? Taani neena nashechchaaninne yetsaan, karabuwaaninne diitsaan moyzzana mala taw ayaw odabeykkii? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Neeni haray atto, ta naanaa naanaanne ta mac'c'a naanaa taani yera akkena mala diggaadda. Neeni eeyyabaa ootsaadda. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Taani neena genanaw taw wolk'k'ay de'ee; shin ne aawuwaa S'oossay zino k'amma taana, ‹Yaak'ooba bolla iita gidina, lo"a gidina, ayinne haasayennaadan neena era!› yaagiide taw odeedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Ha"i gidooppenne, neeni ne aawuwaa soo baanaw loytsa laamoteedda diraw kesaadda. Shin ta soo misiletuwaa neeni ayaw wuu'aadii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yaak'oobi Laabaana, «Neeni ne naanaa taappe wolk'k'an wotsa akkaninttonne gaade k'oppeedda dirawunne yayyeedda diraw, hawaadan ootsaad. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Shin ne soo misiletuwaa oyk'k'eedda asaa oonanne neeni demmooppe, he uray siifetto! Newaa gideeddawe ta matan beettintto, nu dabbatuwaa sintsan koya; newaa gidooppe akka» yaageedda; ayaw gooppe, Yaak'oobi Raaheela he soo misiletuwaa wuu'eeddawaa eribeenna.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Hewaa diraw Laabi Yaak'ooba dunkkaaniyaa giddo, Liya dunkkaaniyaa giddon laa"u k'oomatuwaa dunkkaaniyaa giddo geleedda; shin ayinne demmibeenna. Liya dunkkaaniyaappe kesiide, Raaheeli dunkkaaniyaa geleedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Raaheela soo misiletuwaa akkaade, gaaluwaa kooraa garssan k'osaade, Aa bolla uttaaddu. Laabi dunkkaaniyaan de'iyaawaa ubbaa bulluuk'k'i koyeedda; shin ayinne demmibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Raaheela bare aawuwaa, «Ta godaw, taana hank'k'etsoppa; taani new ek'k'ana danddaykke; taw piilay yi utteedda» yaagaaddu. I koyeedda; shin soo misiletuwaa demmibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Yaak'oobi Laabaana hank'k'ettiide wok'k'aseedda; Yaak'oobi Laabaana, «Taani ayaa bayzaadittaa? Hawaa neeni taana kaallanaw, taani ootseedda nagaray ayee? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Ha"i neeni ta miishshaa ubbaa bulluk'k'aadde koyaadda; ne soo miishshaappe ayaa demmaad? Unttunttu nu laa"uwaa gidduwaan pirddana mala, ta dabbatuwaa sintsaaninne ne dabbatuwaa sintsaan hawaan wotsa.<verse eid="GEN 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />«Taani neenana laatamu laytsaa kumentsaa de'aad; ne dorssaykka ne deeshshaykka boshetibeenna; woy ne wudiyaappe s'abootiyaa mabeykke. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Do'ay mentseeddawaanne new ahabeyikke; shin hewaa taanan paydaad. Gallassi wuu'etteeddawaa woy k'amma wuu'etteeddawaa taana c'igissaadda. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Gallassaa suuluu, k'amma meeguu taana k'oheedda; gem"ishuu taappe d'ayeedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Taani hawaadan ne soon laatamu laytsaa de'aad; tammanne oyddu laytsaa ne laa"u mac'c'a naanaa dirawunne usuppun laytsaa ne wudiyaa diraw new ootsaadde de'aad; shin neeni ta dirgguwaa tammu gede laammaadda. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Ta aawuwaa S'oossay, Abrahaame S'oossay, Yisaak'i yayyeeddawe taananna gidibeennawaa gidintto, sid'e baynnan neeni taana mela kushe kessa yeddaadda; shin S'oossay ta tuggaanne ta kushiyaa oosuwaa be'iide, zino k'amma neena seereedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobinne Laabi C'aak'k'eteedda C'aak'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Laabi Yaak'ooba, «Machatuu ta mac'c'a naanaa; naanaykka ta naanaa; wudiikka ta wudiyaa; neeni be'iyaa ubbay tawaa. Hachche ha mac'c'a naanaa tawanttu bollanne unttunttu yeleedda naanaa bolla ayaa ootsanaw danddayayitaa? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Ha"i haaya; neeninne taani c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'etoytte; hewe neeppenne taappe gidduwaan markka gido» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Hewaa diraw Yaak'oobi itti shuchchaa akkiidde tuussaadan esseedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />I bare dabbotuwaa, «Shuchchaa shiishshite» yaageedda; unttunttu shuchchaa shiishshiide keeleeddinno; he keelaa lank'k'iyaan meeddino. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Laabi he keelaa, Yigaari-Sahaaduta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yigaari-Sahaaduta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Aramayssis's'e k'aalan, «Markkatetsaa keelaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseedda; k'ay Yaak'oobi Aa C'imeedda giide suntseedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Laabi, «Ha keelay neeppenne taappe gidduwaan hachche markka» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw Aa suntsay C'imeedda geetetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />K'ay I he shuchchaa tuussaa Mis'ip'p'a<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:49 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mis'ip'p'a: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Naagiyaa sa'aa» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseedda; ayaw gooppe, Laabi, «Nuuni ittuu ittuwaappe haakkiide de'iyaa wode, Med'inaa Goday ne gidduwaaninne ta gidduwaan gidiide naago. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Neeni ta mac'c'a naanaa naak'k'ooppe, woy neeni ta mac'c'a naanaa bolla hara machatuwaa akkooppe, nuunana ha"i ooninne baynnawaa gidooppenne ne gidduwaaninne ta gidduwaan S'oossay markka gidiyaawaa hassaya» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Laabi k'aykka Yaak'ooba, «Keeleteedda shuchchay hawesh; k'ay taani ne gidduwaaninne ta gidduwaan esseedda shuchchaa tuussay hawesh. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Taani ha keelaappe neena genanaw neekko aad'd'enaaddan, neenikka taana genanaw ha keelaappenne ha shuchchaa tuussaappe aad'd'enaaddan, ha keelaynne ha shuchchaa tuussay markka. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Abrahaame S'oossay, Naakoora S'oossay, unttunttu aawuwaa S'oossay, nu gidduwaan I pirddo» yaageedda. Yaak'oobi bare aawuu Yisaak'i Yayyeeddawaa suntsaan c'aak'k'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Yaak'oobi deriyaa bollan yarshshuwaa yarshsheedda; bare dabbotuwaakka k'umaa maanaw s'eeseedda. Unttunttu miide deriyaa bollan ak'eedino.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Wonttetsa gallassi guuran Laabi denddiide, bare naanaa naanaanne bare mac'c'a naanaa yereedda; k'ay unttuntta anjjeedda. Bare soo simmeedda.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Eesaanna Gaketanaw Giigeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yaak'oobi denddiide bare ogiyaa biishshin, S'oossaa kiitanchchatuu aanana gaketeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yaak'oobi unttuntta be'eedda wode, «Hawe S'oossay ak'iyaa sa'aa» yaagiide, he sa'aa Maahinayma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maahinayma: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Laa"u c'uguu ak'iyaa sa'aa» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yaak'oobi Se'iira giyaa sa'aan, Eedooma biittan de'iyaa bare ishaa Eesaakko kiitaa bareppe sintsaw kiitteedda. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />I unttuntta hawaadan yaagiide azazeedda; «Hinttenttu ta godaa Eesaw gaanawe hawaa; ‹Ne k'oomay Yaak'oobi, «Taani Laabaana matan de'aadde hanno gakkanaw gam"aad. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Taw miizzaynne harii, dorssaynne deeshshay, attuma k'oomatuunne mac'c'a k'oomatuu de'iino; ha"i taani ha kiitaa ta godaa sintsaan nashettana mala kiittaad» yaageedda› yaagite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Kiitetteeddawanttu Yaak'oobakko simmiide Aa, «Nuuni ne ishaa Eesaakko beeddo; ha"i I k'ay neenana gaketanaw yee; aanana oyddu s'eetu Asay de'ee» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Yaak'oobi yayyiide batibateedda; barenana de'iyaa asaa laa"u c'itan shaakkeedda; k'ay bare dorssaa, deeshshaa, miizzaanne gaaluwaa laa"u c'itan shaakkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />I, «Eesay yiide itti c'itaa oliyaawaa gidooppe, atteeda c'uguu kessi akkooppenne» yaagiide k'oppeedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />He wode Yaak'oobi hawaadan yaagiide woosseedda; «Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, ta aawuwaa Abrahaame S'oossaw, ta aawuwaa Yisaak'a S'oossaw, taana, ‹Ne gadiyaa, ne dabbotuwaakko simma; taani new lo"obaa ootsana› geeddawoo, <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />neeni ne k'oomaw ootseedda keekkatetsawunne tumatetsaw ubbaw taani bessenawaa. Taani ha Yorddaanoosa Shaafaa pinneedda wode, taw itti s'am"aa s'alalay de'ee; shin ha"i taani laa"u c'ugo gidaaddi. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Taani neena woossay; ta ishaa Eesaa kushiyaappe taana ashsha; ayaw gooppe, I yiide, taananne mac'c'awantta unttunttu naanatuwaakka d'ayssanawenttonne gaade yayaad. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Shin neeni taana, ‹Taani new tumu lo"obaa ootsana; taani ne zeretsaanne paydanaw danddayettenna abbaa shafiyaa keeshshaa ootsana› geeddawaa k'oppa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Dom. 22:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />He gallassaa k'amma I yan ak'eeda; barew de'iyaawaa ubbaappe bare ishaa Eesaw immiyaawaa k'oriide keseedda; <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14-15" />I kesseeddawanttu laa"u s'eetu mac'c'a deeshshatuwaanne laatamu deeshsha koletuwaa, laa"u s'eetu mac'c'a dorssatuwaanne laatamu dorssaa koletuwaa, hattamu d'antsiyaa gaalotuwaa unttunttu maratuwaanna, oytamu mac'c'a miizzatuwaa, tammu korumaa booratuwaa, laatamu mac'c'a haretuwaanne tammu attuma haretuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 32:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Hawantta wudiyaan wudiyaan shaakki, bare k'oomatuwaa kushiyaan wotsiide, bare k'oomatuwaa, «Taappe sintsaw biide, wudiyaa wudiyaappe haakuwaan haakuwaan laaggite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Sintsan kaaletsiyaawaa, «Ta ishay Eesay neenana gaketiide neena, ‹Neeni oossee? Neeni hak'a bay? Ne sintsan de'iyaa mehiyaa ubbay oossee?› yaagiide oochchiyaawaa gidooppe, <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />neeni aw, ‹Hawanttu ne k'oomaa Yaak'oobawaa; unttunttu ta godaa Eesaw immanaw yeddeeddawantta; k'ay ikka nuuppe guyyenna yide'ee› yaaga» yaagiide azazeedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />K'ay I laa'entsa heezzantsuwaan wudiyaa kaalliyaa haratuwaa ubbatuwaa hawaadan azazeedda; «Hinttenttu Eesaanna gaketiyaa wode, hanniidankka giita; <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />‹Ne k'oomaa Yaak'oobi nuuppe guyyenna yide'ee› geenan aggoppite» yaageedda. Ayaw gooppe I, «Taani taappe sintsaw immanaw kiitteeddawaan Aa doshissana; ooni erii, hewaappe guyye taani aanana gaketiyaa wode, I taana mokki akkanenttonne» yaagiide k'oppeedda. <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Hewaa diraw bare immiyaawaa bareppe sintsaw yeddeedda. Shin I bare huup'iyaw he gallassi k'amma yan ak'eeda.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi S'oossanna Baas'eteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22-23" />He gallassi k'amma Yaak'oobi denddiide, bare laa"u machatuwaa, bare laa"u k'oomatuwaanne bare naanaa tammanne ittatuwaa akkiidde, Yaabook'a giyaa pinuwaa gakkeedda; I unttuntta shaafaa pintseedda; barew de'iyaawaa ubbaakka pintsiide yeddeedda; <verse eid="GEN 32:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />shin Yaak'oobi barekka atteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:24-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3-4">Hos. 12:3-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">He wode itti Asay sa'ay wonttana gakkanaw aanana baas'eteedda. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />He Asay Aa s'oonanaw danddayibeenawaa be'eedda wode, Yaak'oobaw muk'k'eechchaa mek'etsaa bochcheedda; Aa muk'k'eechchaa mek'etsay kes wod'd'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Yaatina bitanii Aa, «Sa'ay wontteedda diraw, taana yedda» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Shin Yaak'oobi Aa, «Neeni taana anjjenan taani neena yeddikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Bitanii Aa, «Ne suntsay oonee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">I, «Yaak'ooba» yaagiide zaareedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Bitanii Aa, «Hawaappe sintsaw ne suntsay Israa'eeliyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Israa'eeliyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «S'oossaanna baas's'etteedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> geetettooppe attina, Yaak'ooba geetettoppo; ayaw gooppe, neeni S'oossaananne asaana baas'etaade s'oonaadda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:10">Dom. 35:10</ref></char></note> yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yaak'oobi Aa, «Ne suntsay oonee?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:17-18">Dat. 13:17-18</ref></char></note> yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Shin bitanii, «Neeni ta suntsaa ayaw oochchay?» yaageedda giide Aa anjjeedda.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Hewaa diraw Yaak'oobi he sa'aa P'iini"eela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">P'iini"eela: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «S'oossaa Deemuwaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseedda; ayaw gooppe I, «Taani S'oossaa bazzuwaan s'eellaad; gidooppenne taani pas'a ataad» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />I P'iini"eelappe denddiyaa wode, Aa bolla s'alk'k'ii doleedda. I bare muk'k'eechchaa mek'etsaa diraw dooggee. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Yaak'ooba muk'k'eechchaa ashuwaa matan bosheteedda diraw, Israa'eeliyaa Asay mehiyaa muk'k'eechchaa ashuwaa hachche gakkanaw meenna.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Eesaanna Gaketteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yaak'oobi d'ok'k'u gi s'eelliide, Eesay bare oyddu s'eetu asaana yiyaawaa be'eedda. Hewaa diraw naanaa Liyiw, Raaheeliwunne laa"u k'oomatuwaakko shaakkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />K'oomatuwaanne unttunttu naanaa sintsan, Liyonne I naanaa unttunttu geeduwaan, Raaheelonne Yooseefa wurssetsan wotseedda. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Shin I bare huup'iyaw sintsaw aad'd'iide, bare ishaakko matiidde, sa'aa gakki gakkiide laappun kaala goynneedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Shin Eesay aanana gaketanaw wos's'iide, Aa k'ood'iyaa k'oommi yereedda. Unttunttu yeekkeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Yaatina Eesay d'ok'k'u gi s'eelliide, machatuwaanne naanaa be'eedda; I, «Ha neenana de'iyaawanttu oonee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yaak'oobi, «Unttunttu S'oossay ne k'oomaw keekatetsaan immeedda naanaa» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />K'oomatuu barenttu naanatuwaanna shiik'iide goynneeddinno. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Hewaappe guyye, Liyanne izi naanay yiide goynneeddinno; wurssetsaan Yooseefonne Raaheela yiide goynneeddinno.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Eesay, «Ha sintsan taananna gaketeedda wudii ubbay k'ay ayee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">I, «Ta godaw, hewe taani ne sintsaan nashettanaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Shin Eesay, «Ta ishaw, taw darobay de'ee; newe neessa gido» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yaak'oobi, «Tuytti, ha"i taani ne sintsaan nashshetteedawaa gidooppe, ha taani immiyaawaa taappe akka. Neeni taana mokka akkeedda diraw, taani ne deemuwaa be'iyaawe S'oossaa deemuwaa be'iyaawaa mala. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Taani new aheedda ha imuwaa akka; ayaw gooppe, S'oossay keekiidde immina, taw besseedda» yaageedda. Yaak'oobi shoobiyaa toleedda diraw, Eesay hewaa akkeedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Hewaappe guyye Eesay, «Ane dendda; nu ogiyaa boytte; taani neenana ittippe baana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Shin Yaak'oobi Aa, «Ta godaw, naanay shuga gidiyaawaa eraasa; k'ay taani barenttu galo maratuwaa d'antsiyaa dorssatuwaanne miizzaa naagana koshshee; Asay unttunttu itti gallassaa dirbbissi laaggooppe, mehiyaa ubbay hayk'k'ana. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Hewaa diraw, ta godaw, ne k'oomaappe sintsataade ba; taani Se'iiran ta godaa gakkanaw, ta sintsaan de'iyaa mehiyaa hemetaa keenaanne naanaa hemetaa keenaa loddan kaallana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Eesay Aa, «Yaatooppe taani ta asaappe amareedawaa new ashshay» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Shin Yaak'oobi Aa, «Hewe ayissee? Taani ta godaa sintsaan nashshettiyaawe taw gidana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Hewaa diraw Eesay he gallassi ogiyaan geliide, Se'iira simmeedda. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Shin Yaak'oobi Sukkoota beedda; yan barew golliyaa kees's'eedda; bare mehetookka daasiyaa daaseedda. Hewaa diraw he sa'aa Sukkoota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sukkoota: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Daasiyaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> giide suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yaak'oobi Masp'p'es'oomiyaappe simmeedda wode, Kanaane biittan de'iyaa Sekeeme giyaa katamaa sarotetsaan gakkeedda; I he katamaw bazzuwaan utteedda. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Bare dunkkaaniyaa d'ogeedda gadiyaa Shekeema aawuwaa Hamoora naanatuwaappe s'eetu s'agaraa biran shammeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Yoh. 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Yan yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'iide Aa, «S'oossaa, Israa'eeliyaa S'oossaa» giide suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Shekeeme Diino Horeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Liya Yaak'oobaw yeleedda naatta Waana, he wode he gadiyaa mac'c'awantta be'anaw kesaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />He gadiyaa mooddiyaa Hiwiyaa Hamoora na'aa Shekeeme izo be'iide, izo hori afiide bayzzeedda. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Aa wozanay Yaak'ooba naatto Diino amotteedda; I izo siik'eedda; iziw lo"iyaawaa haasayeedda. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Shekeeme bare aawuwaa Hamoora, «Taw ha naatto machchetetsaw oochchaarikki» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yaak'oobi bare naatta Diinaa bayeeddawaa sisiyaa wode, Aa attuma naanay woran mehiyaanna de'ino; hewaa diraw unttunttu gakkanaw c'o"u geedda.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Hewaappe guyye, Shekeema aawuwaa Hamoori Yaak'oobanna haasayanaw yeedda. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Yaak'ooba attuma naanay hewaa siseedda saanna woraappe yeeddino; unttunttu kayyotteeddinonne hank'k'eteeddino; ayaw gooppe, Shekeeme Yaak'ooba naatto hori afiide bayzziyaawaa, Israa'eeliyaa bolla pokkobaa, ootsanaw bessenabaa ootseedda.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Shin Hamoori unttuntta, «Ta na'ay Shekeeme hinttenttu naattiw darssi dagammeedda; hayyanaa izo aw machchetetsaw immeerikkitee! <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Nuunana akettitenne gelettite; hinttenttu mac'c'a naanaa nuw immite; nu mac'c'a naanaanne hinttenttoo akkite. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Hinttenttu nu giddon uttanaw danddayiita; biittay loytsi aaka; aan de'ite; zal"ite; aan mas'uwaa demmite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />He wode Shekeeme Diini aawuwaanne I ishatuwaa, «Taani hinttenttu sintsaan nashettooppe, hinttenttu oochchiyaawaa ayaa gidooppenne immana. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Hinttenttu mishira naattiw immiyaawaanne c'ilooshshaa hinttenttu koyowaa keeshshaa darissiide taana oochchite; taani hinttenttu taana oochcheeddawaa ayaanne immana; shin taani akkanaaddan naatto taw immeerikkitee!» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Barenttu michchato Diino Shekeeme tunisseedda diraw, Yaak'ooba attuma naanay Shekeemawunne Aa aawuwaa Hamooraw wordduwaa odeeddino; <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />unttuntta hawaadan yaageeddino; «Nuuni hewaa mallaa ootsana danddayokko; nuuni nu michchato k'as's'arettibeenna asaw immokko; hewe nuuna kawushshiyaawaa. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Nuuni hinttenttu ittibaa ootsooppe hinttenttoo, ‹Eeno› gaana; hewe ayee gooppe, hinttenttu gadiyaa attuma Asay ubbay k'as's'arettiide nuunaadan hanooppe, <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />nuuni nu mac'c'a naanaa hinttenttoo immanaw ‹Eeno› gaana; hinttenttu mac'c'a naanaakka nuw akkana. Nuuni hinttenttu giddon uttiide, hinttenana itti asaa gidana. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Shin hinttenttu k'as's'arettanaw eeno geenawaa gidooppe, nuuni nu michchato akkiidde baana» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Unttunttu geeddawe Hamoorawunne Aa na'aa Shekeemaw lo"a malateedda. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />He wodallay, bare aawuwaa gollen de'iyaa ubbaappe aad'd'i bonchchetteeddawe, Yaak'ooba naattin nashetteedda diraw, unttunttu geeddawaa ootsanaw gam"ibeena. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />He wode Hamoorinne Aa na'ay Shekeeme barenttu katamaa gutaraa biide, barenttu katamaa asaw hawaadan yaagiide odeeddino; <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />«Ha asatuu nuunana siga; unttunttu nu biittan de'iinonne zal"iino; biittay loytsi aaka. Unttunttu mac'c'a naanaakka nuuni akkana; unttunttukka nu mac'c'a naanaa akkana. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Shin nuunana unttunttu itti asaadan de'anaw nuuni ittibaa mayettanaw koshshee; hewenne, unttunttu k'as's'aretteeddawaadan nu attuma Asay ubbay k'as's'arettanawaa. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Nuuni hewaadan ootsooppe, unttunttu miizzay, unttunttu mas'uunne unttunttu hara mehii ubbay nuwaa gidennee? Hewaa diraw ane nuuni unttunttu giyaawaa eeno goytte; unttunttukka nu giddon de'ana» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Katamaa gutaraa shiik'eedda asatuu ubbay Hamoorawunne Aa na'aa Shekeemaw, «Eeno» geeddino. Yaatina he katamaa attuma asatuu ubbay k'as's'aretteeddino.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Heezzentso gallassi, unttunttu ubbay barenttu k'as's'araa madutsan saketi de'ishshin, Yaak'ooba attuma naanatuwaappe laa"uu, Simooninne Leewii, Diini ishatuu, barenttu mashshaa akkiidde, ooninne erennan katamaa geliide, attuma asatuwaa ubbaa wod'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Hamooranne Aa na'aa Shekeema mashshaan wod'iide, barenttu michchato Diino Shekeema golliyaappe akkiidde afeedino. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Yaak'ooba attuma naanay he anhatuwaa bolla geliide, barenttu michchato Diino tunisseedda katamaa bonk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Unttunttu dorssaa wudiyaa, miizzaa wudiyaa, hariyaa, katamaa giddon de'iyaawaanne gas'an de'iyaawaa ubbaa akkeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Unttunttu mas'uwaa ubbaa, unttunttu naanaa ubbaanne machatuwaa ubbaa omoodeeddino; gollen de'eeddawaa ubbaa bonk'k'eeddino.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Yaak'oobi Simoonanne Leewiyaa, «Hinttenttu ta bolla metuwaa ahi kichcheedditta; ha gadiyaan de'iyaa Kanaanatuunne Parzzetuu taana is's'anawantta; nuuni payduwaan guutsa; unttunttu ittippe gidiide ta bolla denddooppe, taaninne ta soo Asay d'ayana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Shin unttunttu, «Yaatina I nu michchato sharmus'aadan ootsana bessii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Beeteele Simmeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />S'oossay hewaappe guyye Yaak'ooba, «Denddaade pude Beeteele baade yan de'a. Neeni ne ishaa Eesaappe bak'atiyaa wode new k'onc'c'eedda S'oossaw yan yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'a» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:11-17">Dom. 28:11-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Yaak'oobi bare soo asaanne barenana de'iyaawantta ubbaa, «hinttenttu gidduwaan de'iyaa allaga S'oossatuwaa misiletuwaa diggite; hinttenttu bollaa geeshshite; hinttenttu mayuwaanne laammite. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Ane denddiide, pude Beeteele boytte; ta metuwaa gallassi taana siseedda, taani beedda sa'aan ubbaan taananna gideedda S'oossaw, taani yan yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'ana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Hewaa diraw unttunttu barenttoo de'iyaa allaga s'oossatuwaa misiletuwaa ubbaanne barenttu haytsaan de'iyaa gudichchaa ubbaa Yaak'oobaw immeeddino; Yaak'oobi hewantta Sekeeman de'iyaa wolaa garssan moogeedda.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Hewaappe guyye, Yaak'oobinne Aa attuma naanay denddiide biishshin, itti uraynne unttuntta oyk'k'anaw kaallibeenna; ayaw gooppe, unttunttu biishshin, unttunttu yuushshuwaan de'iyaa katamaa asaa ubbaa bolla S'oossaa dagamay wod'd'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yaak'oobinne aanana de'iyaa Asay ubbay Kanaane gadiyaan de'iyaa (Beeteele giyaa) Looza gakkeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Yan I yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'eedda; I he sa'aa El-Beeteele giide suntseedda; ayaw gooppe, I bare ishaappe bak'atiide biyaa wode, S'oossay aw k'onc'c'eedda sa'ay hewaa.<verse eid="GEN 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Ribik'o dichchiyaa Deboora yan hayk'k'aaddu; Beeteeleppe hirkkinna de'iyaa wolaa garssan iza moogettaaddu; hewaa diraw he mitsaa suntsay Yeekuwaa Wolaa geetetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Yaak'oobi Masp'p'es'oomiyaappe simmeeddawaappe guyye, S'oossay aw zaaretsi k'onc'c'iide, Aa anjjeedda; <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />S'oossay Aa, «Ne suntsay Yaak'ooba; shin hawaappe sintsanaw neeni ubbakka Yaak'ooba geetettakka; ne suntsay israa'eeliyaa gidana» yaagiide I Aa israa'eeliyaa suntseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Dom. 32:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />K'ay S'oossay Yaak'ooba, «Taani Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa; neeni yeletta; c'oratta; kawutetsatuunne kawutetsaa Asay neeppe kessana; kaatetuukka ne gulbbataappe kessana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Dom. 17:4-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Taani Abrahaamewunne Yisaak'aw immeedda biittaa, k'ay new immay; neeppe guyyenna taani ha biittaa ne zeretsaw immana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Hewaappe guyye, S'oossay aanana haasayeedda sa'aappe pude kesseedda.<verse eid="GEN 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Yaak'oobi S'oossay barenana haasayeedda sa'aan shuchchaa essiide, Aa bolla ushshaa yarshshuwaa tigeedda; zayitiyaakka bolla tigeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-19">Dom. 28:18-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yaak'oobi S'oossay barenana haasayeedda sa'aa «Beeteele» giide suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Raaheelinne Yisaak'a Hayk'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Unttunttu hewaappe guyye, Beeteeleppe denddeeddino. Unttunttu Efiraataa gakkanaw laafaa ashshiyaa wode, Raaheelo yeluu oyk'k'eedda; yeluwaan iza loytsa waayettaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Yeluu izo waayisseedda wode izo yelissiyaana, «Yayyoppa; hawekka attuma na'aa» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Shin iza hayk'k'aadde, shemppu kesishshin, bare na'aa Been"oona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Been"oona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Ta metuwaa na'aa» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntsaaddu; shin Aa aawuu Aa Biiniyaama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Biiniyaama: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Ta ushechcha Kushiyaa na'aa» giyaawaa.</char></note> suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Hewaappe guyye, Raaheela hayk'k'a bashaaddu; Beeteleeme giyaa Efiraataa afiyaa ogiyaa doonaan moogettaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yaak'oobi izi duufuwaan hawulttiyaa shuchchaa esseedda; he hawulttii hachche gakkanaw Raaheeli duufuwaa erissee.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Israa'eelii hewaappe denddiide, Edera gimbbiyaappe hefintsaan bare dunkkaaniyaa tokkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Israa'eelii he gadiyaan de'ishshin, Roobeeli biide, bare aawoo yeleedda k'oomatti Baalina giseedda. Israa'eelii ha yewuwaa siseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:4">Dom. 49:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yaak'ooba attuma naanay tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Liya naanay Yaak'ooba bayira na'aa Roobeela, Simoona, Leewa, Yihudaa, Yisaakooranne Zaabiloona. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Raaheeli attuma naanay Yooseefanne Biiniyaama. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Raaheeli danggaas'iratti Baali attuma naanay Daananne Nifttaaleema. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Liya danggaas'iratti Zilppi attuma naanay Gaadanne Aaseera. Hawanttu Masp'p'es'oomiyaan Yaak'oobaw yeletteedda Aa attuma naanaa.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yaak'oobi (Kebroona giyaa) K'iriyaati-Arbba'a matan Maamiren de'iyaa, bare aawuwaa Yisaak'a soo yeedda; he sa'ay kase Abrahaamenne Yisaak'i de'eedda sa'aa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:18">Dom. 13:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Yisaak'i s'eetanne hosppun tammu laytsaa de'eedda; <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />I daro wodiyaa de'iide, lo"o c'imi hayk'k'iidde bare mayzzan gaketeedda. Aa naanay Eesaynne Yaak'oobi Aa moogeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Eesaa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:1-43">36:1-43</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Od. 1:34-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Eedooma giyaa Eesaa yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Eesay Kanaane biittaa mac'c'a naanatuwaappe barew machchetuwaa akkeedda; unttunttune Hiitiyaa Eloona naatto Aado, Hiiwiyaa S'ibaa'oona na'ay Aani yeleedda Oholiibaamonne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">Dom. 26:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />Isimaa'eela naatto, Nabaayoota michchato Baasemaato.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:9">Dom. 28:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Aada Eesaw Elifaaza yelaaddu; Baasemaatakka Ra'u'eela yelaaddu; <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholiibaama Ya'uusha, Yaa'ilaamanne K'oraaha yelaaddu; Kanaane gadiyaan Eesaw yeletteedda attuma naanay hawantta.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Eesay bare machchetuwaa, bare attuma naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa, bare soo asaa ubbaa, bare miizzatuwaanne bare mehiyaa ubbaa Kanaane gadiyaan I mooddeeddawaa ubbaa akkiidde, bare ishaa Yaak'oobappe haakkiyaa gadiyaa beedda. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Unttunttu mas'uu dareedda diraw, unttunttu ittippe de'anaw danddayibeykkino; unttunttu mehii dareedda diraw, unttunttu de'iyaa biittay unttunttu mehiyaw gidanaw danddayibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Yaatina Eedooma giyaa Eesay Se'iira giyaa gezziyaan utteedda.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Se'iira gezziyaan de'eedda Eedoomatuwaa aawuwaa Eesaa yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Hawe Eesaa attuma naanaa suntsaa; hewanttunne Eesaa machchatti Aadi na'aa Elifaazanne Eesaa machchatti Baasemaati na'aa Ra'u'eela.<verse eid="GEN 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Elifaaza naanay Temaana, Omaara, S'afa, Ga'itaamanne K'anaaza. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />K'ay Timinaa'a Eesaa na'aa Elifaazaw k'oomatuwaa; iza Elifaazaw Amaaleek'a yelaaddu. Hawanttu Eesaa machchatti Aadi na'aa naanaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Ra'u'eela attuma naanay Nahaata, Zaraaha, Shammanne Miizaa; hawanttu Eesaa machchatti Baasemaati na'aa naanaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />S'ibaa'oona na'ay Aani yeleedda Oholiibaama attuma naanay hawantta; iza Eesaw Ya'uusha, Yaa'ilaamanne K'oraaha yelaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Eesaa yeletaa kaappatuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta. Eesaw bayira na'aa Elifaaza attuma naanay, kaappuwaa gideeddawanttu Temaana, Omaara, S'afa, K'anaaza, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />K'oraaha, Ga'itaamanne Amaaleek'a; Eedooma biittan Elifaazi yeleedda kaappatuu hawantta; hawanttu ubbay Aadi na'aa naanaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Eesaa na'aa Ra'u'eela attuma naanay, kaappuwaa gideeddawanttu Nahaata, Zaraaha, Shammanne Miizaa; Eedooma biittan Ra'u'eeli yeleedda kaappatuu hawantta; unttunttu Eesaa machchatti Baasemaati na'aa naanaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Eesaa machchatti Oholiibaami attuma naanay, kaappuwaa gideeddawanttu Ya'uusha, Yaa'ilaamanne K'oraaha; unttunttu Aana naatti, Eesaa machchatti Oholiibaamippe yeletteedda kaappatuwaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Eedooma giyaa Eesaa attuma naanay hawantta; unttunttu kaappatuukka hawantta.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Se'iira Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Od. 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Eedooma gadiyaan de'iyaa Hooriyaa Se'iira attuma naanay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta; hewanttukka Los'aana, Shobaala, S'ibaa'oona, Aana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoona, Es'eeranne Dishaana; hewanttu, Eedooma gadiyaan de'iyaa Se'iira attuma naanay, Hooretuwaa kaappatuwaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Los'aana attuma naanay Hooranne Heemaama; Los'aana michchata Timinaa'o.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Shobaala attuma naanay Aaliwaana, Maanahaata, Eebaala, Shefanne Oonaama.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />S'ibaa'oona attuma naanay Aayanne Aana; hawe Aani woran bare aawuwaa S'ibaa'oona haretuwaa heemiidde haatsaa bol"uwaa demmeeddawaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Aana na'ay Dishoona; naatta k'ay Oholiibaamo.<verse eid="GEN 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Dishoona attuma naanay Hemddaana, Eshibaana, Yitiraananne Karaana.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Es'eera attuma naanay Bilihaana, Za'iwaananne Ak'ana.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Dishaana attuma naanay Uus'anne Araana.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Hooretuwaa kaappatuu hawantta; Los'aana, Shobaala, S'ibaa'oona, Aana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishoona, Es'eeranne Dishaana. Hawanttu Se'iira biittan barenttu yaran yaran shaaketteedda Hooretuwaa kaappatuwaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eedooma Kaatetuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Od. 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Israa'eelan kaatii kawutanaappe kase Eedooma biittan kaateteedda kaatetu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Ba'oora na'ay Belaa'i Eedooman kaateteedda; Aa katamaa suntsay Dinaaba geetettee.<verse eid="GEN 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Belaa'i hayk'k'ina, Boos'irappe yeedda Zaraaha na'ay Yobaabi kaateteedda.<verse eid="GEN 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobaabi hayk'k'ina, Temaana biittaappe yeedda Hushaami kaateteedda.<verse eid="GEN 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushaami hayk'k'ina, Badaada na'ay Hadaadi, Midiyaama asaa moo'aabe gadiyaan s'ooneeddawe kaateteedda; Aa katamaa suntsay Awiita geetetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 36:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadaadi hayk'k'ina, Maasireek'appe yeedda Saamili kaateteedda.<verse eid="GEN 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Saamili hayk'k'ina, shaafaa matan de'iyaa Rahobootappe yeedda Shaa'uuli kaateteedda.<verse eid="GEN 36:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shaa'uuli hayk'k'ina, Akiboora na'ay Ba'aalihanaani kaateteedda.<verse eid="GEN 36:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Akiboora na'aa Ba'aalihanaani hayk'k'ina, Hadaari kaateteedda; Aa katamaa suntsay Paa'u geetettee; Aa machata Mezaahaaba naatta Maas'ireeda yeleedda Mahes'aabi'eelo geetettaw.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Eesaa yeletaa kaappatuu barenttu yaran yaran, barenttu sa'aan ellekka barenttu suntsan suntsan hawantta; Timinaa'a, Aliwa, Yeteeta, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholiibaama, Eela, Piinoona, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />K'anaaza, Temaana, Mibs's'aara, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Maagidi'eelanne Iraama. Hawanttu barenttu mooddiyaa biittan, barenttu de'iyaa sa'aan de'iyaa sa'aan Eedooma kaappatuwaa. Hawe Eesay, Eedoomatuwaa aawuwaa.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Yooseefanne Aa Ishatuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 37:1-45:28">37:1—45:28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yaak'oobi bare aawuu de'eedda Kanaane biittan utteedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Yaak'ooba naanay haneeddabay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yooseefo tammanne laappun laytsaa na'aa gideedda wode, bare aawoo hara machchetuwaappe, Baalippenne Zilppippe yeletteedda bare ishatuwaanna wudiyaa heeme. He wode I bare aawoo unttunttu ootseedda iitabaa odeedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Israa'eelii Yooseefa c'imiide yeleedda diraw, bare hara attuma naanaa ubbaappe aatsiide siik'ee. I aw alleek'k'eedda mayuwaa giigisseedda. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Aa ishatuu barenttu aawuu Aa unttunttuppe aatsiide siik'iyaawaa be'eedda wode, unttunttu Aa is's'iide, lo"o k'aalaa aw haasayanaw danddayibeykkino.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Yooseefo akumuwaa akumetiide, bare ishatoo odeedda; unttunttu Aa yaa darissiide is's'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />I unttuntta, «Taani akumeteedda akumuwaa sisite. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Nuuni gaden pochchiyaa k'achchishin, ta mirk'k'ii itti kutsaan denddiide sitti gi ek'k'ishshina, hinttenttu mirk'k'etuu yuuyyi aad'd'iide ta mirk'k'iyaw goynneeddinno» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Aa ishatuu Aa, «Neeni nu bollan kaatetana hanayiyee? Woy nuuna tumu mooddana hanayiyee?» yaageeddino. Unttunttu Aa akumuwaa dirawunne Aa oduwaa diraw, yaa darissiide is's'eeddino.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />K'ay Yooseefo hara akumuwaa akumetiide, bare ishatoo odeedda; «sisite; taani hara akumuwaakka akumetaad. He akumuwaan away, aginaynne tammanne itti s'oolinttetuu taw goynniino» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Bare aawoonne bare ishatoo he akumuwaa odeedda wode, Aa aawuu Aa, «Hawe neeni akumeteedawe ayaa akumee? Tumu taani, ne daayanne ne ishatuu yiide, ne sintsaan sa'aan guufaniide new goynnaneyye?» yaagiide seereedda. <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Aa ishatuu Aa k'anaateeddino; shin Aa aawuu ha yewuwaa bare wozanaan wotseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kit. 7:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishatuu Yooseefa zal"eeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Itti gallassi Aa ishatuu Sekeema matan barenttu aawuwaa dorssaa heemanaw beeddino. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Israa'eelii Yooseefa, «Ne ishatuu Sekeeman wudiyaa heemiyaawaa eraasa. Haaya; taani neena unttunttukko kiittana» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yooseefo, «Eeno» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />I Aa, «Ba; ne ishatuwaanne wudii sara gidiyaawaa be'a; unttunttubaa taw odaasa» yaageedda. Aa Kebroona dilbbaappe kiitteedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">I Sekeema beedda. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Yan dembbaa giddon yaa haa simerettishin, itti Asay Aa demmiide, «Laa ayaa koyay?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />I, «Ta ishatuwaa koyay; unttunttu wudiyaa heemiyaa sa'ay hak'anentto hayana taw odaarikkii!» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Bitanii, «Hawaappe denddi kichcheeddino; unttunttu, ‹Nuuni Dootaana beto› giishin sisaad» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw, Yooseefo bare ishatuwaa geeduwaa biide, unttuntta Dootaanan demmeedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Shin I haakuwaan de'ishshin, unttunttu Aa be'eeddino; I unttunttukko gakkennan de'ishshin, unttunttu Aa wod'anaw Aa bolla mak'etteeddinno. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Ittuu ittuwaa, «Be'ite! Akumuwaawu yee. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Haayite; Aa wod'iide, ha ollatuwaappe ittuwaa giddo yeggoytte. Hewaappe guyye, ‹Iita do'ay Aa meedda› yaagana; yaatiide Aa akumuu ahiyaawaa be'ana» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Roobeeli hewaa siseedda wode, unttunttu kushiyaappe Aa ashshanaw koyiide, «Aa wod'enaan aggoytte. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Suutsaa gussoppite; Aa hinttenttu woran de'iyaa ha ollaa giddo olite; Aa bolla kushiyaa wotsoppite» yaageedda. Roobeeli hawaa Aa unttunttuppe ashshiide guyye Aa aawuwaakko yeddanaw geedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yooseefo bare ishatuwaakko gakkeedda wode, I mayyeedda alleek'k'eedda mayuwaa aappe k'aari akkeeddino; <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Aa afiide haatsay baynna mela ollaan yegeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Unttunttu barenttu k'umaa maanaw utti de'ishshin, Isimaa'eela asatuu Gibs'e baanaw Gala'aadeppe yiyaawantta d'ok'k'u giide be'eeddino; unttunttu barenttu gaaluwaan sawuwaa, balasaane giyaa d'aliyaanne karbbiyaa c'aani wotseeddino.<verse eid="GEN 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yihuday bare ishatuwaa, «Nuuni nu ishaa wod'iide Aa suutsaa k'osiyaawaa gidooppe nuuna ayaa go"ii? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Haayite; Aa Isimaa'eelatoo zal"oytte; Aa bolla nu kushiyaa wotsokko; ayaw gooppe, I nu ishaa, nu ashuwaa» yaageedda. Aa ishatuu mayetteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Hewaa diraw Midiyaama biittaa zal"anchchatuu hewaanna aad'd'ishshin, Aa ishatuu Yooseefa ollaappe kessiide, Isimaa'eela asatoo laatamu s'agaraa biraan zal"eeddino. Unttunttu Yooseefa Gibs'e gadiyaa afeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kit. 7:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Roobeeli ollaakko simmiide, Yooseefo yan baynnawaa be'eedda wode, kayyotiide bare mayuwaa pooshsheedda. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />I guyye bare ishatuwaakko biide, «Na'ay yan baawa; ha"i taani hak'a booshsha!» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Hewaappe guyye unttunttu Yooseefo mayuwaa akkiidde, deeshsha orggiyaa shukkiide, he suutsan naak'k'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Alleek'k'eedda Aa mayuwaa barenttu aawuwaakko afiide Aa, «Nuuni hawaa demmeeddo; hawe ne na'aa mayenttonne ane s'eella» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Mayuwaa I eriide, «Hawe ta na'aa mayuwaa! wora do'ay Aa mi diggeedda. Yooseefo tumukka dus's'ereti kichcheedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Yaak'oobi kayyottiidde, bare mayuwaa peed'eedda; bare s'eessan waaruwaa danc'c'iidde, bare na'aw daro gallassaa yeekkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Aa attuma naanaynne mac'c'a naanay ubbay Aa mintsetsanaw yeeddino; shin I minnenaan is's'iide, «tuytti, taani yeekkaadde ta na'aakko baade, duufuwaan gelana» yaagiide, Aa aawuu aw yeekkeedda.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />He wode Miidiyaama biittaa asatuu Yooseefa Gibs'e kaatiyaa oosanchchaa P'oos'ifaaraw Gibs'en zal"eeddino; I naagiyaawanttu kaappuwaa.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />He wode Yihuday bare ishatuwaappe shaakettiide, Adulaama giyaa kataman de'iyaa Hiira giyaa bitaniyaanna de'anaw beedda. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Yan Yihuday Shuu'a giyaa Kanaane naattinna gaketeedda; I izo akkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Iza aw shahaaraade attuma na'aa yelaaddu; Aa Eera suntsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />K'aykka shahaaro wode attuma na'aa yelaaddu; Aa Oonaana suntsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />K'ay gujjaadekka attuma na'aa yelaaddu; Aa Sheela suntsaaddu. Iza yeleeddawe Akiziiba giyaa biittaana.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yihuday bare bayira na'aa Eeraw Ti'imaaro giyaa machchato immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Yihudaa bayira na'ay, Eeri, Med'inaa Godaa sintsaan iita asaa gidiyaa diraw, Med'ina Goday Aa wod'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yihuday Oonaana, «Ne ishaa machchatikko gelaade, izo akka; ne ishaw na'aa yelaade Aa s'eesissa» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Shin Oonaani yelettiyaa naanay barewantta gidenawaa ereedda; hewaa diraw bare ishaa machchattinna gisiyaa wode awudenne, bare ishaw na'i yelettenna mala, bare zeretsaa biittan gussee. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />I ootseeddabay Med'inaa Godaa sintsaan iitabaa gideedda diraw, Med'inaa Goday aakka wod'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Hewaappe guyye, Yihuday bare na'aa machchato Ti'imaaro, «Ta na'ay Sheeli dic'c'ana gakkanaw ne aawuwaa soo baade, am"etetsaan de'ashsha» yaageedda. Hewaa I ayaw geedde gooppe, ikka bare ishatuwaadan hayk'k'anenttonne giide hirggeedda diraassa. Hewaa diraw Ti'imaara baade bare aawuwaa soon de'aaddu.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Daro wodiyaappe guyye Yihudaa machata, Shuu'a naatta hayk'k'aaddu. Yihuday bare kayyuwaappe minetteedda wode, bare dorssaa isikiyaa meediyaa asatuwaakko Timina kesseedda; k'ay Aa lagge, Adulaamiyaa Hiiri aanana beedda.<verse eid="GEN 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Aasi Ti'imaaro, «Be'a; ne bolluu Yihuday, bare dorssatuwaa isikiyaa meedanaw Timina kesseedda» yaagiide odeedda. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Iza bare am"etetsaa mayuwaa k'aaraaddu; barena baletsanaw shaashiyaa akkaade gullottaaddu. Timina afiyaa ogiyaa doonaan de'iyaa Enayma katamaa penggiyaan uttaaddu. Hewaa iza ootseeddawe, Sheeli dic'c'i gakkinkka iza aw machchatto gidanaw imettabeennawaa ereedda diraassa.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Yihuday izo be'eedda wode, sharmus'atto giide k'oppeedda; ayaw gooppe, iza bare deemuwaa gullotta uttaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Bare na'aa machchato gidiyaawaa erennan de'iide, ogiyaa gas'aa iikko shiik'iide izo, «Taananna gisaarikii!» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Iza, «Taani neenana gisooppe, neeni taw ayaa immanii?» yaagaadde oochchaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />I, «Taani ta wudiyaappe itti deeshsha maraa new yeddana» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Iza, «Neeni hewaa taw yeddana gakkanaw ayaa ootsanii?» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />I, «Ayaa ootsoo?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Iza, «Ne maatafaa wotsiyaa migiduwaa, Aa aatsiyaa sak'k'iyaanne ne kushiyaan de'iyaa gatimaa oytsa» yaagaaddu. I hewantta immiide, izina gisina, iza aw shahaaraaddu. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Iza hewaappe denddaade beeddawaappe guyye, bare gullotsaa shaashiyaa k'aaraade, bare am"etetsaa mayuwaa mayyaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yihuday bare oytseeddawaa he mishiratippe zaari akkanaw deeshsha maraa bare laggiyaa Adulaama bolla iziw kiitteedda; shin I izo demmibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />I he biittaa asaa, «Enayma kataman, ogiyaa doonaan utteedda sharmus'a mishirata hak'anee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Aasi, «Sharmus'a mac'c'aanna hawaan ubbakka baawa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />I Yihudaakko simmiide Aa, «Taani izo demmabeykke; hewaa bollakka he biittaa asay, ‹Sharmus'a mac'c'aanna hawaan ubbakka baawaa› yaageedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yihuday, «Bare oyk'k'eeddawaa barew akku; hewe d'ayooppe, Asay nuuna miic'c'ana. Simmi taani iziw deeshsha maraa yeddaad; shin neeni izo demmabeykka» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Heezzu aginaa keeshshaappe guyye asay, «Ne na'aa machata Ti'imaara sharmus'aade shahaaraaddu» yaagiide Yihudaw odeedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yihuday, «Izo kare kessiide taman s'uuggite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Izo kare kessiyaa wode, «Taani shahaareeddawe ha miishshaa godaassa; be'a; ha maatafaa wotsiyaa migiduu, Aa aatsiyaa sak'k'iinne gatimay oowentto erana danddayooppe era» yaagaadde bare bolloo kiitaa kiittaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yihuday he miishshatuwaa eriide, «Taappe iza s'illa; ayaw gooppe, taani izo ta na'aa Sheelaw immabeykke» yaageedda. Hewaappe guyye, I izina zaari gisibeenna.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Iza yelana haniyaa wode, izi uluwaan mantte attuma naanay de'iino. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Iza yelishiin, unttunttuppe ittuu bare kushiyaa keseedda; maarissiyaanna, «Be'ite; hawe koyro kesseedda» gaanaw zo'o k'unc'c'uutiyaa akkaade Aa kushiyaan k'achchaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Shin I bare kushiyaa guyye akkeedda wode, Aa ishay kesseedda; iza, «Neeni waana portsu gaade kesaadii!» yaagaaddu. Hewaa diraw, Paareesa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paareesa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Portsu geedda» giyaawaa.</char></note> gaade Aa suntsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Hewaappe guyye, Aa kushiyaan zo'o k'unc'c'uutii de'iyaa Aa ishay keseedda; Aa suntsay Zaaraaha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zaaraaha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Zo'uwaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> geetetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yooseefanne P'oos'ifaara Machchatto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Isimaa'eela asatuu Yooseefa Gibs'e afi wotseeddino. Gibs'aawe P'oos'ifaari, kaatiyaa oosanchchatuwaappe ittuu, naagiyaawanttu kaappuu Yooseefa Isimaa'eeletuwaappe shammeedda.<verse eid="GEN 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Med'inaa Goday Yooseefonna de'ee; hewaa diraw, I ootsiyaawaa ubbaa aw injjeyeedda; yaatina bare godaa, Gibs'aawiyaa soon de'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kit. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Med'inaa Goday aanana de'iyaawaanne Med'inaa Goday I ootseeddawaa ubbaa aw suurisiyaawaa P'oos'ifaari be'eedda wode, <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Yooseefo Aa sintsaan nashetteedda; I aw kiitetteedda. P'oos'ifaari Aa bare golle asaa bolla suntseedda; barew de'iyaawaa ubbaa Aa kushiyaan wotseedda. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />P'oos'ifaari bare gollen de'iyaawaa ubbaa bollanne bare mas'uwaa ubbaa bolla suntseedda wodiyaappe doommiide, Med'inaa Goday Gibs'e bitaniyaa golliyaa Yooseefo diraw anjjeedda. Med'inaa Godaa anjjuu P'oos'ifaara sooninne gaden de'eedda ubbabaa bolla wod'd'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Hewaa diraw barew de'iyaa ubbabaa Yooseefow sheed'd'eedda; I bare miyaa k'umaappe attina, ayinne k'oppenna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yooseefo geesanchanne malaa lo"o asaa. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Amareeda wodiyaappe guyye, Aa godaa machata Yooseefa s'eella be'aade, «Haaya; taananna gisa» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Shin I is's'eedda. Bare godaa machchatto, «Be'a; ta goday taw sheed'd'iide bare son de'iyaabaw ayawunne hirggenna; barew de'iyaawaa ubbaa ta kushiyaan wotseedda. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Ha son taappe gitatiyaawe ooninne baawa. Neeni Aa machchatto gidiyaa diraw ne s'alalaappe attina, ta goday taw immibeennabay baawa. Yaatina taani waataade hawaa mala daro iitabaa hanaade S'oossaa bolla nagaraa ootsoo?» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Iza ha yewuwaa hachche hachche Yooseefow odooppenne, I izina gisennan woy izi matan uttennan is's'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Itti gallassi I bare oosuwaa ootsanaw soo geliyaa wode, soo k'oomatuwaappe ooninne son baawa. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Iza Yooseefo afilaa oyk'k'aadde, «Taananna gisa» yaagaaddu. Shin I bare afilaa I kushiyaan yeggiide, sooppe kare wos's'iide kesseedda.<verse eid="GEN 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Yooseefo bare afilaa I kushiyaan yeggiide, sooppe kare wos's'i kesowaa iza be'eedda wode, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />bare soo k'oomatuwaa s'eesaade unttuntta, «Be'ite; ta asinay aheedda ha Ibraawe bitanii taana baletsi diggiide ashsheeda; I taananna gisanaw hawaa geleedda; shin taani ta kooshshaa d'ok'k'issaade waassaad. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Taani waassina siseedda wode, I bare afilaa ta matan yeggiide, sooppe kare wos's'iide kesseedda» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Aa goday soo yaana gakkanaw iza Yooseefo afilaa bare matan wotsaaddu. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Hewaappe guyye, iza aw hawaadan yaagaadde odaaddu; «Hewe neeni nuw aheedda Ibraawe ayilii taananna gisanaw taakko geleedda; <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />shin taani ta k'aalaa d'ok'k'issaade waassowe, bare afilaa ta matan yeggiide, sooppe kare wos's'eedda» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Aa goday bare machata, «Ne ayilii taana hawaadan ootseedda» yaagaadde odeedda k'aalaa sisiide, hank'k'uwaan pentteedda. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Yooseefa A goday afiide, kaatiyaa k'ashuwaa sa'ay de'iyaa k'asho gollen yeggeedda.<verse eid="GEN 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Shin Yooseefo yan k'asho gollen de'iyaa wode, Med'inaa Goday aanana de'ee. I aw k'aretteedda; k'asho golle kaappuwaa sintsan aw nashshuwaa immeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kit. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Yaatina k'asho golle kaappuu k'ashuwaa asaa ubbaa Yooseefo kushiyaan wotseedda; hewaan oosettiyaawaa ubbaa ootsiyaawe Aa. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />K'asho golle kaappuu Yooseefo kushiyaan de'iyaabaw ayawunne hirggenna; ayaw gooppe, Med'inaa Goday aanana de'ee; I ootsiyaawaakka ubbaa aw injjeyeedda.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yooseefo K'ashuwaa Asatuwaa akumuwaa Billeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Amareeda wodiyaappe guyye, Gibs'e kaatew eessaa tigiyaawenne ukitsaa uukkiyaawe barenttu godaa Gibs'e kaatiyaa naak'k'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Kaatii eessaa tigiyaawanttu kaappuwaanne ukitsaa uukkiyaawanttu kaappuwaa laa"uwaakka loytsi hank'k'etteedda. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Yooseefo k'ashetteedda k'asho gollen, naagiyaawanttu kaappuwaa son unttuntta wotseedda. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Naagiyaawanttu kaappuu unttuntta Yooseefow sheed'd'eedda; I unttunttoo ootsee. Unttunttu k'asho gollen amareeda wodiyaa utteeddino.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Gibs'e kaatiyaw eessaa tigiyaawenne ukitsaa uukkiyaawe, k'asho gollen de'iyaa laa"attuukka, itti k'amma dumma dumma akumuwaa akumeteeddino. K'ay akumotoo huup'iyaan huup'iyaan unttunttu biletsay de'ee. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Yooseefo wontta unttunttukko geleedda wode, kayyoti utteeddawantta be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Hewaa diraw bare godaa soon barenana k'asho gollen de'iyaa kaatiyaa oosanchchatuwaa, «Hachche hinttenttu demuu ayaw d'umeedee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Unttunttu Aa, «Nuuni laa"u akumuwaa akumetteeddo; shin nuw biliyaawe d'ayeedda» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yooseefo unttuntta, «Akumuwaa biletsay S'oossawaa gidenneeyyee? Hinttenttu akumuwaa taw odite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Eessaa tigiyaawanttu kaappuu bare akumuwaa Yooseefow hawaadan yaagiide odeedda; «Taani ta akumuwaan itti woyniyaa turaa ta sintsaan be'aaddi. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />K'ay he woyniyaa turaw heezzu tashii de'ee. I maraa yeliide, c'iishshaa c'iishiide, wurc'c'uwaa wurc'c'eedda; wurc'c'unne teereedda. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Kaatiyaa wanc'c'ay ta kushiyaan de'ee; taani woyniyaa teeraa akkaade, kaatiyaa wanc'c'an gum"aade, he wanc'c'aa Aa kushiyaan wotsaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yooseefo, «Hewaa birshshetsay hawaa; heezzu tashetuu heezzu gallassatuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Heezzu gallassaa gidduwaan kaatii neena dentsana; I neena kase ne suntsatetsaw zaarana; kase neeni eessaa tigiyaa wode ootseeddawaadan, neeni kaatiyaa wanc'c'aa Aa kushiyaan wotsana. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Shin new sa'ay lo"eedda wode taana dogoppa; taw lo"a; tabaa kaatiyaw odaadde, ha k'asho golliyaappe taana kesissa; <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />ayaw gooppe, taana Ibraawetuwaa biittaappe gidiide aheeddino; haray atto hawankka taana k'ashissiyaawaa ayinne ootsabeykke» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Ukitsaa uukkiyaawanttu kaappuu Yooseefo akumuwaa loytsi billeeddawaa be'eedda wode Yooseefo, «Taanikka akumuwaa akumetaad; ta huup'iyaan heezzu samppa ukitsay de'ee; <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />bolla bagga samppan Gibs'e kaatiyaw uuketteedda ubbaa k'ommo ukitsay de'ee. Shin kafuu hewaa ta huup'iyaan de'iyaa samppaappe mee» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yooseefo, «Hewaa birshshetsay hawaa; heezzu samppatuu heezzu gallassatuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Heezzu gallassaa giddon kaatii neena dentsana; ne k'ood'iyaa muuc'issiide mitsaan kak'issana; ne ashuwaakka kafuu maana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Heezzentso gallassan Gibs'e kaatii bare yeletteedda gallassi bare oosanchchatuwaa ubbaw baalaa giigisseedda. Eessaa tigiyaawanttu kaappuwaanne ukitsaa uukkiyaawanttu kaappuwaa dentsiide, bare oosanchchatuwaa giddon esseedda. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Eessaa tigiyaawanttu kaappuwaa Aa suntsatetsaw zaarina, I kaatiyaa kushiyaan wanc'c'aa wotseedda. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Shin kaatii ukitsaa uukkiyaawanttu Kaappuwaa unttunttu akumuwaa biletsaa Yooseefo odeeddawaadankka kak'isseedda. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Shin eessaa tigiyaawanttu kaappuu Yooseefo hassayibeenna; dogiisheedda.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yooseefo Gibs'e Kaatiyaa akumuwaa Billeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Laa"u laytsaa kumentsay aad'd'eedda wode, Gibs'e kaatii akumuwaa akumeteedda; akumuwaan I Nayle Shaafaa doonaan ek'k'eedda; <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Laappun orddenne mod'd'o miizzatuu Nayle Shaafaappe kes wod'd'iide, mak'k'aa gidduwaan miyaawantta be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Unttunttuppe simmiide, hara laappun malaa iitanne gilk'k'a miizzatuu Nayle Shaafaappe keseeddino; shaafaa doonaan de'iyaa hara miizzatuu matan ek'k'eeddinno. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />He malaa iitanne gilk'k'a miizzatuu laappun orddanne mod'd'o miizzatuwaa meeddino. Hewaappe guyye kaatii beegotteedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />I zaaretsi gem"ishiide, laa"entso akumuwaakka akumeteedda; laappun lo"anne muruta tishatuu itti anuwaan dic'c'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Unttunttuppe simmiide, c'eec'c'edanne away doliyaa bagga c'arkkuwaan shulleedda hara laappun tishatuu keseeddino. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />He c'eec'c'eedda tishatuu lo"anne muruta tishatuwaa mitteeddino. Hewaappe guyye kaatii beegottiide, akumuwaa gidiyaawaa ereedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Sa'ay wonttina, Aa wozanay shabbiretteedda; hewaa diraw Gibs'en de'iyaa bitiyaawanttu ubbawunne aad'd'eeda eranchchatuwaa ubbaw kiittiide s'eesisseedda; kaatii unttunttoo bare akumuwaa odeedda; shin aw he akumuwaa birshshiyaawe d'ayeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan. 2:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Eessaa tigiyaawanttu kaappuu he wode Gibs'e kaatiyaa hawaadan yaageedda; «Taani ta bayzzuwaa hachche hassayay. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Itti gede kaatii bare k'oomatoo hank'k'ettiide, taananne ukitsaa uukkiyaawanttu kaappuwaa k'asho gollen yeggeedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Yan de'iidde nuuni huup'iyaan huup'iyaan akumuwaa akumetteeddo; akumoo dumma dumma birshshetsay de'ee. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />He wode naagiyaawanttu kaappuu, k'oomay, Ibraawe wodallay nuunana k'asho gollen de'ee. Nuuni nu akumuwaa aw odeeddo; I nuw huup'iyaan huup'iyaan akumuwaa birshsheedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Yaanina he yewotuu I nuw billeeddawaadankka haneeddino. Hewe ayee gooppe, taani ta suntsatetsaw simmaad; hinkko bitanii kak'etteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Gibs'e kaatii Yooseefow kiittiide s'eesisseedda. Unttunttu Aa k'asho golliyaappe ellekka aheeddino. I meedettiide bare mayuwaa laammiide, kaatiyaakko geleedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Kaatii Yooseefo, «Taani akumuwaa akumetaad; shin Aa ittuunne billanaw danddayibeenna. Shin taani, ‹Yooseefo akumuwaa sisooppe, billanaw danddayee› giyaawaa sisaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yooseefo, «Taani hewaa danddaykke; shin S'oossay kaatiyaw likke birshshetsaa immana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Kaatii, «Taani ta akumuwaan Nayle Shaafaa doonaan ek'k'a de'ishin, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />laappun orddanne mod'd'o miizzatuu Nayle Shaafaappe kesiide, mak'k'aa gidduwaan miino. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Unttunttuppe simmiide, hara laappun malaa iita, gilk'k'anne laafa miizzatuu keseeddino; taani hewaa mala malaa iita miizzaa Gibs'e gadiyaan ubbakka be'a erikke. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Malaa iitanne laafa miizzatuu koyrowantta, laappun mod'd'o miizzatuwaa meeddino. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Shin unttuntta meeddawaappe guyyenna, unttunttu meeddawaa ooninne eranaw danddayibeenna; ayaw gooppe, unttunttu malay kasewaadankka iiti utteedda. Hewaappe guyye taani beegottaad.<verse eid="GEN 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />«Taani ta akumuwaan k'ay laappun lo"anne muruta tishatuwaa itti anuwaan dic'c'eeddawantta be'aaddi. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Unttunttuppe simmiide, c'eec'c'edanne away doliyaa bagga c'arkkuwaan shulleedda hara laappun tishatuu keseeddino. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />He c'eec'c'eedda tishatuu laappun lo"o tishatuwaa mitteeddino. Taani ha akumuwaa bitiyaawanttoo odaad; shin taw akumuwaa biliyaawe beettibeenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Hewaappe guyye Yooseefo Gibs'e kaatiyaa, «Kaatiyaa akumotuu ittuwaa. S'oossay bare ootsana haniyaawaa kaatiyaw k'onc'c'isseedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />He laappun lo"o miizzatuu laappun laytsatuwaa; k'ay laappun lo"o tishatuu laappun laytsatuwaa; ha akumuu ittuwaa. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />He laappun malaa iitanne laafa miizzatuu laappun laytsatuwaa; k'ay away doliyaa bagga c'arkkuwaan shulleedda, c'eec'o laappun tishatuu laappun koshaa laytsatuwaa.<verse eid="GEN 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />«Taani kaatiyaw odeeddawaadankka, S'oossay bare ootsana haniyaawaa kaatiyaw besseedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Laappun daro kalo laytsatuu Gibs'e biittaw ubbaw yaana; <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />shin laappun koshaa laytsay hewaa kaallana. He wode Gibs'e kaluu ubbay dogettana; koshay biittaa s'iis's'ana. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />He biittaa kaluu hassayettenan attanawaa; ayaw gooppe, hewaa kaalleedda koshay loytsi suullana. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Laa"u ogiyaan kaatiyaw he akumuu beetteeddawe ayaasee gooppe, ha yewuwaa S'oossay minisiidde k'achcho diraassa; S'oossay hewaa ellekka ootsana.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />«Ha"i simmi, kaatii aad'd'eeda eranchchanne c'inc'c'a asaa koyiide, Gibs'e biittan suntso. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Kaatii biittan suntsatuwaa laappun kalo laytsaan bukiyaa katsaappe ichcheshu kushiyaappe ittuwaa shiishshanaw suntso. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Unttunttu yiyaa kalo laytsatuwaan katsaa shiishshiide, kaatiyaa aawotetsaan minjjino; he katsaa katamatuwaan naagino. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Biittay koshaan d'ayenna mala, ha katsay Gibs'e biittan laappun laytsaan denddana koshaw minjjettiide de'o» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaatii Yooseefa Gibs'e Biittaa Ubbaa Bollan Suntseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Ha yewuu Gibs'e kaatiyawunne Aa oosanchchatoo lo"a gidiide beetteedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Hewaa diraw kaatii unttuntta, «Nuuni S'oossaa Ayyaanana de'iyaa hawaa mala hara asaa demmaneeyye?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Hewaappe guyye kaatii Yooseefo, «S'oossay hawaa ubbaa neena erisseedda diraw, ne mala aad'd'eeda eraynne c'inc'c'atetsay de'iyaawe ooninne baawa. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Taani neena ta gollen suntsay; ta Asay ubbay new azazettana; taani neeppe aad'd'iyaawe ta kawutetsaa araataa s'alalaana gido» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:10">Kit. 7:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Hewaa diraw kaatii Yooseefo, «Be'a; taani neena Gibs'e gadiyaa ubbaa bollan suntsaad» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Hewaappe guyye, kaatii bare paramiyaa migiduwaa bare birad'd'iyaappe kessiide, Yooseefo birad'd'iyaan wotseedda. Talbbaappe dadetteedda mayuwaa I Aa mayzziide, Aa k'ood'iyaankka work'k'aa sanssalataa aatseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:29">Dan. 5:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Kaatii bare laa"entso paraa gaariyaa Yooseefa togisseedda; k'oomatuu, «Goynnite! Goynnite!» yaagiidde aappe sintsanna hametteeddino. Hawaadan ootsiide, kaatii Aa Gibs'e biittaa ubbaa bollan suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Hewaappe guyye kaatii Yooseefo, «Taani kaatiyaa; shin neeni dentso geenan Gibs'e biittaa ubbaan ooninne kushiyaa woy gediyaa dentsenna» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Kaatii Yooseefa, «S'aafinaati-Pa'inaaha» giide suntseedda; I aw Oona giyaa katamaa k'eesiyaa P'oos'ifaara naatto Asinaato machche ootsi immeedda. Yaatina Yooseefo Gibs'e biittaa ubbaa saanna aad'd'eedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yooseefo Gibs'e kaatiyaw ootsanaw doommiyaa wode, aw laytsay hattama. K'ay Yooseefo kaatiyaa sintsappe kesiide, Gibs'e biittaa ubbaa gidduwaa hametteedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />He laappun kalo laytsatuwaan biittay daro katsaa doleedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yooseefo Gibs'e biittan he laappun kalo laytsaa katsaa ubbaa shiishshiide, katamatuwaan minjjeedda. Itti itti katamaa yuushshuwaan de'iyaa goshshaa katsaa ubbaa he katamatuwaan minjjeedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yooseefo abbaa shafiyaa keeshshaa daro katsaa minjjeedda; katsay darina, makkanaw danddayibeenna diraw, makki makki k'oliyaawaa aggi basheedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Koshaa laytsay yaanaappe kase, Oona katamaa k'eesiyaa P'oos'ifaara naatti Asinaatippe Yooseefo laa"u attuma naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yooseefo bare bayira na'aa Minaasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Minaasa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraaweetsuwaan S'oossay ta metuwaa ubbaanne ta aawuwaa soo asaa ubbaa dogiseedda giyaawaa.</char></note> suntseedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Laa"entso na'aa Efireema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:52 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Efireema: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan «S'oossay taan tuggateedda biittaan taana ayfiseedda» yaagiyaawaa.</char></note> suntseedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Gibs'e biittan de'iyaa he laappun kalo laytsatuu wureeddino. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />K'ay Yooseefo odeeddawaadan laappun koshaa laytsatuu doommeeddino. Hara biittan ubbaan koshay denddeedda; shin Gibs'e biittaa ubbaan katsay de'ee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:11">Kit. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Gibs'e biittay ubbay koshateedda wode, Asay katsaw kaatiyaa waasseedda. Kaatii Gibs'e asaa ubbaa, «Yooseefokko biite; I odiyaawaa ootsite» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:5">Yoh. 2:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Koshay Gibs'e biittaa ubbaa gakkeedda wode, Yooseefo katsaa minjjeedda golliyaa ubbaa dooyiide, katsaa Gibs'e asaw zal"eedda; ayaw gooppe, Gibs'en koshay pentteedda. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Sa'aa ubbaan koshay s'iis's'i de'iyaa diraw, sa'aan de'iyaa Asay ubbay katsaa Yooseefoppe woomanaw Gibs'e yeedda.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Yooseefo Ishatuu Gibs'e beeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yaak'oobi Gibs'en katsay de'iyaawaa siseedda wode, bare attuma naanaa, «hinttenttu ittuu ittuwaa ayaw s'eelliitee? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Be'ite! Gibs'en katsay de'iyaawaa taani sisaad; yaa duge biide, nuuni hayk'k'ennan pas'a de'ana mala, yaappe amareedawaa nuw woomite» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Kit. 7:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Yooseefo ishatuu tamattu katsaa woomanaw duge Gibs'e beeddino. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Shin Yaak'oobi Yooseefo ishaa Biiniyaama Aa ishatuwaanna yeddibeenna; ayaw gooppe, I k'ohettanenttonne giide k'oppeedda. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Kanaane biittan wolk'k'aama koshay de'iyaa diraw, katsaa woomanaw yeeddawanttuna israa'eeliyaa attuma naanay Gibs'e geleeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />He wode Yooseefo he biittaa ayissiyaawanttanne biittan de'iyaa asaw ubbaw katsaa zal"iyaawaa; hewaa diraw Yooseefo ishatuu gakkeedda wode, barenttu deemuwaa sa'aa gatsiide aw goynneeddinno. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yooseefo bare ishatuwaa be'o saani eri aggeeda; shin I unttuntta erennawaadan laametteedda; I unttuntta, «hinttenttu hak'appe yeedditee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Unttunttu, «Katsaa woomanaw, Kanaane biittaappe yeeddo» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Yooseefo bare ishatuwaa ereedda; shin unttunttu Aa eribeykkino. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Hewaappe guyye, Yooseefo unttunttuwaa akumeteedda bare akumuwaa hassayiide unttuntta, «hinttenttu geeddi s'eelliyaa asaa; hinttenttu nu biittan naagu leppiyaa baggay hak'awentto be'anaw yeeddita» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:5-10">Dom. 37:5-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Unttunttu, «tuytti, nu godaw, nuuni geeddi s'eelliyaa asaa gidokko; nuuni ne k'oomatuu katsaa woomanaw yeeddo. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Nuuni ubbaykka itti aawuwaa naanaa. Nuuni ne k'oomatuu ammanettiyaa asaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yooseefo unttuntta, «tuytti; hinttenttu nu biittan naagu leppiyaa baggay hak'awentto be'anaw yeeddita» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Shin unttunttu, «Nuuni ne k'oomatuu tammanne laa"u ishatuwaanne Kanaane biittan de'iyaa itti bitaniyaa naanaa. Wurssetsa d'antsaa duusuu ha"i nu aabunna de'ee; ittuu d'ayeedda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yooseefo unttuntta, «Taani hinttenttoo odeeddawaadankka hinttenttu biittaa geediyaawantta. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />K'ay hinttenttu paac'ettanawe hawaana; tumuwaappe kaatii hayk'k'o; hinttenttu wurssetsa teefa ishay hawaa yaana d'ayooppe, hinttenttu hawaappe biikkita. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Hinttenttu odiyaawe tuma gidiyaawaa paac'c'anaw, hintteppe ittuwaa kiittite; I hinttenttu ishaa akkiidde yo; atteedawanttu k'asho gollen gam"iita. Hewaa gidana d'ayooppe, kaatii hayk'k'o; hinttenttu biittaa geediyaawantta» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Unttuntta heezzu gallassaw k'asho gollen yeggeedda.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Heezzentso gallassan Yooseefo unttuntta, «Taani S'oossaw yayyiyaa asaa; hinttenttu ittibaa ootsooppe, pas'a de'ana. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Hinttenttu tumukka ammanettiyaa asaa gidooppe, hinttenttu ishatuwaappe ittuu hawaan k'asho gollen de'o; atteedawanttu koshatiyaa hinttenttu soo asaw katsaa akkiidde afite; <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />shin hinttenttu k'aalaa tumayana malanne hinttenttu hayk'k'enna mala hinttenttu hinttenttu wurssetsa teefa ishaa taakko ahana koshshee» yaageedda. Unttunttunne ha yewuwaa mayyeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Unttunttu ittuu ittuwaa, «Tumu nuuni nu ishaw ootseeddabay nuuna kaa'ee. I bare shemppo haniyaabay is's'ina, nuw watiwatiyaa wode, nuuni sisiide is's'eeddo; ha waayii nuuna gakkeeddawe hewaa diraassa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Roobeeli, «Taani hinttentta, ‹Na'aa bolla nagaraa ootsoppite› gaade odabeykkitaa? Shin hinttenttu sisennan is's'eeddita. Simmi ha"i, Aa suutsay nuuna achchee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:21-22">Dom. 37:21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Unttunttu giyaabaa Yooseefo ereeddawaa unttunttu akeekibeykkino; ayaw gooppe, I unttunttunna wokkaaliyaan haasayiyaa diraassa. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />I unttunttuppe wora simmiide yeekkeedda; shin k'ay unttunttukko simmiide, unttunttoo gujjiide haasayeedda. I Simoona unttunttuppe duutsi ashshiide unttunttu be'ishin k'achcheeda.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yooseefo Ishatuu Kanaane Biittaa Simmeeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yooseefo bare k'oomatuwaa, «Katsaa unttunttu ogoruwaa kuntsite; unttunttu biraakka zaariide, unttunttu ogoruwaan ogoruwaan wotsite; k'ay unttunttu ogiyaw shink'k'aa immite» yaagiide azazeedda. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />I geeddawaadan ootseeddawaappe guyye, Yooseefo ishatuu katsaa barenttu haretuwaan c'aaniide, denddiide beeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Unttunttu k'ammaa ak'anaw simmeeddino unttunttuppe ittuu bare hariyaw katsaappe yegganaw bare ogoruwaa biliide, he ogoruwaa doonaan de'iyaa bare biraa be'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />I bare ishatuwaa, «Ta biray taw simmeedda; tumu hawaa be'ite! Ta ogoruwaan de'ee» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Unttunttu wozanay dagaminna, kokkoriidde ittuu ittuwaakko simmiide, «S'oossay nu bolla ootseeddabay hawe ayee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Unttunttu Kanaane biittan de'iyaa barenttu aawuwaa Yaak'oobakko yeedda wode, barena gakkeeddawaa ubbaa aw odeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />Unttunttu aw, «He biittaw goda gideedda bitanii nuuna hank'k'eteedda. Hewaappe guyye, I nuuna he biittaa geeddiyaawaadan godatteedda. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Shin nuuni Aa, ‹Nuuni ammanettiyaa asaa; biittaa geediyaawantta gidokko. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Nuuni tammanne laa"u ishatuu itti aawuwaa naanaa; ittuu d'ayeedda; wurssetsa teefay Kanaane biittan ha"i nu aabunna de'ee› yaageeddo. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />He biittaw goda gideedda bitanii nuuna, ‹Hintte ammanettiyaa asaa gidiyaawaa taani hawaan erana; hinttenttu ishatuwaappe ittuwaa hawaan ta matan yeggiide, koshatiyaa hinttenttu soo asaw katsaa akkiidde biite. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Hinttenttu biittaa geediyaawantta gidenaan, ammanettiyaa asaa gidiyaawaa taani erana mala, hinttenttu wurssetsa teefa ishaa taakko akki yiite. Yaatooppe taani haan atteeda hinttenttu ishaa hinttenttoo zaaraadde immana; hinttenne ha biittan zal"iita› geedda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Unttunttu barenttu ogoruwaappe katsaa k'oliidde, barenttu ogoruwaan ogoruwaan barenttu biraa k'ashuwaana utteeddawaa demmeeddino. Unttunttunne unttunttu aawuu he k'ashuwaana de'iyaa biraa be'iide yayyeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Unttunttu aawuwaa Yaak'oobi unttuntta, «hinttenttu taana ta naanatuwaappe mela kesseeddita; Yooseefo baawa, Simooni baawa; k'ay hinttenttu Biiniyaama afana koyiita. Ubbabay taw tiraan sitti geedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Hewaappe guyye Roobeeli bare aawuwaa, «Taani Biiniyaama new zaaraadde ahana d'ayooppe, ta attuma naanaa laa"uwaakka wod'a; taana ammanettaade Aa ta kushiyaan wotsa; k'ay taani Aa zaaraadde ahana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Shin Yaak'oobi unttuntta, «Ta na'ay hinttenana yaa duge beenna; Aa ishay hayk'k'ina, atteedawe Aa s'alala; hinttenttu afishshin, ogiyaan iitabay Aa gakkiyaawaa gidooppe, hinttenttu ta puuluntsaa huup'iyaa kayyuwaan duufuwaan yeggiita» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Yooseefo Ishatuu Biiniyaamana Simmiide Gibs'e beeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Ha"inne koshay Kanaane biittan wolk'k'aameedda. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Yaatina unttunttu Gibs'eppe aheedda katsaa ubbaa mi wurssi diggina, unttunttu aawuu, «K'aykka guyye biide nuw amareeda katsaa woomite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Shin Yihuday Aa, «He bitanii nuuna, ‹Hintte ishay hinttenana yaana d'ayooppe, ta deemuwaa zaari be'ikkita› yaagiide loytsi odeedda. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Neeni nu ishaa nuunana yeddooppe, nuuni duge biide new katsaa shammana. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Shin neeni Aa yeddennawaa gidooppe, nuuni duge bookko; ayaw gooppe, he bitanii nuuna, ‹Hintte ishay hinttenana yaana d'ayooppe, hinttenttu ta deemuwaa zaari be'ikkita› geedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Israa'eelii, «Hinttenttu, ‹Nuw hara ishay de'ee› giide odiide ha metuwaa ta bolla ayaw aheedditee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Unttunttu Aa, «He bitanii nubaanne nu soo asaabaa loytsi oochcheedda. I nuuna, ‹Hintte aawuu ha"ikka pas'a de'ii? hinttenttoo hara ishay de'ii?› yaagiide oochcheedda. Nuuni I oochcheeddawaa aw zaareeddo. I nuuna, ‹Hintte ishaa duge haa ahite› gaanawaa nuuni ayan eranee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yihuday bare aawuwaa israa'eeliyaa, «Nuunikka neenikka nu naanaykka pas'a de'ana malanne hayk'k'ennan attana mala, na'aa taananna yedda; nuuni ellekka baana. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Na'aa ta waasetetsaan imma; aban taana oochcha; taani Aa new saro zaaraadde ahana d'ayooppe, ta de'uwaa ubbaan ne shek'ay taana gakko! <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Nuuni gam"ibeenawaa gidintto, hannoode laa'entsuwaa yaa gakkiide simmana shin» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Hewaappe guyye unttunttu aawuu Israa'eele unttuntta, «Hewaa gidooppe, yaatite; he bitaniyaw kushiyaa gentsiyaawaa ha biittan doleeddawaa ubbaappe lo"iyaawaa doorite; hewenne balasaane giyaa d'aliyaa, eessaa, sawuwaa, karbbiyaanne tamire lawuziyaa giyaa mitsatuwaa teeraa hinttenttu ogoruwaan yeggiide akki biite. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Hinttenttu ogoruwaa doonaan simmeedda biray baletseeddawaa gidanaw danddayiyaa diraw, biraakka laa"u kushe ootsiide akki biite. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />K'ay hinttenttu ishaanne akkiidde, he bitaniyaakko ellekka guyye biite. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />I hinkko hinttenttu ishaa yeddana mala, Biiniyaamenne hinttenana yaana mala, Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay he bitanii hinttenttoo k'arettanaadan ootso. Taana gidooppe, ta naanatuwaappe mela attooppenne ataad» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Hewaa diraw he asatuu imotaanne laa"u kushe biraanne k'ay Biiniyaamanne akkeeddino. Unttunttu duge Gibs'e biide, Yooseefo sintsa shiik'eeddino. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yooseefo Biiniyaama unttunttunna be'eedda wode, bare golle kaappuwaa, «He asaa ta soo akkaade ba; itti mehiyaa shukkaade giigissa; unttunttu seeta gallassan laas'aa taananna miino» yaagiide azazeedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Yaatina I Yooseefo aw odeeddawaadan he asaa Yooseefo soo afeedda. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Asatuu Yooseefo soo beedda diraw, yayyeeddino; unttunttu, «Nuuni hawaa yeeddawe koyro ogoruwaanna simmiide beedda biraa diraassa; I nuuna wad'd'anaw, ayiletetsaan mooddanawunne nu haretuwaa akkanaw haneedda» yaagiide k'oppeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Hewaa diraw unttunttu Yooseefo golle penggiyaa gakkiide, golliyaa kaappuwaa haasayisseeddino; <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />«Ta godaw, nuuni koyro katsaa woomanaw hawaa yeeddo; <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />simmiide nuuni k'ammaa ak'iyaa sa'aan ogoruwaa biliide, huup'iyaan huup'iyaan nu biray pac'c'ennan nu ogoruwaa doonaan de'iyaawaa demmeeddo; hewaa diraw ha"i nuuni Aa guyye akkiidde yeeddo. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />K'ay nuuni katsaa woomanaw hara biraakka aheeddo. Nu biraa nu ogoruwaa ogoruwaa doonaan ooni wotseeddenttonne erokko» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />I unttuntta, «Hewe ayinne baawa; yayyoppite! hinttenttu S'oossay, hinttenttu aawuwaa S'oossay, hinttenttu ogoruwaa giddon hinttenttoo biraa immeedda; taani hinttenttu biraa akkaad» yaageedda. Hewaappe guyye, I Simoona unttunttukko keseedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />He bitanii he asaa Yooseefo soo afiide, unttunttu gediyaw haatsaa ayina, barenttu gediyaa meec'etteeddino. Unttunttu haretoo hark'k'uwaa yeggeedda. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Yooseefo seeta gallassi yiina immanaw, unttunttu barenttu immotaa aw giigisseeddino; ayaw gooppe, unttunttu yan maanawaa sisi utteeddino.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yooseefo bare soo geleedda wode, unttunttu soo aheedda barenttu immiyaawaa son aw immeeddino; unttunttu Aa sintsan sa'aa gakkiide goynneeddinno. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />I unttunttu sarotetsaa oochchi simmiide, «Hinttenttu taw odeedda hinttenttu aawuu c'imay lo"ee? Ha"ikka I pas'a de'ii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Unttunttu, «Ee, ne k'oomay, nu aawuu ha"ikka pas'a de'ee; I lo"a» yaagiide hokkiide aw goynneeddinno.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />I bare aati na'aa Biiniyaama be'eedda wode unttuntta, «hinttenttu odeedda wurssetsa teefa hinttenttu ishay hawe?» yaageedda. K'ay I Biiniyaama, «Ta na'aw, neena S'oossay anjjo» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Yooseefo Aa ishay aw gomppay mishetteedda diraw, yeekkanaw itti sa'aa lawuhu geedda. I bare dumma k'ol"uwaa geliide yan yeekkeedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />I bare deemuwaa meec'ettowaappe guyye kesiide, barena mintsetsiide, «K'umaa aatsite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 43:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Unttunttu aw dumma, he ishatoo dumma, hewaan aanana miyaa Gibs'e asatoo dumma aatseeddino; ayaw gooppe, Gibs'e asatuu Ibraawe asatuwaana ittippe miikkino. Hewe Gibs'e biittaa asaa sheneyiyaawaa. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Unttunttu Yooseefo sintsan bayiray bare bayiratetsaadan, teefay bare teefatetsaadan maaran utteeddino. Unttunttu ittuu ittuwaa s'eelliide, unttuntta wooti utisseeddinontto be'iide maalaleteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Yooseefo maaddaappe unttunttoo k'umaa gishiyaa wode, Biiniyaamew gakkeeddawe haratuwaappe ichcheshu kushiyaa daree; yaatina unttunttu nashettiidde aanana meeddinonne usheeddino.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Yooseefo Biraa Wanc'c'aa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Yooseefo bare golle kaappuwaa, «Neeni ha asatuwaa ogoruu akiyaawaa keeshshaa katsaa unttunttoo kuntsaa; unttunttu ubbaa biraakka unttunttu ogoruwaa ogoruwaa doonaan wotsa; <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />yaataade wurssetsa teefaa ogoruwaa doonaan ta biraa wanc'c'aanne Aa katsaa biraa wotsa» yaagiide azazeedda; I Yooseefo geeddawaadan ootseedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Sa'ay wonttina he asatuu barenttu haretuwaa akkiidde baanaw moyzzeteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Unttunttu he katamaappe kesiide haakki beennan de'ishshin, Yooseefo bare golle kaappuwaa, «Dendda! Ha asatuwaa geeduwaa kaala; neeni unttuntta gakkeedda wode unttunttu, ‹Hintte ayaw keekaa iitan zaareedditee? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Hawe ta goday ushiyaanne k'ay s'uurabaa demmiyaa wanc'c'aa gidennee? Hawe hinttenttu ootseeddabay balabaa› yaaga» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />I unttunttu geeduwaa gakkiide, ha geeddawaadankka unttunttoo odeedda. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Shin unttunttu, «Ta goday hawaa mala k'aalaa ayaw haasayii? Hewaa malaa ootsiyaawe nuuppe ne k'oomatuwaappe haakko! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Nuuni haray atto nu ogoruwaa doonaappe demmeedda biraa Kanaane biittaappe guyye new zaari aheeddo. <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Ne godaa golliyaappe nuuni work'k'aa woy biraa wooti wuu'eetoo? Ne k'oomatuwaa giddon he wanc'c'ay beetteedda uray hayk'k'o; k'ay atteeda nuuni nu godaw ayile gidana» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />I unttuntta, «Hewaa gidooppe lo"a; hinttenttu geeddawaadan wanc'c'aa akkeedda ooninne ta ayile gidana; hinkko atteeda hinttenttu boriyaappe saro attana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Hewaappe guyye, unttunttu ellekka barenttu ogoruwaa ogoruwaa sa'aan wotsiide billeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />He kaappuu ubbaappe bayiratiyaawaa ogoruwaappe doommiide wurssetsa teefa gakkanaw koyeedda; he wanc'c'aa Biiniyaama ogoruwaa giddoppe demmeedda. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Hewaan unttunttu kayyotiide, barenttu mayuwaa peed'eeddino; barenttu ogoruwaa barenttu haretuwaan c'aaniide, guyye katamaa simmeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yihuday bare ishatuwaanna Yooseefokko geliyaa wode, Yooseefo son de'ee; unttunttu Aa sintsan sa'aan guufanneeddino. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yooseefo unttuntta, «hinttenttu ayaa iitabaa ootseeddite? Ta mala Asay s'uurabaa demmiyaawaa erikkiteeyye?» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yihuday, «Ta godaw nuuni ayaa gaanee? Nuuni ayaa haasayanee? Woy nuuni s'illuwaa gidiyaawaa wooti bessanee? S'oossay ne ayiletuwaa bayzzuwaa k'onc'c'issi diggeedda. Simmi nuunikka he wanc'c'ay aappe beetteeddawekka ta godaw ayile gideedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Shin Yooseefo, «Hawaa malaa ootsiyaawe taappe haakko; ta wanc'c'ay aappe beetteedda bitaniyaa s'alalay ta ayile gidana. Hinkko hinttenttu hinttenttu aawuwaakko guyye saro simmite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Yihuday aakko shiik'iide Aa, «Ta godaw, taani itti k'aalaa haasayana mala neena woossay; taana ne ayiliyaa hank'k'ettoppa; ayaw gooppe, neeni kaatiyaa mala. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Neeni ta goday nuuna ne ayiletuwaa, ‹Hinttenttoo aawuu de'iiyye woy ishay de'ii?› yaagaadde oochchaadda. <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Nuunikka, ‹Nuw c'imeedda aawuu de'ee; I c'imi kichchiide yeleedda teefa na'aykka de'ee; he na'aa ishay hayk'k'eedda; bare aatiw itti Aa s'alalay atteedda; Aa aawuu Aa siik'ee› yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />«Neeni ne ayiletuwaa, ‹Taani Aa be'ana mala taw ahite› yaagaadda. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Nuuni ta godaa, ‹He na'ay bare aawuwaappe shaakettanaw danddayenna; shaakettooppe Aa aawuu hayk'k'anita› yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Shin neeni ne ayiletuwaa, ‹Hintte teefa ishay hinttenana duge yaana d'ayooppe, laa"entsuwaa ta deemuwaa be'ikkita› yaagaadda. <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Nuuni ne ayilatuu nu aawuwaakko simmiide beedda wode, ta goday geeddawaa aw odeeddo.<verse eid="GEN 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />«Nu aawuu, ‹Guye biide amareeda katsaa woomite› yaagina, <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />nuuni Aa, ‹Nu teefa ishay nuunana booppe attin, duge baanaw danddayokko; ayaw gooppe, nu ishay teefay nuunana beennawaa gidooppe, nuuni he bitaniyaa deemuwaa be'anaw danddayokko› yaageeddo.<verse eid="GEN 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />«Nu aawuu ne ayili nuuna, ‹Ta machata Raaheela taw laa"u attuma naanaa yeleeddawaa hinttenttu eriita; <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />unttunttuppe ittuu taappe shaakettiide biina, «Tumu Aa do'ay puuzereetsi meedda» yaagaad; hachche gakkanaw taani Aa be'abeykke. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Hawaa k'ay hinttenttu taappe shaakki afina, iitabay Aa gakkooppe, hinttenttu ta puuluntsaa huup'iyaa kayyuwaan duufuwaan yeggana› yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30-31" />«Hewaa diraw, ha"i taani guyye ne ayiliyaa ta aawuwaakko biyaa wode, ta aawuu, na'aa bare shemppuwaadan siik'iyaawe, na'ay nuunana baynnaawaa be'ooppe hayk'k'i aggana. Nuuni ne ayiletuu nu aawuwaa puuluntsaa huup'iyaa kayyuwaan duufuwaan yeggeetto. <verse eid="GEN 44:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Taani ne ayili na'aa ta waasetetsaan akkaad; taani Aa, ‹Ta aawoo, taani Aa new saro zaaraadde ahana d'ayooppe, ta de'uwaa ubbaan ne shek'ay taana gakko!› yaaga wotsaad.<verse eid="GEN 44:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />«Yaateedda diraw, taani ne ayili ta godaw na'aa diraw ayiletaade, hawaan attina, na'ay bare ishatuwaanna guyye simmo. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Na'ay baynnan taani waanaade guyye ta aawuwaakko simmanee? tuytti, taana ta aawuu seelettana seelaa bessoppa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yooseefo Barena Bare Ishatoo Erisseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />He wode Yooseefo he asaa ubbaa sintsaan genc'c'ana danddayibeenna; «Asaa ubbaa ta sintsaappe kessite» yaagiide waasseedda. Hewaa diraw Yooseefo barena bare ishatoo erisseedda wode, aanana ooninne baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Kit. 7:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />I bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'isiide, Gibs'etuu Aa sisana gakkanaw loytsi yeekkeedda. Kaatiyaa soo Asay he woriyaa siseedda.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yooseefo bare ishatoo, «Taani Yooseefattee! Ta aawuu hanno gakkanaw pas'a de'iiyye?» yaagiide oochcheedda. Shin Aa ishatuu loytsi dagammeedda diraw, aw zaarana danddayibeykkino.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yaatina Yooseefo bare ishatuwaa, «Taakko haa shiik'ite» yaageedda. Unttunttu aakko shiik'eeddino; I unttuntta, «Taani hinttenttu ishaa Yooseefa; hinttenttu Gibs'e biittaw zal"eeddawaa. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />K'ay hinttenttu taana hawoo zal"eedda diraw, k'um"ettopitenne kayyotoppite; ayaw gooppe, S'oossay taana hintteppe sintsaw kiitteeddawe asaa shemppuwaa ashshanaassa. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Ha biittaa koshay geloodeppe laa"entso laytsaa; k'ay yiyaa ichcheshu laytsatuwaan Asay goshenna woy c'akkenna. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Shin taani sa'aan hinttenttoo zeretsaa ashshana malanne hinttenttu de'uwaa darissa ashshana mala, S'oossay taana hintteppe sintsaw kiitteedda. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Simmi taana ha sa'aa kiitteeddawe S'oossaa gidiyaawaappe attina, hinttentta gidikkita. I taana Gibs'e kaatiyaw aawuwaa, aw de'iyaawaa ubbaw godanne Gibs'e biittaa mooddiyaawaa ootseedda.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />«Ha"i elleelli guyye ta aawuwaakko biide Aa, ‹Ne na'ay Yooseefo hawaadan yaagee; «S'oossay taana Gibs'e biittaa ubbaa bollan goda keseedda; neeni taakko duge haaya; gam"oppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Kit. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Neeni Geseeme biittan uttaasa; k'ay neeni, ne naanay, ne naanaa naanay, ne dorssaa wudii, ne miizzaa wudiinne new de'iyaabay ubbay ta matan de'iita. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Biro ichcheshu koshaa laytsatuu atteeddino; neena, ne soo asaanne ne mehiyaa koshay oyk'k'enna mala, taani neena mizana» yaageedda› yaagite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />K'aykka Yooseefo unttuntta, «Hinttekka ta ishaa Biiniyaamekka, ha hinttenanna haasayiyaawe tumu taana Yooseefa gidiyaawaa hinttenttu ayfiyaan be'iita. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Taw Gibs'e biittan de'iyaa bonchchuwaa ubbaanne hinttenttu be'eeddawaa ubbaa ta aawoo odite; ta aawuwaanne ellekka haa duge akki yiite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Bare ishaa Biiniyaama k'ood'iyaa k'oommi yeekkeedda; Biiniyaamekka bare ishaa k'oommi yeekkeedda. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Yooseefo bare ishatuwaa ubbaa yeriide, unttunttu bollankka yeekkeedda. Hewaappe guyye, Aa ishatuu aanana haasayeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Yooseefo ishatuu yeedda worii kaatiyaa golle gakkeedda wode, kaatiinne Aa oosanchchatuu nashetteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Kaatii Yooseefo, «Neeni ne ishatuwaa yaatite ga; ‹Hintte mehiyaa c'aaniide, Kanaane gadiyaa simmite; <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />hinttenttu aawuwaanne hinttenttu soo asaa akkiidde, guyye taakko haa ahite. Taani hinttenttoo Gibs'e biittan ubbaa sa'aappe lo"iyaa sa'aa immina, hinttenttu ha biittaa mod'd'uwaa kaashana› yaaga. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />K'aykka neeni ne ishatuwaa, ‹Paraa gaariyaa hinttenttu naanatuwaanne hinttenttu mac'c'a asatuwaa ahiyaawantta Gibs'eppe akkiide biite; hinttenttu aawuwaanne akkiidde yiite. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Gibs'e biittan de'iyaa ubbaappe aad'd'i lo"iyaawe hinttessa gidiyaa diraw, hinttenttu mas'uwaa k'oppoppite› yaagaade oda» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Israa'eeliyaa attuma naanay geeddawaadan ootseeddino. Yooseefo kaatii azazeeddawaadan paraa gaaretuwaanne ogiyaw shink'k'aa unttunttoo immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Unttunttoo ubbawukka huup'iyaan huup'iyaan ooratsa mayuwaa immeedda; shin Biiniyaamew heezzu s'eetu s'agaraa biraanne ichcheshu kumentsaa mayuwaa immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />I bare aawoo yeddeeddawe hawaa; Gibs'en de'iyaa ubbabaappe lo"iyaawaa tammu hariyaan c'aaniide, k'ay ogiyaw katsaa, ukitsaanne hara shink'k'aa tammu mac'c'a haretuwaan c'aaniide yedeedda. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Yooseefo bare ishatuwaa moyzzeedda. Unttunttu biishshin I unttuntta, «Ogiyaan biidde walak'ettoppite» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Unttunttu Gibs'eppe kesiide beeddino; Kanaane biittaa biide, barenttu aawuwaa Yaak'oobakko gakkeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Unttunttu aw hawaadan yaagiide odeeddino; «Yooseefo pas'a de'ee! I hewaappenne Gibs'e biittaa ubbaa mooddiyaawaa» yaageeddino; Yaak'ooba dagamay wozanaa bayzzeedda diraw, unttuntta ammanibeenna. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Shin unttunttu Yooseefo barenttoo odeeddawaa ubbaa aw odinanne Aa akki ahana mala Yooseefo kiitteedda paraa gaaretuwaa I be'ina, unttunttu aawuwaa Yaak'ooba shemppu simmeedda. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Israa'eelii, «Hewe taw gidee; ta na'aa Yooseefo hanno gakkanaw pas'a de'ee! Taani hayk'k'anaappe kase baade, Aa be'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="ms">Israa'eelatuu Gibs'e Gadiyaan</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="GEN 46:1-50:26">46:1—50:26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobinne Aa Soo Aasi Duge Gibs'e beeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Israa'eelii barew de'iyaawaa ubbaa akki denddiide, Berssaabeha gakkeedda; I bare aawuwaa Yisaak'a S'oossaw yarshshuwaa yarshsheedda. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />S'oossay k'amma akumuwaan Aa, «Yaak'ooba, Yaak'ooba» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">I, «abee» giide koyeedda.<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Aa, «Taani S'oossaa, ne aawuwaa S'oossaa; neeni duge Gibs'e baanaw yayyoppa; ayaw gooppe, taani neena yan wolk'k'aama kawutetsaa kesana. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Taani neenana ittippe Gibs'e baana; k'ay taani ne zeretsaa yaappe kesana. Yooseefo bare kushiyaan ne ayfiyaa shiishshana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Hewaappe guyye, Yaak'oobi Berssaabeheppe denddeedda; Israa'eeliyaa attuma naanay barenttu aawuwaa Yaak'ooba, barenttu naanaanne barenttu machatuwaa Gibs'e kaatii unttunttoo kiitteedda paraa gaariyaan wotsiide afeedino. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Unttunttu Kanaane biittan mooddeedda mas'uwaanne mehiyaa ubbaa afeedino. Yaak'oobinne Aa zeretsaa ubbay aanana Gibs'e beeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Kit. 7:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />I bare attuma naanaanne bare naanaa attuma naanaa, bare mac'c'a naanaanne bare naanaa mac'c'a naanaa, hewenne bare zeretsaa ubbaa barenana Gibs'e afeedda.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'ooba Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Israa'eelana Gibs'e gadiyaa beedda israa'eeliyaa naanaa suntsay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:8">Yaak'ooba bayira na'ay Roobeela; <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Roobeela attuma naanay Hanooka, Paalu, Hes'iroonanne Karmma. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simoona attuma naanay Yimu'eela, Yaamiina, Ohaada, Yaakiina, S'ohaaranne Kanaane mishiratti na'aa Shaa'uula. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Leewii attuma naanay Gershshoona, K'ahaatanne Maraara. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Yihudaa attuma naanay Eera, Oonaana, Sheela, Paareesanne Zaraaha; shin Eerinne Oonaani Kanaane biittan hayk'k'eeddino. Paareesa attuma naanay Hes'iroonanne Hamuula. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Yisaakoora attuma naanay Tolaa'a, Puuwa, Yaashuubanne Shimiroona. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Zaabiloona attuma naanay Sereeda, Eloonanne Yaahila'eela. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Hawanttu Liya Masp'p'es'oomiyaan Yaak'oobaw yeleedda attuma naanaa; I mac'c'a naatta Diino. Hawanttu Aa naanaynne naanaa naanay mulii hattamanne heezza.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gaade attuma naanay S'afoona, Hagga, Shuuna, Es'iboona, Eri, Aroodanne Ari"eela. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Aaseera attuma naanay Yimina, Yishiwa, Yishiwaahanne Barii'a; unttunttu michchata Seraaho. Barii'a attuma naanay Hebeeranne Malkki'eela. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Laabaani bare naatti Liyo immeedda Zilppa Yaak'oobaw yeleedda naanay hawantta; unttunttu mulii tammanne usuppuna.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Yaak'ooba machchatti Raaheeli attuma naanay Yooseefonne Biiniyaama. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Oona katamaa k'eesiyaa P'oos'ifaara naatta Asinaata Yooseefow Gibs'en Minaasanne Efireema yelaaddu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">Dom. 41:50-52</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Biiniyaama naanay Belaa'a, Bekeera, Ashibeela, Geera, Naa'imaana, Eeha, Roosha, Muppiima, Huppiimanne Arada. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Yaak'oobaw yeletteedda Raaheeli attuma naanay hawantta; unttunttu mulii tammanne oydda.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Diinaa attuma na'ay Hushiima. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Nifttaaleema attuma naanay Yaahis'i'eela, Guna, Yes'eeranne Shiileema. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Laabaani bare naatti Raaheeliw immeedda Baala Yaak'oobaw yeleedda naanay hawantta; unttunttu mulii laappuna.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Yaak'oobanna Gibs'e beedda, Aa gulbbataappe yeletteeddawanttu, Aa naanaa machatuwaa gujjennan, mulii usuppun tammanne usuppuna. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Gibs'en Yooseefow yeletteedda laa"u naanaa gujjina, Gibs'e beedda Yaak'ooba soo Asay mulii laappun tamma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Kit. 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobinne Aa Soo Aasi Gibs'en De'eeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Geseeme biittan mokkana mala, Yaak'oobi Yihudaa bareppe sintsaw Yooseefokko kiitteedda; unttunttu Geseeme gakkeedda wode, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yooseefo bare paraa gaariyaa giigissiide, bare aawuwaa Israa'eelana gaketanaw Geseeme beedda. Yooseefo bare aawuwaa demmeedda saannakka Aa k'ood'iyaan s'aas'etti k'oommi, daro wodiyaa yeekkeedda.<verse eid="GEN 46:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Israa'eelii Yooseefo, «Neeni pas'a de'ishshin, taani ne ayfiyaa be'eedda diraw, ha"i taani hayk'k'inttonne ayinne baawa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Hewaappe guyye, Yooseefo bare ishatuwaanne bare aawuwaa soo asaa, «Taani Gibs'e kaatiyaakko baana; aw, ‹Kanaane biittan de'iyaa ta ishatuwaanne ta aawuwaa soo Asay taakko yeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Unttunttu dorssaa hentsanchchaa; unttunttu mehiyaa heemmino; unttunttu barenana barenttu dorssatuwaa, barenttu miyatuwaanne barenttoo de'iyaawaa ubbaa akkiidde yeeddino› yaagana. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Kaatii hinttentta s'eesissiide, ‹Hintte kiittay ayee?› yaagiide oochchooppe, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />hinttenttu aw, ‹Nuuni ne k'oomatuu na'atetsaappe doommiide, nu aawotuwaadan mehiyaa heemmeetto› yaagite. I hinttentta Geseeme gadiyaan wotsanawaa; ayaw gooppe, dorssaa hentsanchchaa ubbay Gibs'e asan kad'eteeddawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yooseefo geliide Gibs'e kaatiyaw hawaadan yaagiide odeedda; «Ta aawunne ta ishatuu, barenttu dorssaa wudiyaanna, barenttu miyaa wudiyaannanne barenttoo de'iyaawaa ubbaanna Kanaane biittaappe yiide, ha"i Geseeme biittan de'ino» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />I bare ishatuwaappe ichcheshatuwaa dooriide kaatiyaa sintsa aatseedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Kaatii he ishatuwaa, «hinttenttu kiittay ayee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Unttunttu kaatiyaw, «Nuuni ne k'oomatuu nu aawotuwaadankka dorssaa wudiyaa heemmeetto» yaagiide zaareeddino. <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />K'ay unttunttu aw, «Kanaane biittan koshay s'iis's'i de'iyaa dirawunne ne k'oomatuwaa mehiyaw miyaabay ayinne baynna diraw, nuuni hawaan amareeda wodiyaa de'anaw yeeddo; hayyanaa nuuna ne k'oomatuwaa Geseemen wotsaarikkii!» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Kaatii Yooseefo, «Ne aawunne ne ishatuu neekko yeeddino. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Simmi Gibs'e biittay ne kushiyaan de'ee; ha gadiyaan ubbaa saappe aad'd'iide lo"iyaasan ne aawuwaanne ne ishatuwaa wotsa; unttunttu Geseeme biittan de'iino. Neeni erina, unttunttu giddoppe dumma eratetsay de'iyaawanttu de'ooppe, hewantta ta mehiyaa bolla suntsaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Hewaappe guyye, Yooseefo bare aawuwaa Yaak'ooba gelissiide, kaatiyaa sintsa aatseedda. Yaak'oobi Gibs'e kaatiyaa anjjeedawaappe guyye, <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />kaatii Yaak'ooba, «New woyssa laytsee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yaak'oobi kaatiyaa, «Taani yuuyyaadde de'eedda laytsay s'eetanne hattama; ta laytsay beni ta aawotuu yuuyyiidde de'eedda laytsatuwaappe guutsanne metuu dareeddawaa» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Hewaappe guyye, Yaak'oobi kaatiyaa anjjiide, Aa sintsaappe kare kesseedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Yooseefo bare aawuwaanne bare ishatuwaa Gibs'e biittan wotseedda; kaatii azazeeddawaadan Gibs'e biittan Raamisa giyaa katamaa matan de'iyaa, ubba saappe aad'd'iide lo"iyaa gadiyaa unttunttoo immeedda. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yooseefo k'ay bare aawoo, bare ishatoonne bare aawuwaa soo asaa ubbaw unttunttu naanaa payduwaadan katsaa immeedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gibs'en Koshay Suulleedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Gidooppenne koshay s'iis's'i de'iyaa diraw, he biittaa ubbaan katsi baawa. He koshan Gibs'enne Kanaane biittay laa"attuukka k'ohetteeddino. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yooseefo Gibs'e katsaa zal"iidde, Gibs'enne Kanaane biittatuwaan de'iyaa miishshaa ubbaa shiishsheedda; Gibs'e kaatiyaa golle gelisseedda. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Gibs'enne Kanaane shaluu wureedda wode, Gibs'e Asay ubbay Yooseefokko yiide Aa, «Nuw katsaa imma; nu shaluu wureedda diraw, nuuni ne sintsan ayaw hayk'k'eettoo?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yooseefo unttuntta, «Yaatooppe hinttenttu mehiyaa akki yiite; hinttenttu shaluu wuri kichcheeddawaa gidooppe, taani katsaa hinttenttu mehiyaanna laammana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Hewaa diraw unttunttu barenttu mehiyaa Yooseefow aheeddino. Yooseefo unttunttu paraa, dorssaa, deeshshaa, miyaanne hariyaa katsanna laammeedda; I he laytsaa unttunttu mehiyaa ubbaanna katsaa laammiidde unttuntta mizi shaachcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />He laytsay wurina, unttunttu laa"entsa laytsan aakko yiide Aa, «Nuuni nu godaappe k'osiyaabay baawa; nu miishshaa ubbay wuri diggina, nu mehiyaakka new sheed'd'iide, nu bollaappenne nu gadiyaappe attin, nu godaw atteedabay harabay baawa. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Nuuni ne sintsan ayaw hayk'k'eettoo? Nu gadiikka ayaw d'ayii? Nuunakka nu gadiyaakka katsaan shamma; nuuni kaatiyaw ayiletana; nu gadiikka aawaa gido; nuuni pas'a attana mala, hayk'k'enna malanne nu gadiikka os's'enna mala, zeretsaa nuw imma» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Yooseefo Gibs'e biittaa ubbaa kaatiyaw shammeedda. Gibs'etuu ubbay koshay s'iis's'i de'iyaa diraw, barenttu gadiyaa zal"eeddino; gadii kaatiyaawaa gideedda. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yooseefo asaa ubbaa Gibs'ew ha gas'aappe doommiide hini gas'aa gakkanaw kaatiyaw ayile kesseedda. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Gidooppenne I k'eesetuwaa gadiyaa shammibeenna; ayaw gooppe, kaatii k'eesatoo katsaa immeedda. Hewaa diraw barenttu gadiyaa zal"ibeykkino.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yooseefo asaa, «Simmi hachche taani hinttenanne hinttenttu gadiyaa kaatiyaw shammaad. Zeretsaa afiide, gaden zerite. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Shin katsaa c'akki gelissiyaa wode, ayfeeddawaappe ichcheshu kushiyaappe itti kushiyaa kaatiyaw immite. Ichcheshu kushiyaappe atteeda oyddu kushii hinttenttu gadiyaa zeretsaanne hinttenttoo, hinttenttu soo asawunne hinttenttu naanaw k'uma gido» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Unttunttu, «Neeni nuuna ashshaada! Nu godaa sintsan nuuni sabaa demeerokoshsha; nuuni kaatiyaw ayiletana» yaageeddino. <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Hewaa diraw, Yooseefo Gibs'en biittappe ayfeeddawaappe ichcheshu kushiyaappe ittuwaa kaatiyaw immiyaawaa higgiyaa kesseedda. He higgii hachche gakkanaw ek'k'iide de'ee. Kaatiyaawaa gidibeenna gadii k'eesetuwaa gadiyaa s'alala.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Israa'eeletuu Gibs'e biittan Geseeme giyaa saan utteeddino; unttunttu yan mas'uwaa demmeeddino; unttunttu yeletteeddinonne daro c'oratteeddino.<verse eid="GEN 47:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yaak'oobi Gibs'e biittaan tammanne laappun laytsaa de'eedda. Yaak'oobi de'eedda laytsay s'eetanne oytamanne laappuna. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Israa'eele hayk'k'iyaa wodii matattina, bare na'aa Yooseefa s'eesissiide hawaadan yaageedda; «Taani ne sintsan sabetteeddawaa gidooppe, ne kushiyaa ta gulbbatan wotsaade,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ne kushiyaa ta gulbbatan wotsaade: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guusay taana Gibs'en moogenaadan geppa giyaawaa.</char></note> ane geppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:29-32">Dom. 49:29-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:6">50:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Shin taani ta mayzzan gaketiyaa wode, taana Gibs'eppe afaade, unttunttu moogetteedda sa'aan mooga» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yooseefo, «Taani neena neeni geeddawaadan ootsana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yaak'oobi Aa, «Ane taw c'aak'k'a» yaageedda. Yooseefo aw c'aak'k'eedda; hewaappe guyye, Israa'eelii bare hiis'an guufanniide, S'oossaw goynneedda.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Minaasanne Efireema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Hewaappe guyye Asay Yooseefo, «Ne aawuu saketteedda» yaagiide odeedda. I bare laa"u attuma naanaa Minaasanne Efireema akkiidde beedda. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Aasi Yaak'ooba, «Be'a; ne na'ay Yooseefo neekko yeedda» yaageedda; Israa'eelii minettiide bare hiis'an utteedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yaak'oobi Yooseefo, «Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay Kanaane biittaan Looza giyaa sa'aan taw k'onc'c'iide, yan taana anjjeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">Dom. 28:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />I taana, ‹Taani neena yelettissananne c'orissana; taani neena daro dere ootsana. Ha biittaa taani neeppe guyye, ne zeretsaw med'ina laata ootsaadde immana› yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />«Simmi ha"i, ne laa"u attuma naanay, taani neekko hawaa yaanaappe kase Gibs'en new yeletteeddawanttu tawantta; Efireeminne Minaase taw Roobeelanne Simoona mala. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Unttunttuppe guyye new yeletteeddawanttu newantta; unttunttu laattana biittay Efireemanne Minaasa suntsan gido. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Taani Masp'p'es'oomiyaappe simmishin, Efiraataa gakkanaw laafa ashshiyaa wode, Raaheela Kanaane biittaan hayk'k'aaddu. Taani izo Beeteleeme giyaa Efiraataa afiyaa ogiyaa doonaan moogaad» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">Dom. 35:16-19</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Israa'eelii Yooseefo attuma naanaa laa"atuwaa be'eedda wode, «hawanttu oonee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yooseefo bare aawuwaa, «hawanttu S'oossay taw hawaan immeedda ta naanaa» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Israa'eelii, «Taani unttuntta anjjana mala, unttuntta taakko haa shiishsha» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Israa'eelii c'imina Aa ayfii labbaneedda diraw, s'eellanaw danddayenna. Hewaa diraw Yooseefo bare attuma naanaa aakko shiishshina, Aa aawuu unttuntta idimmiide yereedda. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Israa'eele Yooseefa, «Taani ne deemuwaa be'ana gaade k'oppabeykke; shin S'oossay hekko ne naanaakka taana besseedda» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Yooseefo unttuntta Aa gulbbataappe dentsiide, bare deemuwaa sa'aa gatsiide goynneedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yooseefo bare laa"u attuma naanaa, Efireema bare ushechcha baggan Israa'eeliyaw haddirssa baggana, Minaasa bare haddirssa baggan Israa'eeliyaw ushechcha baggana akkiide, aakko shiishsheedda. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Efireeme teefa gidooppenne, Israa'eelii bare ushechcha kushiyaa yeddiide Aa huup'iyaan wotseedda; k'ay Minaase bayira gidooppenne, Israa'eelii bare kushiyaa yediidde, bare haddirssa kushiyaa Minaase huup'iyaan wotseedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Hewaappe guyye, Yaak'oobi Yooseefa hawaadan yaagiide anjjeedda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">«Ta aawotuu Abrahaamenne Yisaak'i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">Aa sintsan hemetteedda S'oossay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Ta de'uwaa ubbaan hachche gakkanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">taana heemmeedda S'oossay,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Iitabaa ubbaappe taana ashsheeda kiitanchchay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">ha naanaa anjjo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Ta suntsaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">ta aawotuwaa Abrahaamanne Yisaak'a suntsay unttunttun s'eesetto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Unttunttu sa'aa bollan c'orattino» yaagiide anjjeedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yooseefo bare aawuu bare ushechcha kushiyaa Efireema huup'iyaan wotseeddawaa be'eedda wode dosibeenna. Hewaa diraw, Efireema huup'iyaappe dentsiide, Minaase huup'iyaan wotsanaw bare aawuwaa kushiyaa oyk'k'eedda. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yooseefo bare aawuwaa, «Ta aawoo, hewaa gidenna; bayiray hawaatte; ne ushechcha kushiyaa hawaa bolla wotsa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Shin Aa aawuu is's'iide Aa, «Taani eray; ta na'aw, taani eray; ikka wolk'k'aama dere gidana. Gidooppenne Aa teefa ishay aappe aad'd'i gitatana; Aa zeretsaykka darii wolk'k'aama kawutetsaa gidana» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />I he gallassi unttuntta anjjiide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">«Israa'eelatuu anjjiyaa wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">‹S'oossay hinttentta Efireemedaaninne Minaasedan ootso›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">Yaagiide hinttenttu suntsan anjjana» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Efireema Minaaseppe sintsayeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Ibr. 11:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Hewaappe guyye Israa'eelii Yooseefo, «Taani hayana hanay; shin S'oossay hinttenana gidana; k'ay I hinttenttu aawotuwaa gadiyaa hinttentta guyye zaarana. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />K'ay neena ne ishatuwaanna gakkiyaa biittaappe itti saamaa darissaade new immay; hewenne taani Amooratuwaappe ta mashshaaninne ta wonddaafiyaan akkeedda biittaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobi Bare Naanaa Anjjeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Hewaappe guyye, Yaak'oobi bare attuma naanaa s'eesissiide hawaadan yaageedda; «Sintsappe hinttenttoo hananabaa taani hinttenttoo odana mala shiik'ite.»<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />«Hinttenttoo Yaak'ooba naanaatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">ittippe shiik'iide sisite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">hinttenttu aawuu Israa'eelii hinttenttoo odiyaawaa hayzitte.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />«Roobeelaa, ta bayira na'aw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">neeni ta wolk'k'aa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">ta minotetsaw koyruwaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">Neeni bonchchuwaankka wolk'k'ankka ubbaappe aad'd'iyaawaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Neeni di'uwaa mala; ek'k'osa'an de'akka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">neeni ubbaappe aad'd'iyaawaa gidakka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">Ayaw gooppe, neeni ne aawuwaa gisuwaa kesaadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">ne aawuwaa gisuwaa tunissaadda.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />«Simooninne Leewii ishatuwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">unttunttu mashshay makkalatetsaw olaa miishshaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Taani unttunttu zoretan gelikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">taani unttunttu shiik'uwaankka uttikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">ayaw gooppe, unttunttu barenttu hank'k'uwaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">asaa wod'eeddino barena akka akka giina, <optbreak /> booratuwaa k'ans's'eeddino.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Unttunttu suulo hank'k'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">unttunttu mek'etsaa iitatetsaynne shek'etteeddawaa gido!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Taani unttuntta Yaak'ooba asaa gidduwaan laalana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Israa'eeliyaa biittaan tiskki ootsana.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />«Yihudaw, ne ishatuu neena galatana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">Ne kushii ne morkkatuwaa pillanttiyaa oyk'k'ana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">Ne aawuwaa naanay new hokkiide goynnana.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yihudaw, neeni wodalla gaammo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:9">Pay. 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">Sas'. 5:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">Ta na'aw, neeni shankkaappe wod'i simmiide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">c'ogottiide giseedda gaammuwaa mala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">Neeni asaa bosheretsanaw koyenna mac'c'a gaammatti mala.<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Ayissiyaawe yaana gakkanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">Kawutetsaa s'am"ay Yihudaappe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">deriyaa ayissiyaawanttu gatimay Aa gediyaa giddoppe shaakettenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">K'ay deriyaa Asay aw azazettana.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />I bare hariyaa woyniyaa anuwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">bare hare maraa muruta woyniyaa turaan k'achchana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">I bare afilaa woyniyaa eessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">bare mayuwaa suutsaa malatiyaa woyniyaa eessan meec'c'ana.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Aa ayfii woyniyaa eessaappe aad'd'i zo"ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">Aa achchaykka maatsaappe aad'd'i boos's'ana.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />«Zaabiloone abbaa doonaan de'ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">I abbaa doonaan markkabatuu ek'k'iyaa sa'aa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">Aa zaway Sidoona gakkanawaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />«Yisaakoore mino hariyaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">c'aaniyaa laa"u doonniyatuwaa gidduwaan gis bashee<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />I bare shemppiyaasaa lo"a gidiyaawaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">bare biittay nashechiyaawaa gidiyaawaa be'iyaa wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">c'aanaa tookkanaw bare hashiyaa hokisiide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ayiletetsaa oosuwaa ootsana.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />«Daani israa'eeliyaa zaratuwaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">ittuwaa gideedda bare asaa bolla daannatanawaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Daani ogiyaa doonaan de'iyaa shooshshaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">Paraa toggeeddawe guyye kunddana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">paraa ginddiyaa dukkiyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">ogiyaan de'iyaa hasuwaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, taani neeni ashshanaadan naagay.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gaadi bonk'k'iyaawanttun deshettanawaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">Shin ikka unttunttu k'atamaa kaalliide</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">unttuntta bonk'k'anawaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Aaseera ukitsay ordduwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">kaatiyaw I lo"o k'umaa immana.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Nifttaaleeme k'ashettennan yeda de'iyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">lo"o maratuwaa yeliyaa gen"iyaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yooseefo ayfiyaana yonddodeedda woyniyaa turaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">I pulttuwaa matan yonddodda ayfiyaana de'iyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">daashshaykka godaappe bollaanna zaa'iyaa woyniyaa turaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Wonddaafiyaa dukkiyaawanttu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">Aa bolla dooddeeddino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">barenttu wonddaafiyaankka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">dukkeeddinonne mayttiseeddino.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Aa wonddaafii min utteedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">Aa wolk'k'aykka minniide gam"eedda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">Hewekka Yaak'ooba S'oossaa Wolk'k'aama kushiyaa gaasuwaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">ne hentsanchchaa, Israa'eeliyaa Zaallaa gaasuwaana,<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Neena maaddiyaa ne aawotuwaa S'oossaa gaasuwaaninne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">neena bolla saluwaa anjjuwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">garssa c'iimmaa anjjuwaan, d'antsaa anjjuwaaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">yeliyaa uluwaa anjjuwaan anjjiyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa gaasuwaana.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Ne aawuwaa anjjuu beni deretuwaa anjjuwaappekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">med'inaappe de'iyaa anjjuwaappekka aad'd'ee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">Hawe ubbay Yooseefo huup'iyaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">bare ishatuwaa gidduwaan kaappuwaa gidiyaawaa liip'iyaan shemppo.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Biiniyaame bonk'k'iyaa walliyaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">Bare shankkateeddawaa wontta mee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">bare omoodeeddawaa omarssi shaakkee» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Hawanttu tammanne laa"u israa'eeliyaa zaratuwaa; k'ay unttunttu aawuu unttuntta huup'iyaan huup'iyaan unttunttoo bessiyaa anjjuwaa anjjiidde unttunttoo geeddawe hawaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'ooba Hayk'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Hewaappe guyye, I unttuntta hawaadan yaagiide azazeedda; «Taani ta mayza asatuwaan gakettanaw hanay; taana Hiitiyaa Efiroona gaden de'iyaa gonggoluwaan, ta aawotuwaana moogite. <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Hewekka Kanaane biittaan, Mamire matan de'iyaa, Maakip'eela giyaa gonggoluwaa; hewe Abrahaame Hiitiyaa Efiroonappe Aa gadiyaanna shammeedda gonggoluwaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-20">Dom. 23:3-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Abrahaamenne Aa machata Saara yan moogetteeddino; Yisaak'inne Aa machata Ribik'a yan moogetteeddino; taani k'ay Liyo yan moogaad.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:9-10">Dom. 25:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:29">35:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />He gadiinne an de'iyaa gonggoluu Hiitetuwaappe shametteeddawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yaak'oobi bare naanaw azazuwaa wursseedda wode, bare gediyaa pude bare hiis'aw shiishshi akkiidde, hayk'k'i aggeeda; bare mayzzan gaketeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Kit. 7:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Yooseefo bare aawuwaa anhaa bolla kunddiide, yeekkeeddanne Aa yereedda. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Hewaappe guyye, Yooseefo d'aliyaa shiishshiyaa bare oosanchchatuwaa bare aawuwaa israa'eeliyaa ahaa sawiyaa shittuwaa okkiide melissana mala azazeedda; unttunttu okkiide melisseeddino. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Shittuwaa okkiyaawe oytamu gallassaa kumentsaa wursseedda; ayaw gooppe, hewe gadiyaa wogaan oytamu gallassaa akkeedda. Gibs'e asatuu aw laappun tammu gallassaa yeekkeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Yeekuwaa gallassatuu aad'd'eedda wode, Yooseefo Gibs'e kaatiyaa golle asaa, «Taani hinttenttu sintsan nashetteeddawaa gidooppe, hinttenttu kaatiyaw hawaadan yaagiide odite; <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‹Ta aawuu taana itti c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'iseedda; I taana, «Taani hayana hanay; taani taw Kanaane biittaan bookkeedda gonggolo duufuwaan taana mooga» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw ha"i taani pude baade ta aawuwaa moogana mala yeddaarikkii! Hewaappe guyye taani simmana› yaagite» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-31">Dom. 47:29-31</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Kaatii, «I neena c'aak'k'iseeddawaadan pude baade ne aawuwaa mooga» yaageedda.<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Yooseefo bare aawuwaa mooganaw pude beedda. Kaatiyaa oosanchchatuu ubbay, Aa kaatiyaa gollen de'iyaa wolk'k'aama Asay ubbaynne Gibs'e biittaan de'iyaa wolk'k'aama Asay ubbay Yooseefa kaalliide beeddino. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />K'ay Yooseefo soo Asay ubbay, Aa ishatuwaanne Aa aawuwaa soo Asay beeddino; unttunttu naanay, unttunttu miizzaynne unttunttu dorssaa wudii s'alalay Geseemen atteedda. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Paraa gaaretuukka paraa asatuukka aanana pude beeddino; Aa kaalliide beedda Asay loytsi dara.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Unttunttu Yorddaanoosa Shaafaa matan de'iyaa As'aade giyaa udduma gakkiidde, barenttu k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, aw zilaaleeddinonne yeekkeeddino; yan Yooseefo bare aawuwaa yeekuwaan laappun gallassaa utteedda. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />He biittaan de'iyaa Kanaane asatuu As'aade giyaa uddumaan he yeekuwaa be'eedda wode, «Gibs'etuu ayaa yibbaata yeekuwaa yeekkino!» yaageeddino. Hewaa diraw Yorddaanoosa matan de'iyaa he sa'ay, Aabeeli-Mis'irayma geetetteedda.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Yaak'ooba naanay barenttu aawuu unttuntta azazeeddawaadan ootseeddino; <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />unttunttu Aa ahaa Kanaane gadiyaa afiide, Mamire matan de'iyaa Maakip'eela giyaa gonggoluwaan, Abrahaame Hiitiyaa Efiroonappe moogoo shammeedda gadiyaan Aa moogeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Kit. 7:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yooseefo bare aawuwaa moogeeddawaappe guyye, bare ishatuwaannanne Aa aawuwaa mooganaw aanana beedda hara asatuwaa ubbatuwaanna Gibs'e simmeedda.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yooseefo Bare Ishatuwaa Woppisseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Unttunttu aawuu hayk'k'i diggeeddawaa be'iide, Yooseefo ishatuu barenttu gidduwaan, «Ooni erii Yooseefo nuuna bare uluwaan morkkooppenne nuuni aw ootseedda iitabaa ubbaw haluwaa kessana koyooppe, nuuni waananee?» yaageeddino. <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Hewaa diraw Yooseefokko hawaa mala kiitaa kiitteeddino; «Ne aawuu hayk'k'anaappe kase; <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‹Hintte Yooseefo, «Neeni ne ishatuwaa nagaraanne unttunttu neena naak'k'eedda iita naak'uwaa hayyanaa atto yaaga» yaageedda giide odite› yaageedda. Hewaa diraw ha"i hayyanaa, nu nagaraa, ne aawuwaa S'oossaa k'oomatuwaa nagaraa atto yaaga» yaageeddino. Kiitay barekko gakkeedda wode, Yooseefo yeekkeedda.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Hewaappe guyye Aa ishatuu barenttu huup'iyaw aakko yiide, Aa sintsan guufanniide, «Nuuni ne ayiletuwaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Shin Yooseefo unttuntta, «Yayyoppite; taana hinttenttoo S'oossaa geedditeyye? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Hinttenttu taw iitanaw ootseeddita; shin hachchewaadan daro Asay hayk'k'ennan attana mala, S'oossay lo"otetsaw hawaa ootseedda. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Hewaa diraw simmi hinttenttu yayyoppite; taani hinttenanne hinttenttu naanaa mizana» yaagiide, I unttuntta mintsetsiide lo"o k'aalaa haasayeedda.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yooseefo Hayk'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yooseefo bare aawuwaa soo asaa ubbaanna Gibs'en gam"eedda; I s'eetanne tammu laytsaa de'eedda; <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Efireema naanaa, heezzentsa yeletaa be'eedda; k'ay Minaase na'aa Maakiina naanaanne I bare naanaa ootseedda.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Hewaappe guyye Yooseefo bare ishatuwaa, «Taani hayana hanay; shin S'oossay hinttentta maaddanaw tumu s'omoosana; I hinttentta ha biittaappe kessiide, Abrahaamew, Yisaak'awunne Yaak'oobaw immana giide c'aak'k'eedda biittaa afana» yaageedda. <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Yooseefo israa'eeliyaa naanaa, «S'oossay hinttentta maaddanaw tumu s'omoosiyaa wode, hinttenttu ta mek'etsaa ha biittaappe pude akkiidde biite» yaagiide c'aak'k'iseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kes. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:22">Ibr. 11:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Yooseefo s'eetanne tammu laytsaa de'iide hayk'k'eedda; unttunttu shittuwaan Aa anhaa okkiide melisseeddawaappe guyye, Gibs'e biittaan saas'iniyaan yeggeeddino.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>